  ('zcrm_1579374000034189068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, 'Per below member requesting change frm PSD to Redirect included her on 5/1 spreadsheet to Redirect and cancelled her w/ Apex.  I will let Sedera know tomorrow. and charge her difference in price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-22 14:49:33', '2019-04-23 12:30:00'),
