  ('zcrm_1579374000034112018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, '4-19-19 Juan is 48, healthy, no pre-x. Celeste is reading through PSDHC option now. She was thinking SDHC bc cheapest. Told her benefits of PSDHC and likes HSA and wellness. Thought he couldn''t fund HSA bc she''s on Medicare but that''s irrelevant. She also mentioned a 31 year old son who vapes/smokes. But, not going to worry about his membership right now. Reading up on membership now and will call me back when ready or with questions. Knows deadline is today and when I''m leaving. She''s on West Coast.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-19 12:45:24', '2019-04-19 12:45:24'),
