  ('zcrm_1579374000034116033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, 'Called in asking on how to submit his bills over to sedera for his wife that was just in the emergency room for AFIP and for Sedera''s phone number. I sent him the template on how to go about that process along with their phone number. Was very very happy that it was as simple as that and was very grateful that I was able to help her so efficiently. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-19 10:41:08', '2019-04-19 10:41:15'),
