  ('zcrm_1579374000034100021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553455', 'Brian Seivert', NULL, 'Brian called in.  Kidney/bladder issue, had CT scan.  was told incorrectly that he "only had $500 left" and he would be responsible for everything else.  I explained that they had it backwards.  He only has $500 of his AUA to pay and Liberty will pick up the rest.  I gave him Liberty''s number to contact them for coordination of care.  Could be multiple providers involved depending on results of the scan.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-04-19 08:35:58', '2019-04-19 08:35:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034100016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, 'Pleased as punch with the way Sedera handled his cardiac issue.  Was very nervous about them "stepping up"', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-04-19 08:32:32', '2019-04-19 08:32:32'),
