  ('zcrm_1579374000034116023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471284', 'Michelle Caldwell', NULL, 'Called early this morning around 8am, was not in office yet, I just gave her a call back and she did not answer but I left a message. She did not leave a message when she called this morning. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-19 07:45:32', '2019-04-19 07:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439212', 'James Backes', NULL, 'Member reinstated. Charged the $50 reinstatement fee and set billing up. Good to go for a 5/1 start after payment goes through on 4/22;
$100 Referral was paid out to Jane in January 2019 as initial start date was Nov 1. Removed referral fee since new start date is 5/1 but referral has already been paid.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-19 07:44:59', '2019-04-19 07:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034119013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034110004', 'Terri Deitlein', NULL, 'Spoke with Terri, she and her husband (Bill) own a Aerospace parts manufacturing company in Carson City, NV.  They have about 49 ee''s.  They had Aetna insurance but a way to expensive and now have nothing.  She really likes medical cost sharing.  They have AFLAC.  I am working with her to collect more info and data on the group and will take this opportunity step-by-step to see if we can help her.  Sent her an email on 4-15 about Sedera and our program and a group census form.  She replied on 4-16 and indicated she liked what she saw and will get the census filled out.  We have a call scheduled on Tuesday 4-23 to discuss.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-04-19 07:22:32', '2019-04-19 07:22:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034125008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Megan reached out to MPowering via Slack on behalf of Yen-Yen in regards to her having 2 TPA''s  and bills to be sent to HMA and bills that need to go over to ASI.  I gave her a call,  explained everything that I could.  I told her that I would send her an online form to fill out, I asked that one be for ASI, and another for HMA.  I told her that I would help get to the bottom of whatever was going on with these bills.  I also warned her that follow up visits aren''t generally sharable, she understood.  I also told her that I would be contacting the main person over at HMA/Apex in regards to her bills.  She was fine, just needed some guidance and direction. I let Megan know over at Sedera that I had touched bases with this member. I am also sending out a request to ASI for PDF and hard copies to be sent out to Yen-Yen, I confirmed contact info- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-18 15:57:50', '2019-04-18 16:25:55'),
