  ('zcrm_1579374000034120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Sandra called in to ask questions b/c at well womans visit abnormal cell was found.  So they scheduled further testing.  I advised that any further testing would apply to her IUA of $1000.  I explained what to ask for and Sedera need process.  Told me this was very complicated and that she was having a hard time telling her friends how plan works.  I advised her to just refer her friend to Wendy and to not to try to "sell" it.  She was very upset that I said that to her and said the she would speak to Wendy.  Asked if we were a "cult".', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-18 09:58:33', '2019-04-18 09:58:33'),
