  ('zcrm_1579374000034112003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', NULL, 'Member is going to get a biopsy after something unusual on initial mammogram. Sent her an email with instructions on how to use the provider search. Patti had a long talk with her about how to handle her situation. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-18 07:19:52', '2019-04-18 07:19:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034069025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 469 
Question : I need a list of doctors/hospitals that are covered under my plan.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-04-18 07:05:58', '2019-04-18 07:05:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034100008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085274', 'Richard Gulling', NULL, '4-17-19 Super nice and super appreciative of our service and how easy it is to understand and to enroll. He''s 100% in alignment with this and how it all functions and why. He''s choosing the $1000/$249 MPB GROUP option. He had Kaiser in the past and hated it but had it bc his boss was paying. Changed jobs and lost coverage. Earns around $53K or more, so not eligible for subsidy. He is planning to get vasectomy on his own as cash pay. He already learned through ins it will be $3K and as cash pay it''s $900 at one place he called. He''s going to research other places to see where he wants to go and for best price. I told him that will be part of his service once he''s a member. Loves it! He''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Was sent by Sophia Rickard then to Melinda Niemczyk since Melinda is member and Sophia is not, but I did speak with her and she clearly thinks it''s great as well. Sophia highly encouraged him to join. Completed app while on phone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-17 17:01:47', '2019-04-17 17:35:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601530', 'Perla Pimentel', NULL, 'Perla called in stating that she still has yet to receive her APEX card.  I sent a request to Patti for PDF and hard copy to be sent to her.  I verified that we had all of the correct contact info.  She also asked how she could take her son off of her plan, I sent her a member change form link.  I copied Patti in that thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-04-17 15:03:03', '2019-04-17 15:03:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034070038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716985', 'Jill Keim', NULL, 'Emailed asking what type of bloodwork will be covered at he annual wellness visit. I let her know that as long as the doctor codes everything as preventative than it will be covered. If it turns into something that is diagnostic than it will not be and she pays out of pocket up to her $500 IUA and anything after that is to be submitted over to Sedera. She also wants to find a new doctor and I looked up for her in her area that are in network and sent her over the lists. I also sent her an email explaining how to submit her bills if need be and how to present herself. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 14:26:20', '2019-04-17 14:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034071046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged on 4/17. Billing set up to start on 4/22. Ready to go for a 5/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-17 13:03:19', '2019-04-17 13:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034070033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy called in asking if a annual visit she goes to in regards to a type of cancer her got on her face would be covered as preventative. I let her know that anything in the nature would be considered and Injury/Illness. She has to pay out of pocket up until her $500 IUA and then submit her bills to Sedera. She also was asking about a certain mammogram if that would be covered, I had Patti explain to her why it would not and she was disappointed. We told her that I would send over an email with the list of the 64+ services accepted by the ACA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 12:56:25', '2019-04-17 12:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034071041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059109', 'Hanan Al Hajry', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 4/17. Billing set up to start 4/22. Good to go for a 5/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-17 12:37:16', '2019-04-17 12:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034071036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 4/17. Billing set up to start 4/22. Good to go for a 5/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-17 12:26:45', '2019-04-17 12:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034070028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Called in to get copy''s of her ASI cards sent to her, change her payment info, and on what to put down on her daughters college application. I emailed a request out for her PDF and hard copy cards, patti spoke to her about the college application that what her plan is for is for preventative only. So if anything happens to her daughter she has to pay out of pocket up to her $1000 IUA and anything after that will be submitted to Sedera. She asked for Sedera number. She was a little confused with how the plan works at first and after giving her this info she was little less confused and happy with the answers. Patti also told her she can always request for another welcome call at anytime to go back over her plan more in depth. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 11:58:49', '2019-04-17 11:58:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034071031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Member called and updated bank info over the phone. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-17 11:58:45', '2019-04-17 11:58:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, '4-17-19 Family of 6 with no ins right now. Paying cash price for everything now. Has an HSA and wants to keep it also wants to do HMA potentially as well. Did a couple STM plans recently. Price for marketplace plan is $1300 with $12,500 ded. Not willing to do that! So, just saving cash for everything. Has an accent, so used to other system. Likely Aussie or Kiwi I think. Family has good track record health wise. But, wife tore ACL last year and had surgery. Told him about pre-x. Also listened to my audio and another one online and click funnel. He has high blood pressure and takes lisinopril 10mg 1x daily. His Dr. is not showing in network but he thinks he''s willing to become part of network and will accept reimbursement rate. If not, no big deal. Wife will look to find dr. for rest of family with search tool. Ready to enroll tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-17 11:34:24', '2019-04-17 11:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034077033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466143', 'Taylor Davey', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-17 11:14:34', '2019-04-17 11:14:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034071026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, 'Member on the plan for 1 month. Referral amount = 0.00$', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-17 11:09:50', '2019-04-17 11:09:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034077028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359289', 'Jorge Zatarain', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call when her and her husband are both available. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-17 10:56:50', '2019-04-17 10:56:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034070023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, 'Julie called in asking for Sedera phone number to submit some bills over to them from an ER visit. I gave her their phone number and I also told her I can send an email with a form attatched on how to submit the bills with Sedera. She was happy to hear that we have a form like that to send over, she will be starting on that as soon as she can. Was very happy! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 10:55:40', '2019-04-17 10:55:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034070018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Melinda finally gave a call back and explained to me that the lab work was all from her annual wellness visit and nothing came up diagnostic and it was all preventative. She stated she got a letter from ASI saying that they will not cover it. I explained what could have happened is the Lab or billing provider might have coded it incorrectly. She is going to give the provider a call and see if they can look up her info. She has not yet received a bill from them, I told her as soon as she gets that bill to submit it over to Sedera and they can try and do some research on the bill for her. She was very happy with my help and said she absolutely loves MPowering. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 10:42:55', '2019-04-17 10:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034075021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-17 10:02:12', '2019-04-17 10:02:12'),
