  ('zcrm_1579374000034070013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925046', 'Susan Korzon', NULL, 'I called Michelle and all she needed was the cards to be sent out for her son''s dr''s appt. She was extremely happy that I was able to send a request out for her and she will be looking out for the email. Very happy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 09:33:39', '2019-04-17 09:33:39'),
