  ('zcrm_1579374000034070008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925046', 'Susan Korzon', NULL, 'Emailed IDCards to have them send a PDF and hard copy of Susan''s cards out to her asap. I will give Susan a call around noon to follow up with a message left with the Betty''s. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 07:59:46', '2019-04-17 07:59:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034071003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Member called in to make May payment. Another long conversation about the billing process.. could not understand why would we charge a processing fee if he uses his debit card because technically that is connected to his checking account and it should be the same as using a check.. spoke long and hard, trying to explain the difference... says it takes longer than a week for him to see the transaction goes through on his end.. after all that he processed the May payment using his bank account... nothing set up for reoccurring, so we shall see for next month..', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-17 07:52:26', '2019-04-17 07:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034070003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Called in to make a payment over the phone. Sunny is taking care of it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-17 07:33:34', '2019-04-17 07:33:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899026', 'Spencer Jacobson', NULL, 'The referral was never paid out.  Paid to James Marciano after looking into it.  Tyler was put in the referring field and there was not any information on him at the time.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-04-17 07:00:48', '2019-04-17 07:00:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033986051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, '4-16-19 I spoke with Brian and read the exact verbiage from the Guidelines for Maternity. I forwarded him the Guidelines to read and also told him it will be up to his doctor as to when they deem the date of conception. He will read the Guidelines and talk with his doctor.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-16 16:09:23', '2019-04-16 16:09:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034041053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990012', 'Annette Swanton', NULL, 'Annette called in asking on what to do with her hospital bills that were for an injury/illness and possibly what type of doctors she can go to for another incident that is also injury/illness. I sent her a template on how to submit her bills with Sedera and a template on a provider lookup. She was absolutely thrilled with the information I was able to provide her and said I was very helpful today! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-16 14:34:24', '2019-04-16 14:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034041048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Called in asking on what to do with their bills they have been getting and where to submit them, how to register for teledoc, and how to present themselves at a doctor, and last on how to look up a doctor. I sent all templates in regards to all questions asked and Johanna sounded very pleased with my help today and is going to get right on reading all emails. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-16 14:18:22', '2019-04-16 14:18:22'),
