  ('zcrm_1579374000033986046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162440', 'Michael Kava', NULL, '4-16-19 Trying to avoid paying for Cobra as long as he doesn''t have any health issues. Doesn''t know how much he''s paying, possibly around $500+ with decent ded. He''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Wants a May 1st start date. ReDirect will be best since he''s 59 turning 60 in Dec. of 2019. Choosing $335/$1500. Enrolling on Friday, April 19th at 9:30 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-16 14:02:53', '2019-04-16 14:02:53'),
