  ('zcrm_1579374000033986041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, '4-16-19 I spoke with Carly about her membership. She was confused since she didn''t recall that cancelling the MEC would cancel her wellness visits that her DPC doesn''t cover.  She has PCOS and need to see specialists for that. She kept her appt today and paid the discounted cash price of $50 today and will be billed $150 plus cost of the labs. In pricing out Co-Pay and ReDirect she''s still better off paying cash for those visits and then only paying $162 / $1500 for her DPC Plan with us and $60 for her true DPC. She needs to keep both for her health issues. Was hoping she could cancel something since she''s self-employed and can''t get financial assistance in any way bc she''s still a student. Not eligible for Medicaid. She was appreciative of me clearing up everything for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-16 13:25:16', '2019-04-16 13:25:16'),
