  ('zcrm_1579374000034041008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029375016', 'Jacob Walters', NULL, 'Dental office called in, in regards to Jacob asking if they are covered under them and in network. There is no info on here stating that he has a dental plan with us or anyone in relations with us. That is all they needed to hear and got the info they needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-16 08:52:37', '2019-04-16 08:52:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034041003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, 'Called in and just wanted to know on how to present herself at her yearly gyno visit. I sent her a template explaining on how to present her MEC. She was very happy with the results and ticket is closed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-16 08:37:33', '2019-04-16 08:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034013107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605343', 'Robyn Seaton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Redirect Health to email &amp; text  digital Id cards to member. Sending out today 2nd QR Life code for husband James also sending another one out for Robyn said she never received any cards. Changed her address to a P.O. Box address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-16 08:14:16', '2019-04-16 08:14:16'),
