  ('zcrm_1579374000034022021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, '4-15-19 Gerry has Type 2 diabetes well managed for decades. He takes Metformin, glyptozine, synvastatin and zanax 1x daily to sleep. Does blood work 2x year. He will need to find a new dr. here in CO. Was with Kaiser for 30 years and now since moved here it''s going to cost them $2000 a month! He''s spent $250K over past 30 years which only helped him get his meds all that time. He''s self-employed / ind. contractor always. Deanna is on zanax for flying, and etataloc (sp?) and flexoral for muscle relaxant. Setting them up with ReDirect for assistance with meds, new drs. ease of use, etc.

 Has occasional celebratory cigar on golf course or such. According to Access Guidelines I read to him, he decided he''s not a tobacco user.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-15 16:13:16', '2019-04-15 16:13:16'),
