  ('zcrm_1579374000034022013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, '4-15-19 Spoke with Rod and he''s given permission to switch her to ReDirect for May 1st to avoid this challenge for her colonoscopy which she''s planning to do next. Also informed Patti to make sure billing can be handled. Just left vm for Carolyn to offer ReDirect to her moving forward. Also asked John to help with MEC bill. He will see if they can re-price it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-15 13:55:15', '2019-04-15 14:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000034022008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654432', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, '4-15-19 Called Sarah and got her squared away. She was super overwhelmed by the initial Welcome Call that sped through everything and she wasn''t able to wrap her head around it at the time. She will redo the Welcome Call to get back on board. She never received the Apex card! She now understands to say she doesn''t have ins. for anything except the wellness visit. Sent her the Access Guidelines to save when has questions and also told her to download the Welcome Packet which helps her know what to do, when. She''s grateful for the help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-15 13:48:01', '2019-04-15 13:48:01'),
