  ('zcrm_1579374000033944003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355002', 'Linda Reely', NULL, 'Linda called asking what she needs to do to submit bills over to sedera after she has met her IUA. I sent her the link for submitting bills with Sedera. She was very happy with the info I was able to provide her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-15 07:41:15', '2019-04-15 07:41:15'),
