  ('zcrm_1579374000033911028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033921059', 'Crystal McVay', NULL, 'Spoke with Crystal and took her to mpoweringbenefits.org site plus my clickfunnel for education and presentation.  Covered all aspects of our program especially the wellness, telemedine and Sedera.  We downloaded Access guide book and I enrolled her through rep.mympb.com site.  She wants to know that the pap test is included in the MEC coverage.  I will check and let her know tomorrow.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-04-14 14:15:53', '2019-04-14 14:15:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033911023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076061015', 'Raymond Kordonowy', NULL, 'Added lead for Kordonowy.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-04-13 13:40:16', '2019-04-13 13:40:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033915018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740133', 'Soren Boller', NULL, 'Soren called in to request a copy of his 1095 to be sent to his email.  He said he just moved and that is probably why he cannot find it.  He wants this asap...I emailed Sunny to have this done on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-12 15:06:08', '2019-04-12 15:06:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033915013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, 'Good afternoon Wendy,

I just left you a voicemail message that you can disregard after reading this.   Carolyn Glah called in to vent about her experience with getting a mammogram through the PHCS network, because she had researched and thought she was doing everything correctly.  It turned out that what she found in network was the radiologist reading and not the mammogram itself.  So she is out $1300.  She realises why, she called after accepting the fact that she would have to pay for it because the facility was out of network.  But she said that the whole thing is very deceptive, and the process has been incredibly frustrating. 

Now, she is looking to have a colonoscopy done and she fears the entire process.  Adding to the fact that she says that she is in rural Colorado and there are no facility''s in network there, so she is looking at facility''s that are 100 miles away.  Carolyn was very sweet during the call, and has a great sense of humor about the whole thing, but she is very frustrated and feels a bit stuck.  She thanked me multiple times for just being an ear.

I have just an idea about how Carolyn can go through the process of getting a colonoscopy without all of this hassle, and I did not share it with her.  Would she be able to drop the MEC and have Sedera pick it up instead???  Just a thought. 

I told her that you would give her a call.  Thank you for all that you do!


Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-12 13:29:14', '2019-04-12 13:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033866053', 'Anthony Locke', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 4/12. Billing set up to start 4/22. Good to go for a 5/1 start.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-04-12 13:13:24', '2019-04-12 13:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033915008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, 'Matt called in because he wanted to make sure that he had done everything that he needs to do before going away to France for 3 months.  He was worried about the health risk assessment - I guided him through and showed him how to log in.  I also told him that if he gets sick or injured to make sure that he asks for the medical bill receipt in English.  He seemed very worried about possibly not having everything finished that he needed to before his trip.  I assured him that he has done everything right and that he can complete the HRA when the best time for him is. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-12 13:12:40', '2019-04-12 13:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033915003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885255', 'Azucena Soto', NULL, 'Called in asking about if her husbands eye surgery would be covered if not what is. I told her that is something that Redirect has to answer for you. I gave the # for redirect and tried to transfer her. I left a message with Redirect. I also told her she can go to the extra help page for the best contact. Very happy with the the info I gave her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-12 12:47:15', '2019-04-12 12:47:15'),
