  ('zcrm_1579374000033619016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716731', 'Brandon Mahurin', NULL, 'A ticket was made in regards to a claim, I called and left a voicemail.
Haley called back and stated that her bill is for an injury/illness and was about $300. I told her since it was not preventative she has to pay out of pocket until her $1000 IUA is met. Once met she submits the bills to Sedera and they can negotiate some of the bill down. She then started talking about telling her doctor to remove her MEC from the billing and she would get 30-40% taken off, which doesn''t make sense. I transferred her over to Ron who is the affiliate. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-11 14:20:10', '2019-04-11 14:20:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033839008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '4-11-19 Oldest family member is husband at 57 now. She may keep her daughter on school plan with CSU since her PT can be covered with a $70 or $90 co-pay each time. CSU says theirs will be secondary if another ins involved, but this isn''t ins. Either way, Michele isn''t going to risk the challenges and will just keep her daughter on the CSU ins. plan and may add her in Aug. or later if need be. She''s applying now for MPB Group. Completed enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-11 14:15:45', '2019-04-11 14:50:37'),
