  ('zcrm_1579374000033619008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Kathleen called in asking how to go about scheduling her annual wellness visit. I let her know I will be sending her an email with a link on how and where to look up a provider in network. I also sent her some tips on preventative care and how to present her MEC. She also wanted to know how much her plan was going to change come June for her renewal, I transferred her over to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-11 08:24:28', '2019-04-11 08:24:28'),
