  ('zcrm_1579374000033619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014658118', 'Gillian Ahouanvoheke', NULL, 'Gillian submitted a claim under MEC preventative care with medication and a bill for Eye care. I sent her an email letting her know that Eye Care is not preventative and not covered under the ACA. I let her know that she will have to pay out of pocket up until her $1000 IUA. Once she gets past that then she can submit her bill to Sedera as a "Need". I sent a template explaining how to submit bills to Sedera. As for the prescription I asked if it was a new diagnosis or a recurring condition. For that I told her that if it is new she will also have to pay out of pocket and if it is recurring then we can help her out for future price quotes. I sent her a prescription quote form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-11 07:51:36', '2019-04-11 07:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033612013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033866102', 'Susan Muenchen', NULL, '4-10-19 Just turned 47 and leaving job therefore losing ins. She has acute mils asthma, only uses inhaler in fall, therefore may be allergy but never diagnosed or determined. Lives in Carbondale, CO. Wanted Dr. Anne Goyette but not showing in network. She''s open to others. I sent her the Dr. list near Carbondale and the search tool instructions to find a new dr. Wants May 1st start date for PSDHC Assoc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-10 16:36:47', '2019-04-10 16:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033612008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, '4-10-19 She called me back and has no idea how she signed up for Aliera bc she hasn''t spoken with anyone else. She''s in TX helping her mom who just had a stroke. She will call me tomorrow hopefully before 2:00 after she looks at her notes to see what happened. It sounds like Aliera might be cheaper but she has no recollection of choosing anything but what I offered.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-10 16:17:42', '2019-04-10 16:17:42'),
