  ('zcrm_1579374000033571048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, 'Samer''s foot doctor called in asking info on his plan, she did not understand what it was and where she could find a policy number. I informed her that this is not traditional insurance and there is no policy number. I also told her Samer has a co-pay of $50 and I gave her APEX''s number to contact them to get any more info she needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 13:08:50', '2019-04-10 13:08:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033064', 'Michael Matyasz', NULL, 'Michael called in asking if his 1095-B form has been sent out from ASI. I told him yes it has been quite a while ago so and he should have gotten it, I told him Patti will send him a copy in his email, he was very happy to hear that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 13:03:40', '2019-04-10 13:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033612003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, '4-10-19 Husband has Type 1 diabetes/ insulin dependent so he will stay on traditional ins for $816.46 if stay with their Anthem HMO Silver Pathway X 2000. For entire family it''s $2397.28 but showing subsidy on their account that she said they don''t qualify for. They will meet the ded. for husband Stewart for sure. They bought a $10K insulin pump and meds are outrageous. Daughters both go to therapy for $180 and $130 every week as cash pay. Also paying $250 self pay for Vyvanse 1x monthly for 50mg 1x daily. She thinks she''ll put her and daughters on this and save about $1000 month!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-10 12:44:44', '2019-04-10 12:44:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc had called in to thank me and other Kelly and Leena over at ASI for how much help and relief we have given him with his medication. He was very very grateful especially, for Leena''s hard work she put in to make him satisfied. He also wanted to ask if he could get a home delivery for his medication for free since it is being covered by ASI fully. I told him I would reach out to Leena on his behalf to find out more info on that topic. Again he was very thankful for me doing that for him. Sent email out to Leena, waiting for a reply. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 12:23:09', '2019-04-10 12:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001014013', 'Robert (Mark) Hardin', NULL, 'Robert Marc called in furious with us that we are still charging him the $50 every month when he has been canceled since Feb. What we found out was he had canceled with Liberty and Liberty does not inform us when a member has canceled with them, Robert needed to contact us when he had canceled so we can cancel him on our end. I transfered him over to Patti and she informed him why he was still being charged, she canceled him while on the phone and told him he can get reimbursed the $50 that was billed out on April 5th 2019. Robert seemed to be more at ease after hearing that he is finally canceled and getting that refund. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 12:14:04', '2019-04-10 12:14:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033595018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001014013', 'Robert (Mark) Hardin', NULL, 'Member called in extremely rude said he has been trying to cancel since Feb when he went on Medicare.    Said he cancelled w/LHS at that time.  I refunded this months pmt and cancelled him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-10 12:12:29', '2019-04-10 12:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Sent out another email regarding the claim still being processed. Waiting for a reply. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 11:56:54', '2019-04-10 11:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033607003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Had an appointment set with Allison to provide her with a full presentation.  Got vm when I call, set her email.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-04-10 11:55:22', '2019-04-10 11:55:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033585033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032244040', 'Michael Forakis', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-10 11:08:38', '2019-04-10 11:08:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752446', 'Sabine Kortals', NULL, 'I spoke with Leena, she says that somehow Sabine''s bill was never rectified, so she is sending it back out to the network.  She saw that all codes were preventive in nature so it will be easy to get it paid out. I am notifying the member as well. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 10:53:22', '2019-04-10 10:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640011', 'Rich Piotrowski', NULL, 'Rich gave us a call asking if we can get him a new QR Life code because a while back he completed the Health Risk Assessment, used the code on his profile here, but put his wife''s name down. I told him I will create a ticket to get it rectified.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 10:22:00', '2019-04-10 10:22:00'),
