  ('zcrm_1579374000033571013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001347003', 'Tammie Place', NULL, 'Tammie called in HIGHLY upset on why she is getting a $50 charge through us when she "gets nothing with us and it is useless." I began to explain some of the benefits with us she cut me off as soon as I mentioned Liberty. She began to state that she also doesn''t get any use out of them either and that every single bill that she has submitted was just ignored and never heard anything back and all her bills have ended up in collections. So she stated she just wants to cancel everything. I transfered her over to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 08:50:44', '2019-04-10 08:50:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033585003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420053', 'Patricia Purdy', NULL, 'Mailbox is full not able to leave a message. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-10 08:49:30', '2019-04-10 08:49:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881395', 'Elaine Rampone', NULL, 'Called in asking what she needs to do with a back issue that she has been having for about a week or so. I told her since this is an injury or illness that she has to pay out of pocket up to her $1000.00 IUA, anything after that she can submit a claim and Sedera  can help negotiate the bills down. I sent her a template on how to submit a claim to Sedera. She also asked about what she can do if she is prescribed any sort of medication, I told her we also have a form that she can enter in all the info provided by the doctor and submit the form to us and I will do some digging to find the best discount coupon I can for her and she will just take the coupon over to the pharmacy the coupons are for. The last question she asked was what card does she show a specialist she has already spoke with and I explained again that she has to present herself as a cash pay patient and pays out of pocket, there is no card she is showing. She stated that the specialist will not give her an appointment if she does not show a card. Patti told her that what she has is not typical insurance and there are some doctors out there that wont deal with that type of client and that shes going to have to find a different doctor. I will also be sending her a form on how to present herself so she can have all the info we spoke to her about right in front of her. Elaine seemed very happy with all info given and will be submitting anything past her $1000 IUA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 07:58:21', '2019-04-10 07:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033571003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762009', 'Lori Keller', NULL, 'Lori called in asking how she can change her CC info, I told her I have a form that I can email her, I while on the phone, emailed her the form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-10 07:51:03', '2019-04-10 07:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033545033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, '4-9-19 She''s divorced from husband and 2 teenagers will be covered on his plan. So, Indiv membership. She has mild asthma and going through menopause. Takes estradial for that. Paying $600 now with high ded. Needs May 1st start date. Enrolling now in PSDHC Assoc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-09 15:04:37', '2019-04-09 15:04:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033545028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '4-9-19 She called to remove Gil from membership since now divorced. HomesFromGil@yahoo.com. She''s tried for 2 years via LHS without success. She wants to add new husband Kevin Forsyth and his daughter Alana Forsyth to membership. She was hoping to keep his son as well but he''s getting married in 2 weeks.  Even though he''s full time student he''s not eligible for Family membership, must have his own with new family. Told her to email info@libertyhealthshare.org to get it done since calling isn''t working lately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-09 14:50:36', '2019-04-09 14:50:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005039', 'Ryan Richards', NULL, 'Called in asking for his 1095-b form for ASI, transferred over to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 14:39:09', '2019-04-09 14:39:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008438003', 'Maria Francisco', NULL, 'Called into the Betty''s stating she was returning a call. John has worked many times in the past with her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 14:33:41', '2019-04-09 14:33:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033545023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377297', 'Nancy Hazelrigg', NULL, '4-9-19 Losing Cobra June 30th. We have appt set for June 6th to enroll in ReDirect $1500/$507. Lives in FC and her doctor Kristine Durran told her about medical cost sharing and she then found Sedera on her own. Was a Financial Advisor so understands it all pretty well. She has 4 compressed discs in her back and doing PT for it now. Also has thyroid meds and occasional depression meds. Knows pre-x clause especially for back. Thinks this is such a better option! Wants to send her friends to me assuming they don''t have any major pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-09 14:18:16', '2019-04-09 14:18:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212188', 'Shawn Valentine', NULL, 'Called in wanting to cancel with the My Academy portion of her plan but still keep Liberty. I sent her the cancellation form and gave her Liberty''s number to call them and let them know. Very happy with info provided. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 14:03:06', '2019-04-09 14:03:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, 'Called in asking to speak to John about a claim she emailed him about sometime last week, I had her email me all the info that was needed and forwarded it over to John. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 13:54:43', '2019-04-09 13:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033525028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881409', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted change of address Member Change form.  Will notify Sedera &amp; ASi &amp; change in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-09 13:41:45', '2019-04-09 13:43:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Called in asking if a procedure for her acid reflux would be covered and I stated it would not because it is not preventative in nature. She has to pay out of pocket up to her $500 IUA and then submit everything else as a "Need". She also asked what she has to do to call TeleDoc. I sent her the template on how to register with Teledoc. Was very happy with all info provided. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 13:05:09', '2019-04-11 11:37:29'),
