  ('zcrm_1579374000033545008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574112', 'Brianne Spitz', NULL, '4-9-19 Bree is 37, Ryan is 35, kids 1,3,5. Husband is an ultra marathoner and never gets sick or injured. Bree has autoimmune Grave''s Disease which means hypothyroid and takes meds to manage. Hasn''t needed to see her endocrinologist for long time (years) since it''s been so well managed. They are buying a house now so choosing the $2500/$537 option until they have more money. Might change to $1500 when Assoc renews.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-09 12:45:10', '2019-04-09 12:45:10'),
