Left a VM for Sally.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-04-09 11:53:47', '2019-04-09 11:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Called in asking on how to present her ASI card because she was in the womens wellness visit while on the phone with me. She was also asking is mamograms are covered and bloodwork. I walked her through the proccess and sent her a template on how to present her card. I also emailed Wendy to let her know that Sandra is only 1 month in and not waiting the 90 day period to go to the wellness visits. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 11:52:09', '2019-04-09 11:52:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819148', 'Justin St Germain', NULL, 'Justin called in asking to have his daughter''s birthday corrected over at APEX/RCI and his wife''s first name spelled corrected. He also asked to request a PDF and hard copy of his insurance cards sent out. I called Shelley and left a message and also emailed her with all the correct info. Shelley emailed back and asked for all corrected info to be sent via the Web. I forwarded Shelley''s info over to Patti to send through her portal. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 11:51:31', '2019-04-09 11:51:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in to say that her daughter had to go to the ER again for the same issue that she did last time.  A need has already been opened up for the first time and Bridget was helping her out then, so I told her it would be good to contact Bridget again.  She said that her daughter has been having neurological issues.  She thanked me for my help and told me that she would send Bridget an email. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 11:22:03', '2019-04-09 11:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033529026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459001', 'Jessica Tabachnik', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-04-09 11:06:44', '2019-04-09 11:06:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033544018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005203', 'Mark DellaPosta', NULL, 'Mark emailed asking for a copy of his insurance cards because he was at the doctors office. I emailed ASI about sending a PDF and hard copy sent over to him. I tagged Mark in the email I sent over to ASI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 11:03:11', '2019-04-09 11:03:11'),
