  ('zcrm_1579374000033544013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508001', 'Emily Essig', NULL, 'Emily submitted a claim for her child''s well visit, I had emailed and shared with Leena to have her look into it. Leena emailed back and said she sent it over to her claims dept and will make sure she gets reimbursed since she has already paid for everything. Just waiting to hear back about the status. I emailed Emily with what Leena had sent. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 11:01:24', '2019-04-09 11:01:24'),
