  ('zcrm_1579374000033544008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881409', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, 'Called in asking for help to look up a doctor for pediatrics ear, nose, and throat. I told her that there is no network for something along those lines because it is for injury or illness. I told her it would be out of pocket up to her $1000 IUA. She also needed to update her address from moving. I sent her the multiplan template, an email with the healthgrades link, an update address form, and a template on how to submit bills to Sedera. She was very happy with all the info I gave her! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-09 10:38:34', '2019-04-09 10:38:34'),
