  ('zcrm_1579374000033490018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874202', 'Laurie Boggess', NULL, 'called in because she thinks she has an ear infection and wanted to know the process of getting it treated.  I suggested that she try Teladoc first, she got very excited about that idea.  I sent corresponding email, gave her their number and transferred a call to "Heaven" there. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-08 11:47:03', '2019-04-08 11:47:03'),
