  ('zcrm_1579374000033276025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899005', 'Susan Maehl', NULL, 'Called in just asking some general info on how her plan works and how to look up doctors that are in her area. I sent her out a few templates giving her the run down on education. I sent her a provider lookup, sedera videos, how to present MEC, and how to avoid those surprise bills. She was very happy that I was able to give her emails and info for everything she asked for! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-04 09:06:24', '2019-04-04 09:06:24'),
