  ('zcrm_1579374000033212076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, 'called in wondering how to fill in the sedera app to open up a need.  I gave him their phone number and left a message with Sedera to give him a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-03 14:53:57', '2019-04-03 14:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033212071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862222', 'Christopher Morano', NULL, 'Christopher called in confused asking for another ASI card so that he could go to his urologist.  I reminded him of the two types of care that he needs to separate his health needs into.  He told me that he needed to go to a urologist to have a cyst removed and that it would be over his IUA, I told him that he needed to speak to Sedera, and most likely go through the 2nd MD program. I gave him Sedera''s number and transferred him to Laura.  I also emailed him 2nd MD info and requested a replacement card from ASI. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-03 14:47:46', '2019-04-03 14:47:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601222', 'Ashley Markison', NULL, 'Member did not have access to a computer during the welcome call. Encouraged her to reschedule another welcome call if she needed further clarification to use the plan.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-04-03 14:12:23', '2019-04-03 14:12:23'),
