  ('zcrm_1579374000033135003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'called in asking is thermography is covered under her plan. When we said it was not she was confused on how to use her plan and did not understand why she was paying so much money for something she knows nothing about. Kelly C gave her the run down on how we work and what we do over here. I sent her a few emails on preventative care education and on how to look up doctors in her area, She is looking to talk to Jan about everything and see what to do.   -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-02 10:04:36', '2019-04-02 10:04:36'),
