  ('zcrm_1579374000033029058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185083', 'Pamela Leach', NULL, '4-1-19 Wants help enrolling. I just left her a vm. She was referred by Luke.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-01 14:11:13', '2019-04-02 09:00:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033029053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006333009', 'Allison Dutton', NULL, '4-1-19 She updated her income to reflect $31,921.82 from $36,921.82 once she reviewed her finances more closely. She might fund an HSA account to lower her MAGI again since that''s not taxable money. She knows how to adjust her income and update her plan now. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-01 14:08:02', '2019-04-01 14:08:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033047008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'I submitted medical records to Elizabeth for spouse Dave.  He is now a nonsmoker.  I asked Elizabeth to let me know when this is done so we can adjust the billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-04-01 13:48:19', '2019-04-01 13:48:19'),
