  ('zcrm_1579374000033029038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, '4-1-19 I just called and left vm to verify the referring member for Toni.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-01 11:32:36', '2019-04-01 11:32:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033029028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '4-1-19 Toying with switching to C4HCO bc APTC is about $711 and Bronze plan would be $0 but then $6750 or $7000 ded and mop. With MPB Group it''s about $3000 yr plus $1000 if something happens and $0 for telemedicine, etc. Also told her she can''t rejoin her current membership if wants to switch back later. Income expects around $26K. Sent her the Sedera Welcome Packet to review. Will send her the Welcome Call email if she wants to do it again. Told her to find a PCP and I''d look them up for her so she can get her wellness visit and mammogram done. She''s just nervous about how to use membership but Janet Ingvaldsen has been happy with it thus far. She''s going to figure out how to login to C4 and possibly select me as her agent. Told her I''d be away this week and can help her next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-01 10:57:06', '2019-04-01 10:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033029023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '4-1-19 She wanted to make sure she''s protected while in Italy where she''s doing a painting project. Since she''s with LHS she''s all set as long as submits bill in English and USD. She also asked about Sedera but since she''s 62 I told her it''s best to stay put. She just received a bunch of checks for reimbursements in the mail for stuff from Aug and Oct. Knows it takes time but it willing to stick with it for now. Also willing to keep $50 for now unless $ gets really tight in future. Appreciates my honesty with options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-04-01 10:53:18', '2019-04-01 10:53:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033058013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335359', 'Benjamin Roth', NULL, 'called for a replacement APEX card- sent a request to Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-01 10:49:19', '2019-04-01 10:49:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033058008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Katrina called in for a replacement ASI card, I also sent her a prescription medication quote form and instructions on how to register for Teladoc. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-01 10:44:14', '2019-04-01 10:44:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000033058003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592190', 'Irene Evans', NULL, 'I helped Irene out with 2 different medications. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-04-01 10:36:35', '2019-04-01 10:36:35'),
