  ('zcrm_1579374000032974003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171274', 'Diane Thomason', NULL, 'Diane was referred by Therese McCarthy. Her name was not listed as the referrer, so I added it in the field, and am planning to personally pay her the $100 referral fee.... Jennie, can you please check on this to see if the fee was already paid to me?  And if not, could it be paid directly to Therese instead?  Thanks.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2019-03-29 16:01:33', '2019-03-29 16:01:33'),
