  ('zcrm_1579374000032942013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000272', 'Katelyn Doty', NULL, 'Updated payment information.  Her boss is paying for her membership.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-03-29 12:26:31', '2019-03-29 12:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032954031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'gave Steven an update on his bill per Jennie. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-29 12:26:14', '2019-03-29 12:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032954023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'This is Marsha''s response to what Leena said: Leena and Kelly.
Thank you both for trying to get through this. I downloaded all of the messages that you sent me. The script is really helpful. I wish I had had that when I went to Dr Dughi for my annual physical. I can also go to Dr Dughi and ask them to help re-code these charges as well. Carent will probably have to reach out to Dr Dughi and ask her billing person what these charges were about. I''d rather give them a heads-up and them know that these will be coming from Carent ,so that her billing person is prepared. Your thoughts? Again, thank you so much for being supportive and available. Most health insurance companies are not. I hope this works out!
I so appreciate this!
Marsha Huber
-KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-29 10:44:13', '2019-03-29 10:44:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032954018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'I got a response back from Leena and she is working on the case as we speak, she was able to get in contact with Carent the billing dept. with her doctors office. She was able to get her account put on hold for 30 days. Leena told them to re submit the preventative portion of the bills so it gets covered. She was able to find that some of the bill was diagnostic in nature due to injections for a diagnostic health condition. I forwarded the message over to Marsha. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-29 10:40:22', '2019-03-29 10:40:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032954013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, 'Samantha called in asking if the email she got from her doctor was in regards to a yearly check up because it was worded strangely. I said yes that is what it means and she asked if she was on the right page to look up doctors on MultiPlan I said yes that is correct. Her last question was if her husband who is under her is supposed to have a separate account or email. I told her since she is the primary on the account and he is under her that no he does not need a separate account and that he should have a card of his own with her name at the top and he can use the same website for doctors. She stated I answered all of her questions and she would get back to me on if her husband has the card, if not I said I can send out a request to send him one, very satisfied! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-29 10:32:45', '2019-03-29 10:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032954008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Rachel sent in a message via Skipio and just wanted a reminder on how re-submitting a bill works for a women''s wellness exam works. I told her that if it is out of network then she is self pay and ASI may be able to negotiate up to 130%. I also suggested to her to try and stay in network if possible. She stated she has been going to this Gyno for year and year and is willing to pay out of pocket and asked to tell her how the submitting a claim works, I sent her the template on how to do that, she is very happy with the help! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-29 10:16:16', '2019-03-29 10:16:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032928024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Transferred her to Jennie to change bank acct info. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-29 09:52:18', '2019-03-29 09:52:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Marsha has sent in her cognito billing request form and is feeling very uneasy about the whole situation. The billing dept. of her doctors office is telling her many confusing things and that they cant help her. I emailed Leena ask shared with her what marsha said in the form and the 2 bills attached. I asked her if she can find out how the bills were coded and if we should contact the provider to re-submit. Waiting for an answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-29 09:49:20', '2019-03-29 09:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032928019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679122', 'Marty Kirby', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-29 09:19:37', '2019-03-29 09:19:37'),
