  ('zcrm_1579374000032928008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529333', 'Joseph Hartzell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Also transferred him over to Jennie to change payment info. Sending out today 2nd QR Life code card  for wife. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-29 08:49:13', '2019-03-29 08:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032942003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032244040', 'Michael Forakis', NULL, 'April payment declined for NSF.  Ran payment again at member request.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-03-29 08:40:30', '2019-03-29 08:40:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032894071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005005', 'Sarah Stoke', NULL, 'Member emailed the Concierge asking for info on the timing of cancellation &amp; pricing for just her &amp; spouse and 1 child.  I advised that family pricing is the same for any amount of children.  I also advised that the Group Renewal pricing has not been released yet and that there would be a mailing via email with that info', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-29 08:10:34', '2019-03-29 08:10:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032928003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029715015', 'Sherry Erickson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-29 07:53:58', '2019-03-29 07:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032870059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451023', 'Scott Ballard', NULL, '-28-19 Scott and wife 59. Have STM now for about $600 but marketplace is about $2000. No meds, no health problems, no tobacco, no drinking, self-employed. Learned about ReDirect bc biz consultant and was in AZ and learned about ReDirect then Sedera. Obamacare put his company out of biz. Read all about Sedera first and was super knowledgeable already. Ready to sign up over the weekend with his wife. PSDHC for now. Told him Provider Directed better when turns 60.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-28 18:39:47', '2019-03-28 18:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032862041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'This is a new member who is part of a group, She had traditional insurance until now and feels frustrated with this plan. John will call her tomorrow.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-03-28 16:46:10', '2019-03-28 16:46:10'),
