  ('zcrm_1579374000032870039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, '3-28-19 Looking at jobs and wondering what cancellation policy is. Told him month to month. He prefers this method of healthcare. So, he may ask if they can put $ towards this or pay for this instead of switching depending on what he''s offered, if he''s offered healthcare through a new employer. Just wants to understand his options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-28 10:53:40', '2019-03-28 10:53:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032894051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038331', 'Ari Newman', NULL, 'Ari called in confused as to how the needs process works with Sedera, he had already opened up a need and was curious as to how bills would be paid.  I gave him Sedera''s number and tried to transfer the call.  It went straight to an unavailable message and to a voicemail recording.  I left a message on Ari''s behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-28 10:39:44', '2019-03-28 10:39:44'),
