  ('zcrm_1579374000032854048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962039', 'Michael Farina', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Mailbox not set up yet. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-28 10:23:56', '2019-03-28 10:24:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032894043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002519033', 'Diane Bailey', NULL, 'Diane called in saying that our website was down, I told her that it wasn''t ours but Liberty.  She wanted to get tax information so I guided her to it.  She asked if she just submits her bills to us we will get them uploaded, I told her that she should just upload them to her sharebox, she said no, that''s something that John does for her, I said that she would be more than welcome to do that with John, if that is something she did in the past, but I did mention that the website and sharebox were having issues lately, and that her best bet would be getting a hold of someone at Liberty.  I asked if she wanted me to have John speak with her, twice, she declined, twice.  Also, I tried to connect her to Liberty, but the call would not go through and then went to a busy signal twice- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-28 10:14:59', '2019-03-28 10:15:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032854043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031004001', 'Terry Davis', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-28 10:05:21', '2019-03-28 10:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032894038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Marsha called in because she received a $1600 bill from a preventive exam she recently had, she called billing and they were no help.  I sent her a form to fill out for the billing as well as sent a script and preventive education.  She thanked me for my time and making her at ease.  She asked me if she was on the best plan out there...I told her that I would have Wendy give her a call. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-28 09:47:18', '2019-03-28 09:47:18'),
