  ('zcrm_1579374000032880008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, '3-27-19 She called bc she referred her friend Allison Piekarski who then called Sedera on her own and was told no Indiv. coverage and no MEC, etc. She was discouraged and told Melissa. Melissa intended for her to just call me to begin with but she chose to contact Sedera directly. I told her to connect us via 3-way email in the future to alleviate these troubles. She expects Allison to call me today to get squared away. I will also find out who she spoke with at Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-27 13:24:52', '2019-03-27 13:24:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032854018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, 'Renae called in because she couldn''t figure out how to upload a bill to Liberty because they revamped the sharebox, I gave her John''s direct line and told her to please share any instructions that Liberty might have sent to us. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-27 12:33:02', '2019-03-27 12:33:02'),
