  ('zcrm_1579374000032854008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called because she went to see an allergist for an allergy shot the other day and the person that worked with her told her that her that RCI, APEX, and PHCS wasn''t even a thing and that she would just bill her directly.  Monica wanted to know what to do so something like that wouldn''t happen again.  I told her that if the doctor is in network, and they are, and the process was smooth with the first visit, then the problem lies with the doctors office.  I told her that she needed to contact a manager or someone in finance to explain the situation and have some sort of flag stating the coverage that she has.  I told her that when she gets the bill she will send it to APEX as well as to ask how to pay the $50 copay fee.  She was so happy with my advice, she told me that she had printed out the script that I had sent her and handed it to the doctors office.  So sweet.  I told her to call back any time for help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-27 09:27:05', '2019-03-27 09:27:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032870008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001318001', 'Matthew Foster', NULL, '---- On Wed, 27 Mar 2019 10:42:48 -0400 Jessica Foster <jessicamfoster@live.com> wrote ----



Hi Jennie,

I''m writing because my husband Matthew and I would like to cancel our membership with Health Excellence. We are reevaluating our budget after going through bankruptcy and honestly have never used our membership once, so that is why we would like to cancel. Let me know what you need from me to do that - I''m hoping you can look up our account via our names as I''m not even sure where our membership card has gone! Thanks so much for your help.

Warmly,

- Jessica Foster', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-03-27 09:10:45', '2019-03-27 09:11:04'),
