  ('zcrm_1579374000032821038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Mary filled out a cognito form for ASI billing help, I sent the form over to Leena at ASI and asked if anyone over there has gotten the bill yet. I also emailed Mary back to let her know I am waiting for a response. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-26 14:24:51', '2019-03-26 14:24:51'),
