  ('zcrm_1579374000032821028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'Brian called in wanting a status update on his claim as well as how his preventive coverage works.  He was pretty frustrated at first, but wanted to know how his girlfriend should present herself at her appointment.  I took a lot of time listening and answering his questions.  He said that he understands now, but wishes that someone told him on how to do this ahead of time.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-26 12:49:34', '2019-03-26 12:49:34'),
