  ('zcrm_1579374000032821023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881315', 'Allisyn Martin', NULL, 'called in because she wanted to make sure that she was compliant with her plan, I told her that she was and that she would be contacted if we needed her to do anything else to ensure she and her family are compliant with the plan.  I told her that if I could figure out how to get into her US Corporate account I would let her know.  US Corporate was down. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-26 11:18:04', '2019-03-26 11:18:04'),
