  ('zcrm_1579374000032821018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Tania called in because she has hip pain and now a new diagnosis of hip dysplasia (both hips)  and now needs two new hips.  She said that she already went through the 2nd MD process and that the doctor agreed in the diagnosis and protocol to fix the situation.  Tania has had so many things done for her hips as far as treatments that she didn''t know what would be covered and what isn''t.  I transferred her to Megan at Sedera.  I sent the email on how to submit bills to Sedera.  Tania was happy for the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-26 10:23:00', '2019-03-26 10:23:00'),
