  ('zcrm_1579374000032821003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'from ticket-I emailed Alicia and cc''d Bridget at Sedera concerning this, I gave her all of the information that she needed to give Sedera and 2nd MD a call and get them involved in the process,  I gave her the main phone number as well as all of Bridget''s info and told her to give one or all a call and that she would be walked through the process.  Bridget has been in contact with her before.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-26 08:14:10', '2019-03-26 08:14:10'),
