  ('zcrm_1579374000032704038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692019', 'Douglas Kaplinger', NULL, 'Member called in twice and was sent form twice to Cognito Cancellation.  Asked me to mail form.  I told him I could not and told him I would cancel his account.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-21 14:37:58', '2019-03-21 14:37:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032692033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Linda called concerning Michael''s medication quote.  I explained to John that both Kelly F and I sent Michael an email on 3/19 asking for more information so that we could send out his quote and never heard anything.  I tried to call Michael and Linda on both of the phone numbers given and left voicemails on each. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-21 14:31:35', '2019-03-21 14:31:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032692028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'she called in because of a birth control issue- the wrong script was called in by the doctors office, then the right one and she just wanted to make sure the first one could be over rided so that the second one would go through with no charge. I told her to just let the pharmacist know, and maybe have the doctors office call in to explain the situation.  I gave her Welldynes'' number just in case, as well as reached out to Shelley via email. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-21 13:43:05', '2019-03-21 13:43:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032704033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to add spouse eff 4/1.  I will notify ASi &amp; Sedera and update billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-21 13:30:54', '2019-03-21 13:30:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032692023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001347005', 'Lyna Norberg', NULL, '3-21-19 Lyna called me bc she can''t get LHS to reimburse her for final $900 sleep study that she paid cash discount for. She''s working with Amanda Stevens AStevens@libertyhealthshare.org. BUT, she was able to login to her account and it''s now showing payment is paying out to member! She''s going to wait a few more weeks to see if payment arrives. It''s good sign that status has changed. Looks like Amanda updated account Dec. 27th to push it through. Lyna has already aged off of LHS and knows this isn''t my responsibility but didn''t know where else to go. She''s super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-21 12:31:15', '2019-03-21 12:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032692018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, 'Lauren called to see how she would be reimbursed for her daughters annual exam if the Cleveland Clinic is asking for 50% now and to pay the rest later.  She told me that she told them that she was going to be a "self pay patient"  I told her that was probably the reason, I sent her the script and told her that she needed to call them back with appropriate information.  I asked if she had found the doctor in network, she said she had.  I gave her the number to APEX, and told her to ask the contact at the clinic to call on her behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-21 12:03:21', '2019-03-21 12:03:21'),
