  ('zcrm_1579374000032692003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000638121', 'John LeShane', NULL, 'Valerie called in wanting an EOB from us because she has just lost her job and was wondering if we were the 50 dollars a month or not.  I went down the list and she got really interested in the billing help from John, I sent her a form to fill out and submit so I can give it to John asap, I sent the prescription help form, registration for Teladoc, and the mpowering.org site link so that she can look at what we have to offer with Sedera.  after speaking with her, I think that she would be a good candidate for a flip over to Sedera.  I reached out to Guy Travis to follow up with her. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-21 08:03:54', '2019-03-21 08:03:54'),
