  ('zcrm_1579374000032622063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839147', 'Ashleigh Bechtel', NULL, 'Ashleigh had many questions surrounding her broken thumb that happened yesterday,  as well as preventive care.  She winded up giving her APEX card to urgent care,  I told her that the bill would bounce back.  I told her to make sure that she was keeping coded medical bills, she found a previous email about how to open up a need with Sedera that she said she will use.  She asked about a mammagram that is scheduled for today, asking if she needed to reach out to Sedera first about it because she isn''t over 50 and that there she had something show up on mamagram 2 years ago, last year it was clear and now today.  I went through the pre-ex clause with her, so she understood.  Also I told her that because what she was telling me was sort of murky that I would prefer that she gives Sedera a call to see if this even was going to be a shared expense.  She understood that this may or not be a shared expense, and said that if the results come back with bad results that she will ask Sedera about her membership at that time.   She declined being transferred to Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-20 12:22:38', '2019-03-20 12:22:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032622058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012625006', 'Rick Willard', NULL, 'Jeff Kanter ask me to contact Rick about a group.  I called him today and his potential group is 5.  I advised him to use the Association platform for 5 or less.  We also discussed DPC and he has no interest in working that market at this time.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-03-20 12:10:54', '2019-03-20 12:10:54'),
