  ('zcrm_1579374000032622053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, 'Sorel called in wondering if a dermatologist exam visit would be covered by her ASI card, I told her that it would not. I told her that I was going to send along an email that contained a list of what is covered by her plan.  She asked about a well womens visit and mammogram.  I told her to be safe to wait on the mammogram because of her age.  She said I answered all of her questions and I reiterated the importance of my emails. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-20 11:30:13', '2019-03-20 11:30:13'),
