  ('zcrm_1579374000032622023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Tatiana called in about preventive care and having a mole removed at the dermatologist- I went over ALL preventive care protocol and she was shocked that she was sold this program with a completely different view on what she actually has, I asked her if she would like me to reach out to her sales rep on her behalf and she said that she would think about it, I sent the provider search email, and nomination link.  I told her that there would be no network for her dermatologist but that she would be able to open up a need if the instance went over $500.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-20 09:57:40', '2019-03-20 09:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032622018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522149', 'Ruth Lininger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-20 09:27:31', '2019-03-20 09:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032622013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'Karyn called in because she had no idea how to submit her bills for a dislocated finger that she has already scheduled surgery on for tomorrow.  I went over EVERYTHING with her from top to bottom- her IUA, emailed how to submit bills and open up a need with Sedera, went over who we are at MPowering Benefits, what ASI is,  the 2nd MD program and that she needed to go through service to ensure that Sedera pays the full amount.  I transferred to a nurse named Amanda over at 2nd MD,  I made sure that Karyn had Sedera''s number as well and gave her instructions to call them a little later.  I am also reaching our to Marquis this morning to ask him to reach out to her as well. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-20 08:21:39', '2019-03-20 08:21:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032607043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640041', 'Allison Adams', NULL, 'Member called in and left msg w/Betties about an accounting from last year.  I will advise that only MEC portion is duductable.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-20 08:09:48', '2019-03-20 08:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032567199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601325', 'Ellen Marciano', NULL, '$25 Acct Set Up Fee charged on 3/20. Set up on FTNI for a payment on 3/22 an start date on 4/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-03-20 08:08:44', '2019-03-20 08:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032622008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-20 07:54:02', '2019-03-20 07:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032567191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001678001', 'Susan Spicer', NULL, 'Cancelled due to 2 months non-payment', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-03-20 07:49:15', '2019-03-20 07:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032622003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004890021', 'Sally Sempek-Hoffman', NULL, 'Ticket created asking why she is still getting charged when she cancelled. I assigned the ticket to Patti because she said she would take care of it and cancel her fully. It looks like she only canceled with Liberty and didnt understand that she needs to also cancel with us. Patti is going to email her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-20 06:48:00', '2019-03-20 06:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032607038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004890021', 'Sally Sempek-Hoffman', NULL, 'Received after hours msg from member saying that they were still being billed for our services after canceling.  I will advise via email that we were not notified of any cancellation.  I will cancel subscription.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-20 06:34:20', '2019-03-20 06:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032597071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, '3-19-19 Choosing Co-Pay Network for $1500 / $368 a month. Almost done with application. Complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-19 17:08:14', '2019-03-20 11:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032597066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165390', 'Viki Lawrence', NULL, '3-19-19 She had her taxes done at some SR Center and they used something called Tax Slave software that was telling her the income with the sale of land was now causing her income to be at 401% of poverty level. They adjusted some items and it dropped to 399% which eliminated 100% of the tax penalty of about $10K. I told her that''s not how the subsidies work since they work on a sliding scale and for various time periods of your income. I told her to bring it to another trusted accountant not using that software to get another opinion so she isn''t penalized a few years down the road. Sold land in May so even first 4-5 months of year her income was still low. Accountant should be able to help adjust this better.  She was appreciative and thought it seemed strange as well. Knows she can file an adjustment if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-19 16:26:37', '2019-03-19 16:26:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032597061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032612116', 'Kelly Kinnear', NULL, '3-19-19 Mark chose to use Aliera bc they can have membership for the entire family for $801 a month and he says his tobacco usage is not an issue. Told him to be careful of the guidelines and limitations and make certain about tobacco limitations. He said he''s reach out if their finances are better or if it doesn''t work for them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-19 16:12:20', '2019-03-19 16:12:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032597053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032561377', 'Kristi Celico', NULL, '3-19-19 55 and mostly healthy. Is currently a LHS member and displeased bc they will Never answer or return phone calls and she keeps trying. She had achy joints and takes gabapentin, hypothyroid and takes levothyroxine and used to have high iron count but that''s been clear for 3 years now. Goes to Dr. maybe 1x per year. Curious if can use Teladoc for meds for thyroid. Told her I''m not sure. Also wants dental and possibly vision. Sent her DDP option and her ortho Dr. Prentice is in the Nationwide network. She may skip vision for this year since just took care of exam and glasses, etc.  Enrolling for PSDHC now. Chose $1000 / $340.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-19 15:46:16', '2019-03-19 16:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032610008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679315', 'Robert Neufeld', NULL, 'Spoke to Robert 2 times today and went over the Partially Self Directed Plan and discussed the quotes and IUA specifically with him.  Going to speak to wife tonight and possibly enroll tonight....Per Ron Patterson...changed the lead to myself and Guy Travis as producer.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-03-19 15:02:43', '2019-03-19 15:02:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032597048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165390', 'Viki Lawrence', NULL, '3-19-19 Left vm to try to answer her question about subsidy and sale of property in 2018. She states she''s being told she''ll owe $10K in subsidy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-19 15:00:29', '2019-03-19 15:00:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032567186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217005', 'Kimberly Carpenter', NULL, 'New Plan: Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-19 13:34:04', '2019-03-19 13:34:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032567181', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217005', 'Kimberly Carpenter', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to add son eff 4/1 I will notify Sedera and add in Apex.  Also update billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-19 13:28:29', '2019-03-19 13:28:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032567176', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601530', 'Perla Pimentel', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $2500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-19 13:21:48', '2019-03-19 13:21:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032607033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Lori called in because Katherine was in the hospital due to something wrong with her urethera,  she tried Teladoc, she wasn''t found, she went to GP for $100 that didn''t work, she ended up in the ER in so much pain.  Her mother is going to pick her up and surgery is in the morning.  I sent the prescription medication quote form for her to fill out later,  Teladoc instructions, I told her that she would have to make her own profile because she is over 18, I gave Sedera''s number and transferred Lori to Rudy. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-19 13:20:08', '2019-03-19 13:20:08');
