  ('zcrm_1579374000032607008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870100', 'Kelly Henson Renoud', NULL, 'Winston called in confused again about us and Sedera, he is anxious about his bills being paid on time and not going to collections.  I told him the best person to talk with was going to be Thomas at Sedera, but he still thought that I would be able to see all of the billing that he was sending in.   I tried to transfer the call, it went straight to voicemail, I left a message and then left a message for Thomas on Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-19 10:47:52', '2019-03-19 10:47:52'),
