Hi Sunny, 

Thank you for the email. Any additional charge regarding Liberty RX was never explained to me. I am unaware of any additional cost for that service. I do not use any type of prescription on a regular basis. With all the ways to save on RX now a days I cannot justify paying $27.50/month for a service I will hardly use. Please discontinue this add-on. 

Thank you,

~Deb
Cancelling on FTNI and will contact Sedera', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-03-19 08:01:23', '2019-03-19 08:01:23'),
