  ('zcrm_1579374000032593003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006274031', 'Lauri Hamsher', NULL, 'Member hasn''t been charged for Tobacco use since May 2018. FTNI updated and send her an email letting her know that $45 will be added to her monthly share amount immediately.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-03-18 12:55:41', '2019-03-18 12:55:41'),
