  ('zcrm_1579374000032591003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013778010', 'Rachel Wright', NULL, 'Per John this member''s 1095 was in error.  I tried to call Shelene Jackson but she is not in today.  I sent email instead.  1095 reflects Rachel &amp; all but one of her children were removed from plan eff 6/1/2018.  I requested Shelene to reissue and check on coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-18 12:48:28', '2019-03-18 12:48:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032586016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158474173', 'Stacey Gilmore', NULL, '3-18-19 She''s 39 and quitting job in 2nd week of April to become self-employed. She has Hashimotos and Thyroiditis. She seems functional medicine doctor to manage disease. Let her know the preventive/maintenance items of her disease costs will never be shared. So, the Co-Pay Network plan is best so she can see an in-network doctor for labs and possible endoscopy in future. At her age the $500 IUA looks like best option at $344 a month. Luke asked to waive $100 fee but need to ask Rod his newest policy for this since not implemented yet. Stacey is planning to pay fee since I didn''t mention waiving it. She came via Luke''s chiropractor''s friend.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-18 12:42:43', '2019-03-18 12:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032566043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919118', 'Ellen Denny', NULL, 'Ellen called in from the hospital not knowing what to do about how billing works, and because she didn''t want to stay in the hospital just because the staff was "being lazy".  I told her about her IUA , gave her Sedera''s number and transferred the call to Reid. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 12:35:40', '2019-03-18 12:35:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032590003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, 'member called in with change of address.  Said she contacted ASI.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-03-18 12:22:08', '2019-03-18 12:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032566038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030403126', 'Amanda Singer', NULL, 'Called in asking on what to do when she goes to her annual well visit today because she still has not received her card in the mail yet. Patti emailed her a copy of her card, she also had me check to make sure the doctor was in network and it was. She also asked if there is anyway to send a more clear copy of the card because she can not read the numbers. I am going to call APEX on her behalf and ask them to send a PDF file over to her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 11:47:03', '2019-03-18 11:47:03'),
