  ('zcrm_1579374000032586003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '3-18-19 Has an indemnity plan now for $170 a month. Might choose the $5000 IUA for the $255 a month fee. She''s super healthy, herbalist, acupuncture, etc. She does body work and also trades for dental work. Found me via Jill Enriquez who is part of Next Door app. 51 years old and no health issues. Explained Assoc membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-18 10:34:49', '2019-03-18 10:34:49'),
