  ('zcrm_1579374000032566018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779423', 'Lela Glick', NULL, 'Ron called in just to confirm that he is dropped from the plan, I told him yes and will be effective on 4/01/19. He also wanted to know what the rate would be now with him gone. I told him Patti just processed everything and Lela''s rate will be about 249, half of what it was before. He was very happy to hear that and thanked us very much. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 10:04:48', '2019-03-18 10:04:48'),
