  ('zcrm_1579374000032566013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, 'Rachel emailed and asked if she should call ASI or PHCS network to see what lab work will be covered. I let her know that as long as the doctor codes everything as preventive it will be covered. I told her as well that she can cal ASI if she still unsure. I gave her their number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 09:56:23', '2019-03-18 09:56:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032566008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, 'There is a ticket created and she was in the ER on friday and needed her membership information to provide to them. She requested that we email her back and I did so. I gave her some detail on what to present to them. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 09:55:13', '2019-03-18 09:55:13'),
