  ('zcrm_1579374000032566003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362080', 'David Kimble', NULL, 'Called in asking about what the process was to see a doctor with a finger issue he is having and also with his wife having some hip pain. Patti walked him through the process and told him that there is no network and they can go to any doctor of their choosing. He also needs to present himself a cash pay patient. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 09:24:40', '2019-03-18 09:24:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032511017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411228', 'Emily McGill', NULL, 'called in to ask if we could pause her coverage. I told her that Patti would give her a call when she gets a chance . -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-18 09:02:14', '2019-03-18 09:02:14'),
