  ('zcrm_1579374000032518018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, 'Elizabeth emailed back this morning answering my question if she gets the fill 80g''s of Estrogel for the same price Reid gave me. She said no and asked if Reid can ship 2 pumps for the same price. I informed her that she couldn''t but could order more if she likes. I gave her Reid''s number to call for him to explain all this to her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-15 08:49:22', '2019-03-15 08:49:22'),
