  ('zcrm_1579374000032518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003496005', 'Matthew Stull', NULL, 'Matthew thought that we would be able to sign off on a years worth of free insulin, I told him that we cannot and why.  I reitterated to him that he had a great price through Reid and that he can order anytime and I also told him that he should call Liberty about this to ask if anything would be covered. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-15 07:18:36', '2019-03-15 07:18:36'),
