  ('zcrm_1579374000032495066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508039', 'Joy Spring', NULL, 'called saying that she had $2000 in bills for an acupuncturist, chiropractor and essential oils and supplements and was wondering if it would be covered.  I told her that Sedera wants members to let them know just before or just after they reach their IUA to start a conversation and keep them in the loop. I gave their number appropriate email and transferred the call to Marquis. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 14:57:27', '2019-03-14 14:57:27'),
