  ('zcrm_1579374000032495051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008628057', 'Anthony Belisle', NULL, 'Patricia with Tony on speaker grilled me with questions surrounding Tony''s colonoscopy- "what if this?...." and "let''s pretend...." type questions.  It finally came out the something was removed 10 years ago and his last colonoscopy was "clear" finally after 17 minutes of telling them that is this IS going to be coded diagnostically they need to prepare themselves to be paying for some or all of this upcoming bill.  I told her that she needed to have this explained by ASI by Monica or Leena and that she needed to speak to Sedera on this matter to possibly have it explained better in a different way. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 13:44:05', '2019-03-14 13:44:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111466', 'Ruscelina Ceiba Winters', NULL, 'ASI contacted me and said that they needed to just confirm Ruscelina''s name in the system and they are sending a copy via email and a hard copy through the mail. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 12:41:38', '2019-03-14 12:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962166', 'Tammy Dowdy', NULL, 'St Pete hospital called on Tammy''s behalf wondering what type of health care she had.  I told the nurse that Tammy had redirect health and that she needs to call them before she does anything. I gave redirects number, told her about the importance of the extra help site, and submitted a form of my own on her behalf.  I heard the nurse tell Tammy what I had told her. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 11:49:46', '2019-03-14 11:49:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032503008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082261', 'Christopher Oehrle', NULL, 'PD via CC.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-03-14 11:36:10', '2019-03-14 11:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032503003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082222', 'Daniel Oehrle', NULL, 'PD March via CC', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-03-14 11:30:52', '2019-03-14 11:30:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'called in flustered over tax/hsa verbage. I transferred her to Patti- I said that she might be able to help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 11:13:26', '2019-03-14 11:13:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called in a little confused on how to look up providers in network for her and her son to have a annual wellness visit. I talked her through the webpage on the phone and she still was having some difficulty on her end, so I went ahead and emailed her the template on how to go through the site step by step, she was happy that I could send her an email with all that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 11:02:07', '2019-03-14 11:02:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086068', 'Janet Nichols', NULL, 'Called in regards to file a claim with ASI. Told her the website to do so and was happy with the answer. She has never had to submit a bill before and just wanted info. Happy with the answer. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 10:58:54', '2019-03-14 10:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Patricia called asking if we could look up if she has an HSA with us. She was a little confused on how that works and Patti spoke to her to let her know that if she already had an HSA it can most certainly be tax free and can be used anywhere no matter what health insurance company she switches to, She was part of Blue cross and wasn''t sure if it all worked the same. She was very happy with her answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 10:55:43', '2019-03-14 10:55:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032466021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177461', 'Lynn Taylor', NULL, 'Spoke to member booked her 15 minute welcome call for Monday, March 18, 2019 at 11:00 a.m. eastern time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-14 10:35:22', '2019-03-14 10:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359037', 'Erich Bichsel', NULL, 'Kari called in asking to be sent the 90 day supply for her prescription request from the other day. She could only find the 30 day email, she was already in line at the pharmacy, I sent both coupons for Giant Eagle out to her within minutes. She got them and is very satisfied. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 10:28:58', '2019-03-14 10:28:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021486012', 'Kyle Sheehan', NULL, 'Kyle called in asking if I could send him the link for the PHC network lookup. I sent him out the template with all info via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 10:27:05', '2019-03-14 10:27:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032466013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439070', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out today 2nd QR Life code card for wife Amy. Not in front of computer at time of call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-14 09:46:29', '2019-03-14 09:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032495006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919118', 'Ellen Denny', NULL, 'a healthcare worker named Karen, called in in regards to Ellen''s benefits,  I explained them too her- I told her that Ellen was a cash pay patient up until her IUA is met with Sedera.   I told her that there wasn''t any network for Ellen and that she should be viewed as cash pay up untill she meets her IUA, but that should be discusssed between Ellen and Sedera- not Sedera and someone who works in billing.  She asked if there was a network that Ellen needed to adhere to, I told her that yes- for preventive care only, not for injury or illness- she asked if there was a network if Ellen needed to be hospitalized and I told her that there was not- university of TN medicine- 865-305-7352-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 09:36:42', '2019-03-14 09:36:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032493003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Employee Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-03-14 09:26:35', '2019-03-14 09:26:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032466008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member requested 2nd QR Life code card for husband Shawn. Went out in today. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-14 09:22:58', '2019-03-14 09:28:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032466003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266240', 'Diane Kelly-Lokocz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Diane and Jeffrey. Member not in front of computer at time of call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-14 08:21:21', '2019-03-14 08:21:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032455019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993367', 'Mike Santistevan', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Mailbox was full. Sent email to reschedule his 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-14 08:00:08', '2019-03-14 08:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032463003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881563', 'Juan Tapia', NULL, 'This information came from Dania- when one of Juan''s bills totaled under $500 dollars.  with the other colonoscopy bill combined Juan''s bill was submitted to Sedera as a need to be negotiated down. ***

Hey guys!

I spoke with our team today.  IF a member has a preventive bill for which they are responsible for more $500 (meaning after insurance has settled), we will negotiate on their behalf.  They will submit as a regular Need and add commentary that this is a preventive bill they need assistance negotiating.  


Kindly - 

Dañia Heffington
Dir. Member Experience', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-14 07:58:01', '2019-03-14 07:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032425026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, '3-13-19 He''s nervous about solvency of LHS and is exploring new options for him and his son. His son can join Linda with the MPB Group. Son goes to college FT in MN as Linda''s dependent on taxes. Eric is 62 now and ReDirect is best for HEP Assoc options. Cigna or Bright Health are best for traditional ins options. Silver plans are about $320-$354 if shows a $40K income in 2019. Will have about $25K in SS and $15K in rentals. He can also pull $ from a self-directed IRA but can live on about $35-$37K judging from last year''s taxable income. He is off blood pressure meds and cholesterol meds after working with LHS coach. Also on anti-inflammatory meds bc of pinched nerve in should. Had stem cell treatment on both shoulders and both feel great now! Self-pay is $185 at his Dr.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-13 14:56:13', '2019-03-13 14:56:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032444061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, 'Member called in regarding billing for an open need for Sedera.  Explained that she logs in to her account and adds additional bills to that existing need.  She also needs a diagnostic colonoscopy.  Told her to call Sedera to see if they will contact providers to arrange for the member to be billed.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-03-13 14:42:08', '2019-03-13 14:42:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032415043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791050', 'Phillip Mauger', NULL, 'I sent links to all of the info that he requested. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-13 13:47:27', '2019-03-13 13:47:27'),
