  ('zcrm_1579374000032425003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899398', 'Diana Pratt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not in front of computer at time of welcome call. No RCI card received. Putting in request. Has no QR Life code card either but it looks that we sent her out 2 different QR Life code cards before. Sent out today 3rd QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-13 07:41:44', '2019-03-13 07:50:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032422003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032416078', 'Pete Cenzano', NULL, 'Pete wants to meet at end of March 2019 to discuss Association program and Dental plan.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-03-13 07:21:30', '2019-03-13 07:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032415003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078069', 'Lauren Ankenman', NULL, 'Lauren emailed asking what info she needed for her taxes and if she needed a 1099 D form. I referred her to Patti and she is looking into it. I emailed Lauren stating that and Patti will get back to her asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-13 06:47:47', '2019-03-13 06:47:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032397013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032612116', 'Kelly Kinnear', NULL, '3-12-19 Mark is 57 and chews tobacco. Going with ACA plan with Friday Health Plans, HSA Compliant $943 a month to keep Dr. Susan Gayla Hamstra Ruff. Wife 59 and daughter 23 - independent, files own taxes. Neither have any pre-x and no tobacco. Wife just retired and Cobra will cost $2000 and was told UHC is around $1500 but told him there aren''t any Indiv UHC plans in CO so not sure what they were quoting him. Follow up appt on Tues. March 19th. Send instructions to join C4HCO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-12 16:47:23', '2019-03-12 16:47:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032397008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '3-12-19 Matt 45, Kate 35 and 2 1/2 year old born via home birth! They are considering doing another home birth 2nd time around. Know they need to wait at least 3 months beyond start date. They listened to the audio and have a good understanding. Matt wants SBC for MEC+ and Guidelines to give to another insurance guy to look over fine print. Sent him everything including provider search tool. This will be about half the cost of their Anthem plan which also has a $12,000 max out of pocket plus they are paying for an accident policy on top of it. They are active, fit folks.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-12 15:00:04', '2019-03-12 15:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032404018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359037', 'Erich Bichsel', NULL, 'Called in asking for another prescription form for his wife, she was in shock with how much everything cost b/c she is used to getting her meds for $3-4 a month and what we found was for $16. Sent her an email explaining that, that was the cheapest and the best we could find for her. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-12 14:38:22', '2019-03-12 14:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032404008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017948007', 'Roy Cranman', NULL, 'Called wanting to speak with Jennie about a bill sent to him last week sometime, I transferred him over to Jennie. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-12 14:33:47', '2019-03-12 14:33:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032404003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'Called in regards to help with submitting a billing claim. Tried transferring to Sedera and the call dropped. I gave him Sedera''s # and he will let us know if he got through, I also sent a message on Slack and waiting for a response. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-12 14:29:37', '2019-03-12 14:29:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032397003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516016', 'David Sims', NULL, '3-12-19 Healthy, 45, only thing is broke bone in wrist 2 years ago. Had back surgery 10 years ago and no problems since. Also uninsured now and sent him Natl Gen STM for rest of March. Choosing the $1000/$296 level. Enrolling now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-12 13:16:10', '2019-03-12 13:16:10'),
