  ('zcrm_1579374000032337018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126003', 'Christopher Martine', NULL, 'calling in requesting that I send him a list of gp''s in his area.  I told him I would email him that, as well as send other educational mailings. he is asking that I use the zip code from near his job 10001- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-12 11:59:24', '2019-03-12 11:59:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032345090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322485', 'Bodie Kulijian', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. member not able to be in front of computer at time of welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-12 10:39:43', '2019-03-12 11:15:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032360003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032331115', 'Stephanie David', NULL, '3-12-19 I''ve attached the Benefits Guide for Denver Public Schools and just spoke with a rep; I could do Cobra for up to 18 months at 2% above my current rate.

I have the CDHP 3500 Plan with Kaiser (pp 19 & 22)--I believe the monthly rate is $173.68/ month (p 22). This is basically a plan for catastrophic stuff since my deductible is $3500--I do get my annual wellness check and mammogram for that ;o).

So it looks like to me that I''d be paying $177.15 / month to make sure I didn''t go into bankruptcy if I had a major health event or accident.

I recommended she stays with Cobra since even more affordable than STM and HEP. Plus she''s hoping to get job with benefits as soon as possible. Not looking to remain working on own. She listened to the audio and would be interested in that if she doesn''t find a job and ventures out on own as entrepreneur in the future. Will keep my contact information for future. Also has HSA already and loves it. Pays most health expense to chiro who also does kineseology work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-12 10:18:55', '2019-03-12 10:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032345085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-03-12 10:18:34', '2019-03-12 10:18:34'),
