  ('zcrm_1579374000032337003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Sandra emailed me attaching her checklist form for becoming a self-pay patient. She stated that some of the things she clicked yes to she doesn''t fully understand. She also stated that she does not have an HSA account yet. I explained a little further what HSA is and sending her a link from mpoweringbenefits.com with more info on that. I am just waiting for her reply. I told her I can help her with her questions to the best of my ability. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-12 06:53:51', '2019-03-12 06:53:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000032236008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679258', 'Karin Schwarz', NULL, '3-11-19 Healthy, 27, just anxiety and hypothyroid. Likes to see holistic docs like Mary Shakelton. Had an HSA but company changed it to HRA this year. Company pays for some of her ins now but she is leaving company and was preparing to pay $700-$800 she thought! She''s super excited about this and about the fact that it will work abroad. She''s planning to move abroad for 3 months of more as  a freelance designed. Take meds for hypothyroid that she will try to get filled before her current ins runs out. Also wants dental and vision DDP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-11 15:53:23', '2019-03-11 15:53:23'),
