  ('zcrm_1579374000032096039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, '3-7-19 Dr. Drostan Baker is planning ahead for when he leaves his current job in late summer to open his own DPC practice. He''ll need membership for his family at that time. There''s only one other DPC in area which is inconvenient for their family. So, the PSDHC option is best and he LOVES the HSA compatibility to help pay for wife''s expenses and kids. He learned of Sedera from conference in Orlando, FL last fall at the Docs for Patients Conference. He plans to use HINT! He is excited about how it all works. He also mentioned Health Rosetta which is a group whose trying to make greater transparency in the medical world to advocate on behalf of the patients to receive better cost of care!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-03-07 16:30:02', '2019-03-07 16:30:02'),
