  ('zcrm_1579374000032067023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667171', 'Martha McKibben', NULL, 'Martha called in confusing us with Liberty,  I asked if she wanted to be transferred and she said yes- I tried to connect her to someone and stayed on the line for over 2 minutes trying to do so.  She ended up calling back, and asked who we were, where were located,  and if we were affiliated with Liberty.  I answered all of those questions politely even though she was condescending throughout, she then said "oh you are that group who still owes us money.  how does it feel to work for an association that steals money from people?"  that''s when I ended to call.  I let Jennie.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-07 10:35:00', '2019-03-07 10:35:00'),
