  ('zcrm_1579374000031855008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, 'Florie wanted to know how to go about seeing a doctor because she is very tired and has diarrhea all of the time and thinks that her gut is ill.  She wants to get special blood testing to evaluate levels.  I told her that she could do that, to open up a need, to speak with Sedera.  I sent her info about directlabs.com and explained how it works. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-03-01 12:10:13', '2019-03-01 12:10:13'),
