  ('zcrm_1579374000031768023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013427005', 'Amber Schorie', NULL, 'Amber called in again to get reasured with the billing process.  I told her that she shouldn''t put a copy of her ASI card to appease the provider that is requesting insurance info for a illness/injury visit.  I also urged her to reach out to Sedera with questions such as this.  She declined me transferring her. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-28 10:47:02', '2019-02-28 10:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031763026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584125', 'Brian Schiller', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-28 10:27:45', '2019-02-28 10:27:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031763018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466001', 'Alyona Tsutskova', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member didn''t receive RCI card. Putting in request for that. Wasn''t aware for injury or illness is per incident. Wanted to know if a Thermography is covered under preventative care. Check into it. It is not covered told member that. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-28 10:05:15', '2019-02-28 10:17:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031763013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-28 09:55:32', '2019-02-28 09:55:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031768018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'He called in pretty upset that he does not have his 1095 yet, he said that there is no excuse for the fact that he doesn''t have it yet.  I told him that he should be getting it today, if not tomorrow.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-28 09:48:37', '2019-02-28 09:48:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031768013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called in upset about a preventive bill.  I told him that I would email him a form to fill out and I would send it to ASI on his behalf to gain some understanding. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-28 09:22:39', '2019-02-28 09:22:39'),
