  ('zcrm_1579374000031768008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010220053', 'Matthew Freije', NULL, 'Matthew called in pretty confused about who to speak to in regards to a preventive visit that turned into finding out that there were underlying cardiac issues, he gave the facility his ASI card to see if it would work or not, he was admittedly confused and felt bad for calling in, I told him that it was fine, I explained the two different category''s of health care.   I gave him Sedera''s number and transferred him to Elizabeth- I told her that Matthew was having a hard time. He said he needed to have a procedure by next week.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-28 09:02:44', '2019-02-28 09:02:44'),
