  ('zcrm_1579374000031691088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Patricia called in confused about the multiplan search and thinking that an email she received was from me, but in fact it wasn''t.  More hand holding, sweet lady- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-27 14:49:50', '2019-02-27 14:49:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031691083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419076', 'Dana Michie', NULL, 'Dana called in with her husband very upset that payment was declined and then said they called in and left a message to resolve this and no one responded. I told Dana that Jennie would give her a call first thing in the morning.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-27 14:27:49', '2019-02-27 14:27:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031691078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977340', 'Theresa Moore', NULL, 'Theresa called in wanting to learn about her medical coverage stating that all she has received is Teladoc info and the doctor that she spoke with sent her prescriptions to a walgreens that was no longer in buisness.  She said that she signed up for medical and dental insurance.  Also the address and entire phone number was incorrect.  I gave this to John''s attention, Kelly looked through all of the signups from RREMC and could not find her application anywhere. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-27 14:15:37', '2019-02-27 14:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031691073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013427005', 'Amber Schorie', NULL, 'Amber called in wondering where to submit a lab bill for a preventive visit, as well as bills her son has accumulated for "stitches" in his leg- she then told me that said that one of the bills was for a $1700 MRI? I told her that she really needed to speak to Sedera, and that we usually ask our members to contact Sedera just before OR if you know that you are going to go over your IUA- I told her that it is hard to negotiate a bill that has already been paid.  I tried to transfer the call to Sedera but left a voicemail on Amber''s behalf instead. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-27 13:59:51', '2019-02-27 13:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031691068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'Kallie called in confused over what TPA she had- I think that she had HMA at the time, I told her to fill out a form and we will do some research on it.  She also said that the card  was not covering her generic birth control.  I told her that I would reach out to Shelley over at RCI to figure all of this out. Send corresponding emails.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-27 13:49:12', '2019-02-27 13:49:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031691063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, 'Dayna called in very upset that she has''t heard anything from Redirect and she has been trying to use the service going on 2 months now.  No contact, no response- we have tried using the extra help page and gotten no response.  Jennie ended up speaking with Dayna, reached out to everybody at Redirect for this problem to be rectified. Waiting on a response from Redirect.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-27 12:34:41', '2019-02-27 12:34:41'),
