  ('zcrm_1579374000031679071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116123', 'Ronald Levis', NULL, 'I had an after hours call from member''s wife asking questions re: when to pay for what.  She advised me that the member had contracted Malaria and had roughly $1200 bills.  Also there is a discrepancy in the IUA.  After looking Member put in $1000 on our app and $500 in the Sedera app. I will email member and advise that I will be charging the difference', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-27 06:34:53', '2019-02-27 06:39:51'),
