  ('zcrm_1579374000031691018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322508', 'Kirk Marshall', NULL, 'Jenni called in saying that her husband has had a condition that makes it so  there is a curvature of his penis and the doctor says that it is going to need elecro- shock therapy to fix it.  I asked if there was any symptoms or diagnosis prior to the start date and she said that there wasn''t.  I told her that she would need to speak to Sedera about this,  I gave her Sedera''s number and transferred the call to Natalie.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-26 14:04:58', '2019-02-26 14:04:58'),
