  ('zcrm_1579374000031612046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, 'Gregory called in from a doctor''s office wondering how the visit was going to get paid.  I asked if it was a preventive care visit he said no, that it was for his leg, that he had already paid out his $1,000 IUA and that this was old news.  I ended up transferring the call to Natalie.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-25 14:19:10', '2019-02-25 14:19:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031612041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025055015', 'Kaitlyn Laney', NULL, 'Kaitlyn called in wanting know about the steps she needed to take to have her birth control filled, first I told her she could try using the Teladoc service and secondly she needed to make an appointment with someone in network for a well womens visit.  I ran a few searches on MultiPlan for her and transferred her to Teladoc.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-25 12:44:41', '2019-02-25 12:44:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031618028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request on 2/21.  I processed.  Members called in this morning and told me that her new coverage does not start until 3/5, she is not comfortable with that gap so she wanted to be re-instated for 1 month.  I was able to get with Sedera &amp; ASi and get this done.  I charged her a onetime MSA in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-25 12:41:36', '2019-02-25 12:41:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031630008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419076', 'Dana Michie', NULL, 'member left a message with Betties to call.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-02-25 12:39:19', '2019-02-25 12:39:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031612033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Lucy called in about another bill that needs to be submitted, I sent her the form.  She also wanted to make sure that 2 of the tests her kids had at their preventive visit would be covered because they were "preventive" I told her that I wasn''t able to see the tests, she though that we were APEX.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-25 12:18:53', '2019-02-25 12:19:40'),
