  ('zcrm_1579374000031466003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809076', 'Phil McGee', NULL, 'Phil McGee Thu Feb 21 7:15 PM

You''ve been incredibly helpful, thank you!!! I hope you don''t mind me asking one more question. Last year I had issues with reimbursement when getting blood work done at LabCorps. I''ve since moved to East Stroudsburg, Pennsylvania, and will have my blood work done here. Can you please remind me which website I need to use to make sure the lab I go to in my area is covered?
Friday February 22nd
You Fri Feb 22 9:28 AM

Good morning Phil!  I have just sent you an email with instruction, link,  and tips with your preventive care.   If you type in Quest or Labcorp those are usually within network. - Kelly', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-22 07:35:39', '2019-02-22 07:35:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031448013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '2-21-19 Asking about how to get skin check for spot on forehead, mammogram, meds for pre-x, etc. She thought she had to change doctors to get meds prescribed. Told her it''s pre-x and can continue with doctor bc network is irrelevant for non-wellness visits. Let her know she will need to pay for those visits. She also wanted to understand LHS versus utlization of cash pay. I explained benefits of cash pay and not showing a LHS card. Sent her the Welcome Call email again to schedule that so they can help her get comfortable and to find a doctor for mammogram and dermatologist. I reiterated pre-x provision for her current health needs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-21 14:37:44', '2019-02-21 14:38:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031416113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028501138', 'James Munro', NULL, 'Sara called in because she was told by Teladoc that she doesn''t have the service on her plan.  I told her that I would get a hold of someone at Sedera to help fix the problem.  I called Sedera and left a message as well as reached out on Slack.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-21 14:19:38', '2019-02-21 14:19:38'),
