  ('zcrm_1579374000031448008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031451093', 'Jamie Amstutz', NULL, '2-21-19 Cancer survivor as of Aug. 30th 2011 when she had her last radiation/chemo treatment. I told her how the guidelines read now and doesn''t want to take the risk if her cancer returns.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-21 13:05:34', '2019-02-21 13:05:34'),
