  ('zcrm_1579374000031416068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Jacquelin called in to try to understand how her daughter should approach going to the ortho dr concerning her knee that has "popped"  she said that she had surgery on it a few years back.   I told her that there was no network,  to present herself as "cash-pay", and to make sure she asked for the medical receipt and not just the cash one to keep for her records.  I also just emailed her about the fact that her daughter shoulld download the Sedera app because they have a new feature that allows the members to file away receipts by need. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-21 11:33:26', '2019-02-21 11:33:26'),
