  ('zcrm_1579374000031448003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, '2-21-19 Lisa works in Employer Benefits for years and now writes about it. She wants to interview us about our revolutionary healthcare solutions for small businesses (that will be her focus for now). She also does Ghost Writing for $1 a word that we would pay for her to get it into a publication as the expert speaking about our product/company. She will allow me to proof read the article before she sends it off to make sure it''s compliant. She will just record our conversation when we talk on March 6th at 11:00 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-21 11:32:03', '2019-02-21 11:32:03'),
