  ('zcrm_1579374000031416023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659288', 'John Kovach', NULL, 'I called John to follow up- his Teladoc appointment went well- he was prescribed tessalon pearls and that script was sent over to his King Soopers pharmacy- I told him that he could pick them up for $6 if he had a membership there, he said he did.  I also transferred him to someone named "Ivory" at teladoc because his doctor said he could get a doctors note for work.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-21 11:03:51', '2019-02-21 11:03:51'),
