  ('zcrm_1579374000031416008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659288', 'John Kovach', NULL, 'John called in sounding so sick, he said that he thinks that he has the flu, I gave him Teladoc''s number and transferred him.  I told him to call or fill out prescription med form and to get all of the info on the meds so that I could send him some coupons afterwards.  I also sent him detailed Teladoc instructions just in case he got stuck.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-21 09:15:46', '2019-02-21 09:15:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031416003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'called in to cancel for March.  Patti said that she needed to fill out the cancellation form very quickly as it is the 21st of the month and that she wouldn''t be able to promise anything.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-21 08:37:12', '2019-02-21 08:37:12'),
