  ('zcrm_1579374000031362043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420417', 'Taylor Hildreth', NULL, '2-20-19 1st Successful training sale for Sammi Bessert! They chose the PSDHC for $500 and $704 month bc husband uses tobacco. All set. Used my portal bc Sammi''s isn''t ready yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-20 16:00:08', '2019-02-20 16:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031362038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420417', 'Taylor Hildreth', NULL, '2-20-19 Training Sale. Taylor is young 29, spouse and 2 kids, 3 and 1 1/2. Live in Olathe CO, S. of GJ. Deciding between SDHC and PSDHC for HSA and well visits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-20 15:19:25', '2019-02-20 15:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031363091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001111021', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, 'Anna called in on the verge of cancelling- when I mentioned our assistance with bills, she said that she would stay with our service to try it out.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-20 15:03:50', '2019-02-20 15:03:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031363086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James called in regarding the steps as to getting an incisional hernia repared.  I told him that it was an open network and that he could go to whatever doctor he would like,  I did recommend healtgrades.com and sent him a link.  I went over the 2nd MD program again, and sent him another email on it.  I made sure that he had Sedera''s number.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-20 14:50:24', '2019-02-20 14:50:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031362028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420287', 'Payson McElveen', NULL, '2-20-19 He''s choosing the Co-Pay Network plan. He''s healthy, no pre-x other than an elbow surgery (assuming bike accident) He''s a Pro Cyclist, earning about $80K, base and expected $95K-$100K after bonuses. He''s finishing up app now for the $500 IUA / $322 month co-pay network at age 26. Turned 26 2 days ago and uninsured now ''til March 1st. Looking at Health IQ to protect him more. But, that''s life and disability ins. So, I will still quote him an accident policy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-20 14:13:52', '2019-02-20 14:13:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031363081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006366071', 'Michael Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request (attached). I will cancel with ASi &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-20 13:49:38', '2019-02-20 13:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031363076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'John asked me to call PHCS to speed the process along for Terri, I was on the phone trying to get a hold of someone for about 15 minutes and the only person that answered gave me attitude and told me to call a different number.  SO.  I put in another nomination- and the tracking number is- 022019UB4 - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-20 12:49:35', '2019-02-20 12:49:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031363071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899526', 'Andrew Dougherty', NULL, 'he called in asking that I send him a coupon for tamsulosin 0.4 mg x60 -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-20 12:37:06', '2019-02-20 12:37:06'),
