  ('zcrm_1579374000031364003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874007', 'David Traywick', NULL, 'Tried to do welcome call as best I could. Spoke to member was very nasty and cursing. While I was on phone he must of been opening mail and he got a letter from the IRS and said they should be burned. He said he never gets sick. The only reason why he got the plan was to be able to open a HSA and if he breaks a leg. He doesn''t go to doctors Fuck that! he said. He is a lawyer. He has a phobia for doctors. Michael Montes affiliate. He won''t use his HSA debit card for injury or illness only use after age 65. Updated his address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-20 08:47:32', '2019-02-20 09:03:04'),
