  ('zcrm_1579374000031347003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '2-19-19 Enrolling now in the Assoc PSDHC for him and wife. Likes the $1500 IUA. Now understands he will pay for blood pressure meds on own. They only cost him $17 a month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-19 15:03:34', '2019-02-19 15:03:34'),
