  ('zcrm_1579374000031328018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027923126', 'Canelus Augustin', NULL, 'Poor guy just wants to understand this product and to go over some medical bills with Redirect.  I feel bad because every time he calls in he doesn''t know how to utilize the plan.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-19 13:28:55', '2019-02-19 13:28:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031343008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659919', 'Rachel Denning', NULL, 'Kelly transferred member to me and I answered questions about re-enrolling at a later time when they get through financial issues.  I advised her that membership in Select was closed, however she could enroll in Access Group.  I advised her to get back in touch with Analisa when she wanted to re-enroll and she would go over differences &amp; options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-19 13:18:34', '2019-02-19 13:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031328013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010492001', 'Anabella Aguilar', NULL, 'Anabella called in to be schooled on how to use her preventive care.  I gave her all the info she needed via email, she wanted to know how to blend a diagnostic  and preventive care exam into a hybrid of sorts so she can get hormone testing done and preventive services done at the same time. I told her that it would not be ideal, but she technically could do it to see what would come of it, but know that she would be paying for some or most of the bill when everything was said and done. I also told her that she should expect to pay out of pocket for the breast MRI.  I could not satisfy her questions, gave it to John- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-19 13:02:06', '2019-02-19 13:02:06'),
