  ('zcrm_1579374000031328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741246', 'Kristann Orton', NULL, 'Kristann called in because she said she had called Welldyne twice about home delivery and was shot down.   I emailed her to say that I would be happy to help her find an online pharmacy that can ship meds- but that the delivery portion of Welldyne wasn''t part of her plan. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-19 11:11:29', '2019-02-19 11:11:29'),
