  ('zcrm_1579374000031302013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, 'Susan is setting up her HSA and wondered what she needed to enter into  the HSA - either- employed, self employed or unemployed. I asked John about this and he said that it shouldn''t make a difference- she thanked me and told me she just wanted to make sure. She also said that she and her husband were so grateful for finding us and being part of the group and answering the phone when she called.  lovely.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-19 10:26:20', '2019-02-19 10:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031302008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Quentin wanted to know where his BIN number was on his ASI card because he is filling out paperwork, prepping for his annual exam.  I told him that he needs to only give the information on the card and have someone from the front desk call ASI to verify that they are in network.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-19 09:42:04', '2019-02-19 09:42:04'),
