  ('zcrm_1579374000031302003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870023', 'Zulma Fuller', NULL, 'Zulma, called in on the verge of tears, her husband had a bad bout with his heart and they thought that he was having a heart attack and they didn''t go to the hospital because they didn''t know what to do as far as presenting their card.  I explained what she should do in an emergency- I also went over how to search for doctors that are in the PHCS  network.  She was happy for the help, she apologized for being frustrated.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-19 09:05:55', '2019-02-19 09:05:55'),
