  ('zcrm_1579374000031216016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Daniel wanted to know what to expect as far as taxes are concerned.  I told him that ASI sent out 1095''s this last friday- 3 days ago- and he should be receiving them sometime at the middle of the week, and explained that he did not have to wait for them to arive to file his taxes- told him to check off the box that states he is covered under his employer.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-18 08:42:18', '2019-02-18 08:42:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031228003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-18 08:16:33', '2019-02-18 08:16:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005310226', 'Carol Riley', NULL, 'Cancelled due to 2 months of non payments; Billing killed; add ons cancelled', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-18 08:05:50', '2019-02-18 08:07:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031216011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647004', 'John Grigsby', NULL, 'John had to have an emergency appendectamy over the weekend, I sent him a how to upload bills to sedera email, I told him that he could find Sedera''s phone number in that email, but that I would try to transfer the call- I told him that I left a voicemail on his behalf.  He seemed pretty happy about what I had done, I also asked if he was given any scripts that I could price out and he said no, but thank you.  I told him to get some rest and that Sedera would be in touch.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-18 07:28:53', '2019-02-18 07:28:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659481', 'Noel Fleming', NULL, 'Member submitted address change via email.  I will change. Email sent to ASi &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-18 07:20:55', '2019-02-18 07:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031182003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031183001', 'Lyonell Barcoo', NULL, 'Called and spoke to Lyonell - wanted to go over with wife - wife and him to call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-02-17 11:45:26', '2019-02-17 11:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031145023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, '2-15-19 Dear Carly Hayes,

Your application has been Approved. Please SAVE this important membership information.

Congratulations, you have just made a great investment in your smile and overall health. Here is what you need to know:

Do not respond to this confirmation email.  Your plan information and all ID cards will be delivered via direct mail to the address you provided in the Primary Applicant Information section.
Please note:  While your dental and vision insurance is effective on the date noted above, your application may take up to five business days to be processed and be accessible in our system and through the network providers.  For questions regarding your policy, claims or ID cards, contact your plan administrator at:

    Ameritas®
    PO Box 82520, Lincoln, NE 68501-2520
    Claims: 800-487-5553 ameritas.com
    Customer Service (other than claims): 866-619-6095
    Fax: 402-309-2598
    Email: spirit@ameritas.com
(for enrollment changes or payment questions)
• 	Your cards and plan information will be delivered via mail to the address you provided in the Primary Applicant Information section. Please allow 10 to 14 working days to receive your cards and plan information.

Per your enrollment, your specific coverage information is as follows:
    
    Confirmation Number:   995653384
    Plan Selected:   Network 1200 + Vision
    Coverage Level:   Individual
    Effective Date:   02/15/2019
    Zip Code:   40502
    Dental Monthly Premium:   $31.92
    Vision Monthly Premium:   $7
    Total Monthly Premium:    $38.92
    Agent Info:   Wendy Scipione - (720) 259-1555', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-15 16:59:14', '2019-02-15 16:59:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031145013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295052', 'Susan Hodson', NULL, '2-15-19 Susan is planning to enroll this weekend on Sunday. She was slightly nervous about referring a new member but when understood what was truly involved and she''s really set for 2 1/2 years bc of Cobra option she''s happy with it.  Referred by Patricia Mitchell who didn''t remember about referring a new member!  Susan is 59 and lawyer. Planning to keep this until ages out into Medicare. She has daughter whose turning 26 soon and may need a solution and son (19?) with special needs who''s on Medicaid now. But, that may end and wondering if she can add him at any point. She''s enrolling on Sunday into MPB Group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-15 16:53:13', '2019-02-15 16:53:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031107023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962404', 'Jahzmin French', NULL, 'Already cancelled with Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-15 14:07:33', '2019-02-15 14:07:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031107018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027982082', 'Mark Hermes', NULL, 'Cancellation had already been submitted to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-15 14:04:58', '2019-02-15 14:04:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031145003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, '2-15-19 Family of 4, Kim is the oldest at 49. Healthy family. Kids FT in college. One is in CA. One child just had headaches so they did a brain scan and waiting on results. Not concerned but hopes will know before our next conversation on Tuesday. Wants March 1st start. Was going to have to pay $1400 and excluding 1 kid since out of state.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-15 14:03:28', '2019-02-15 14:03:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962125', 'Brent Peterson', NULL, 'Bent called in for more help with prescriptions.  I took the names of the scripts over the phone and sent the coupons via text.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 13:59:27', '2019-02-15 13:59:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031142008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'Called for 2nd welcome call, left message at 3:00 and 3:15, no response.  Sent email', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-02-15 13:33:56', '2019-02-15 13:33:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031142003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'Spoke to LeAnn Shortly after her call.   She sent an e-mail to me complaining about the call.  I told her I''d be happy to explain the program to answer any of her questions.  Scheduled a call at 1:00 her time, 3:00 our time on Friday.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-02-15 13:33:10', '2019-02-15 13:33:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030962071', 'Jason Salisbury', NULL, 'Joanna called in for help with a prescription quote- I sent her a form. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 13:29:14', '2019-02-15 13:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031107013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962404', 'Jahzmin French', NULL, 'Employee cancelled with Redirect &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-15 13:10:52', '2019-02-15 13:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031117021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Member called and updated payment info ( one number in the account number was off). Processed acct set up fee and all set for payment to come out on the 22nd', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-15 12:57:08', '2019-02-15 12:57:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027982082', 'Mark Hermes', NULL, 'I sent in cancellation to Redirect &amp; Elizabeth @ Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-15 12:53:56', '2019-02-15 12:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743055', 'Joyce Jordan', NULL, 'Joyce called in inquiring about her preventive care plan, she still hasn''t received a card now for 18 months!  I appologized, sent out a request for a hard and pdf coppy be sent.  I did make sure to verify address, and we have it correct.  I sent her a form so I can submit her bills to ASI.   She said that she wouldn''t know how to take pictures with her phone or scan them on a computer so she said that she would enlist the help of someone else more tech savvy-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 12:35:33', '2019-02-15 12:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'I spoke to Patricia for a half an hour, she needed and needs a lot of hand holding but she really wants to learn.  I sent her more emails today, provider search, and Sedera videos- she will love them!   She told me that she probably is going to call back with more questions!  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 12:14:02', '2019-02-15 12:14:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899058', 'David Pritekel', NULL, 'David had a lot of questions surrounding his taxes.  I answered them and sent an email to break down the numbers.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 11:34:26', '2019-02-15 11:34:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031108008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025825017', 'Christopher Bradley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-15 10:33:28', '2019-02-15 10:33:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605467', 'Sandra Walker', NULL, 'Sandra called in upset that her portal was not working the way it used too and that the card she seemed out of date.   She said that she normally used the portal to find doctors and facilities that were in network, I told her that I would run a search for a 3D mammogram in her area as well as send her the correct link for the wellfit community.  All info sent. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 10:01:55', '2019-02-15 10:01:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031117016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935075', 'Fabiola Gomes', NULL, 'March payment involves an expiring card. Sent an email with ways to update CC info', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-15 09:19:47', '2019-02-15 09:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031117008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899141', 'Kris McMurray', NULL, 'Expiring card for March payment. Sent an email with ways to update CC info', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-15 09:16:23', '2019-02-15 09:16:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899526', 'Andrew Dougherty', NULL, 'called in for help regarding medication pricing.  I sent some coupons out.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 09:10:06', '2019-02-15 09:10:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031117003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025370062', 'Jeffrey Janower', NULL, 'Expiring card for March payment. Sent an email to update info', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-15 09:06:44', '2019-02-15 09:06:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031114003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779423', 'Lela Glick', NULL, 'Ron called saying that he will be going on to Medicare April 1 and wanted to know the process, I told him that I was going to send him a family member update form for him to fill out sometime mid march so that Patti doesn''t miss it when she is doing the changes for the next month. Sent the form- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 09:04:28', '2019-02-15 09:04:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030870013', 'Santry Rush', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-15 08:48:14', '2019-02-15 08:48:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130432', 'Desiree Smith', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation request.  Redirect change form in attachments, Sedera notified.  Billing cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-15 08:47:25', '2019-02-15 08:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031090008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335249', 'Terrie Parrott', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-15 08:17:57', '2019-02-15 08:17:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031054016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'I just put a call in to BaylorScott&amp;White, I left a message with Vince who heads up the HR department- I was told by the front staff that he would be the one to talk to in regards to having the PHCS network and the process that involves. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 08:08:11', '2019-02-15 08:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031054011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'I helped Susan with her password and Brad got the site to work again. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-15 07:48:25', '2019-02-15 07:48:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031090003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885197', 'Karen McCormick', NULL, 'Updated member''s phone number on file. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-15 07:44:55', '2019-02-15 07:44:55'),
