  ('zcrm_1579374000031077008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005005', 'Sarah Stoke', NULL, 'F/U email sent', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2019-02-14 12:37:47', '2019-02-14 12:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031077003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411262', 'Michael Hicks', NULL, 'HRA email sent', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2019-02-14 12:35:49', '2019-02-14 12:35:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031046013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471183', 'Daniel Walsh', NULL, 'called in a bit upset about letter from ASI indicating that some or all of his claim submission (preventive exam) would not be covered.  Asked him if he discussed any symptoms or medical issues he was experiencing.  He asked the doctor about a bruise on his back.  That is likely wjhat he is being charged for.  Kelly has a call into Leena Basurto.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-02-14 11:53:47', '2019-02-14 11:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031037023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, 'Danna called in upset because she feels that she will be sent to collections.  I told her that there HAS been contact with ASI about this, but with no reply.  That sometimes claims go through effortlessly and sometimes not.  She said that she wanted to avoid going to collections and I told her that I did too!  I said that because Monica kinda went MIA, that I would reach out to Leena, I called ASI and left a message with her. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-14 11:33:00', '2019-02-14 11:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031037018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029894103', 'Deborah Doolittle', NULL, 'she called in because she had a preventive exam scheduled with her doctor and wanted to know how to be reimbursed.  I first went over the fact that she had not had a welcome call and that it was very important, I told her that I was sending a scheduler to her.  I then asked if she found her doctor in network, she said that she had been with the same doctor for years and she wouldn''t want to change, I told her that she needed to see a doctor that is in network or it would not be covered by her card.  I told her that I would run a search for her,  I could not find Dr Darlow in network.  She asked me if she had to pay out of pocket, I told her yes- she asked to cancel- I told her that I would send a form.  Patti called Jeff and Jeff said that he would give her a call. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-14 10:32:23', '2019-02-14 10:32:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031061003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-14 10:29:58', '2019-02-14 10:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031033028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044105', 'Michael Marmor', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1500 IUA 40-49 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-14 10:28:58', '2019-02-14 10:28:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031037013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'called in because she was having trouble logging in to the us corporate wellness site.  I visited the site it was down, I told her that I needed to report the site down to the owner and I would get back to her about logging in. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-14 10:19:48', '2019-02-14 10:19:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031054006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335249', 'Terrie Parrott', NULL, 'Booked her 15 minute welcome call for Friday, February 15, 2019 at 7:00 a.m. pacific time/10:00 a.m. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-14 09:58:52', '2019-02-14 09:58:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031033023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-14 09:52:12', '2019-02-14 09:52:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031033018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, 'Per Wendy this enrollee''s $100 Set Up fee was waived by Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-14 09:51:17', '2019-02-14 09:51:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031033013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044007', 'Anne Winther', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-14 09:27:37', '2019-02-14 09:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031033008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000518266', 'Daniela Dadurian, M.D.', NULL, 'Cindyann from the Dr office called and wanted to know why they were still being billed.  I let he know that I had not received any notification from them officially cancelling membership.  I sent out the Cancellation directly to Cindyann and she will return.  Let Joan know what happened.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-14 09:22:45', '2019-02-14 09:22:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031038008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Account fee declined. Sent email to update payment info', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-14 09:10:10', '2019-02-14 09:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031037008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592190', 'Irene Evans', NULL, 'Irene called and requested a sumatriptan coupon be sent to her. She emailed me back and thanked me for the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-14 09:04:55', '2019-02-14 09:04:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031046008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with member and her husband Robert. Member requested 2nd QR life code card for husband. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-14 08:58:10', '2019-02-14 08:58:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031046003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130206', 'Candis Mixon', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member wasn''t in front of computer at time of the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-14 08:48:57', '2019-02-14 08:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031038003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711417', 'Catherine Horn', NULL, 'Member called and updated payment information. Paid January and February and currently up to date.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-14 08:14:23', '2019-02-14 08:14:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000031037003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711417', 'Catherine Horn', NULL, 'called in saying that she just received an email stating that she has been cancelled but she said she called yesterday, spoke with someone and had already cleared this up. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-14 08:10:05', '2019-02-14 08:10:05');
