  ('zcrm_1579374000030979018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870100', 'Kelly Henson Renoud', NULL, 'This is from my slack post- hello, I just got off of the phone with Kelly Henson Renoud in regards to his daughter Anamarie Renoud,  he had questions regarding her psychological after care after her heart attack scare that was actually a panic attack.  He said that he was speaking to Thomas Fortsam(sorry if this is misspelled) about the hospital case and I told him that I wouldn''t be able to answer any of his questions regarding his open claim, or what will be covered and what won''t.  Thanks!  Kelly', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 15:08:14', '2019-02-13 15:08:14'),
