  ('zcrm_1579374000030979013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, 'Amy filled out a prescription quote request form without enough accurate information for me to decipher in regards to the cephalexin, I gave her a call and left a voicemail.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 13:17:10', '2019-02-13 13:17:10'),
