  ('zcrm_1579374000030979008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, 'He called saying that this is the 3rd time calling to request a Teladoc card, I told him that there is no card for Teladoc, he said that there was and he was looking at it.  I told him that I would request that another HES card be sent out.  Emailed Liz to request. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 12:58:14', '2019-02-13 12:58:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030980003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082502', 'Kelli Crooks', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Will get back to us if she didn''t receive her QR Life Code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-13 12:56:03', '2019-02-14 09:31:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030979003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'Brian called in because he received a statement from ASI that said that his physical wasn''t covered.  I sent him the form to fill out.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 12:55:36', '2019-02-13 12:55:36'),
