  ('zcrm_1579374000030967003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674232', 'Joyce Miller-Averbach', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Didn''t receive Redirect Health card. Putting in that request. Member didn''t seem to realize really what she signed up for so I told her I would reach out to Paul Cholak to reach out to her. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-13 12:46:15', '2019-02-13 12:46:15'),
