  ('zcrm_1579374000030940033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, 'check all emails associated, I have asked Leena to step in with this case. JoAnna is such a good sport!  John is working on working this out with David Shull for the well womens visit and as far as the girls'' exams I don''t think that there is enough info.  Waiting on Leena.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 12:18:33', '2019-02-13 12:18:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030940028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Jessica called back and I helped answer some preventive care questions, sent educational emails.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 11:40:14', '2019-02-13 11:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030940023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Jessica called in because she has a skin tag on her eye that is growing so quickly that it is starting to affect her vision.  She wanted to know of the most economically friendly doctor to help her with this.  I explained that I wouldn''t be able to help but that Sedera might.  I gave their number, transferred the call, left a voice message and Jessica was already on the Sedera site finding new info!   - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 10:43:24', '2019-02-13 10:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030942028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928157', 'Brenda Penner-Howell', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-13 09:41:32', '2019-02-13 09:41:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030940018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, 'Dawne called to see what to expect/do for her taxes.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 09:35:37', '2019-02-13 09:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030940013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James had a question as to how would he present himself to a doctors office for preventive care services.  I sent him the "script" he was pretty excited about it.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 09:31:16', '2019-02-13 09:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030942023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928113', 'Heather Lakey', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp 1500 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-13 09:21:38', '2019-02-13 09:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030942018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928113', 'Heather Lakey', NULL, 'This enrollee visited the Click Funnel prior to enrolling.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-13 09:18:31', '2019-02-13 09:18:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030942013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928113', 'Heather Lakey', NULL, '2/8/19 frm Concierge Heather called in wanting to speak to someone about what we offer.  I found her here as a lead already, I left a voicemail with Wendy as well as gave Heather Wendy''s direct line.- KC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-13 09:13:42', '2019-02-13 09:13:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030940008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'Raymond called in with questions surrounding his wife getting a mammagram, I told him that the doctor and facility needed to be in network and he told me that it was not how he was sold the product and then described what Mike presented him- that he would be able to go out of network but submit the bill himself and receive 130% medicare allowable back.  I told him that that is not how the plan that he and his wife have and that I would get in touch with Mike so that he could explain.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 09:07:45', '2019-02-13 09:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030942008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447107', 'Emily Takahashi', NULL, 'Member submitted a cancellation request I will cancel ASi &amp; Sedera and FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-13 09:03:31', '2019-02-13 09:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030942003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007222165', 'Joseph Botkin', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request . I will cancel Subscription eff 3/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-13 08:38:31', '2019-02-13 08:38:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030940003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'called about 1095''s - I told him that ASI will be sending them out on the 15th , but that is just for his records- he just needed to make sure that he checked the box that states that Mary has coverage under her employer.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-13 08:24:52', '2019-02-13 08:24:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030895044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'she called in upset about an ASI bill, I sent her a form to fill out, she is going to call them to see how far she gets.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-12 14:50:15', '2019-02-12 14:50:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030895039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'called in regards to not being able to log in and complete her health risk assesment.  - I tried a bunch of different ways- failed. I tagged Monica in an email that I sent to Brad Cooper requesting that he reach out to her to have this solved.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-12 14:36:41', '2019-02-12 14:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030894033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165315', 'Debra Jackson', NULL, 'Spoke with Debra who updated her card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-12 14:21:30', '2019-02-12 14:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030895034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Lucy called for certainty when it comes to her upcoming preventive care  exam, so what happened to her husband (a cholesterol lab) doesn''t happen to her and I told her that it comes down to the conversation that she has with her doctor,  I told her keep her physical preventative and to make sure that everything is coded as such.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-12 13:56:02', '2019-02-12 13:56:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030894028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939131', 'Laura Clemmons', NULL, 'I received Cancellation Survey I will process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-12 13:53:12', '2019-02-12 13:53:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030894023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030055047', 'Isabel May', NULL, 'This member has not been sent to Sedera or Redirect yet so I have marked her a Termed in Selerix and taken her off the Redirect spreadsheet.  We will refund the $125 Set up', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-12 13:41:11', '2019-02-12 13:41:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030878040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '2-12-19 Lady wants me to speak directly with Chip her husband bc he''s nervous about the no guarantee of payment and sounds too good to be true. He''s sick with the flu right now but she will connect us via email to set up time to chat. Then she''s ready to enroll once he''s on board.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-12 13:05:37', '2019-02-12 13:05:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030894018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030055047', 'Isabel May', NULL, 'Isabel called in and let me know that she would like to cancel as she just found out that she will have to have back surgery.  I emailed Robin to let her know and also sent out the link to the cancellation form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-12 12:37:49', '2019-02-12 12:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030878032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928157', 'Brenda Penner-Howell', NULL, '2-12-19 Mark also had polyps removed that were pre-cancerous discovered from colonoscopy recently this past summer. So, he can get onto Cobra through her previous employer. She will join PSDHC as she doesn''t have any health issues that she''s worried about. They will use Cobra for Mark and dental and vision. Applying now for Kae. Enrollment complete for $1000 IUA!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-12 12:02:14', '2019-02-12 12:12:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030878027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '2-12-19 She and Shawn had many more questions. She''d like to move forward and wants to get Shawn on board. We will follow up on Friday. She was concerned bc he was a smoker 10 years ago but has totally quit now for 10 years, so not pre-x. No current health issues. Also wants Children''s Dentistry of Westminster, Dentist Stacy Jackson. Not in DDP networks. Asked her to find out who they accept first and I''ll look up pricing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-12 11:45:56', '2019-02-12 11:45:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030894013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939131', 'Laura Clemmons', NULL, 'I spoke to Laura who told me that her husband has lost his job and wanted to keep just their children on the plan.  I advised that if she come off the plan that the whole plan would cancel.  Also wanted to put membership "on hold".  I advised that she could re-enroll in the Association options when they were in better financial shape.  She will contact me at that time .  I sent out cancellation form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-12 11:44:17', '2019-02-12 11:44:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030895029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899120', 'Candi Broeffle', NULL, 'Candi called in to cancel, she wanted to find the form online so I told her where to find it. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-12 11:20:32', '2019-02-12 11:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030895024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165477', 'Karelle Scharff', NULL, 'very strange call, she called to reverse her cancellation and then wanted to keep it after all. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-12 11:11:51', '2019-02-12 11:11:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030857036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956113', 'Desiree Brandt', NULL, 'Member called and updated CC info.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-02-12 11:04:05', '2019-02-12 11:04:05'),
