  ('zcrm_1579374000030873033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885197', 'Karen McCormick', NULL, 'There is no Karen at this phone number that is on file. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-12 09:53:34', '2019-02-12 09:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030878022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044105', 'Michael Marmor', NULL, '1-31-19 I''m self-employed. I provide consulting to US-based companies helping them outsource software development outside of the US. I''m currently on an extended visit to India, which is work-related. You can read more about what I do professionally on my website (www.michaelmarmor.com). We will return to the US on February 28th and are looking for health coverage starting on March 1st.
>
> I''m looking for a plan for my family. We live in Charlotte, North Carolina. Coverage is needed for me, my wife and my four-year-old son. None of us use tobacco, and I suspect that all of us are in the top 5% for physical fitness and general health. None of us have ever had any major health-related issues. We don''t have any prescriptions. We are very infrequent users of the medical system. We had an ACA plan in 2018 which we did not use even a single time.
>
> Michael Marmor, DOB: 9/23/1971
> Anna Marmor, DOB 2/20/1976
> Kavi Marmor, DOB 9/23/2014
>
> I''m considering a wide range of coverage options for our return to the US. I''m considering Medical Cost Sharing Ministries, as well as Direct Primary Care alternatives for Health Insurance. I learned about Sedera through my research and reached out to them directly. They suggested I talk to you since they have an affiliate model and don''t take individual members directly.
>
> Best,
>
> Michael', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-12 09:50:36', '2019-02-12 09:50:36'),
