  ('zcrm_1579374000030821053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', NULL, 'Paula called in stating that she had received some bad news from her doctor and that there was a mass found and they would like to have the mass biopsied right away.  She called because the doctor wanted to do a biopsy right away and wanted to be on the same page as Sedera and 2nd MD.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-11 13:20:15', '2019-02-11 13:20:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030821048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'called in about preventive care benefits- I went over them as well as sent script on how to present her ASI card. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-11 12:54:35', '2019-02-11 12:54:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030821043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899526', 'Andrew Dougherty', NULL, 'I went over how preventive care works, sent mail and helped him learn how to use multi plan page.  He was thinking about getting some sort of prostate surgery done and wanted to know the process.  I told him that it would need to go through the 2nd MD, emailed him the info and Sedera.  He wanted to know if dental work was covered. I told him no, but told him that I would reach out to Ron so that he can go over the different dental plans available.  I also went over how he could nominate his doctor to be on the plan. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-11 12:47:03', '2019-02-11 12:47:03'),
