  ('zcrm_1579374000030821038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027978183', 'Cassandra Thompson', NULL, 'she called in wanting an explanation of how prescription medications work with us.  she exploded  "hold up! so you want me to give you a call anytime that I need a prescription refilled?!"  I told her not if you don''t want to.  She said that this was "bullshit insurance"- gave the phone to John, he told her to call Jennie Franco.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-11 12:15:47', '2019-02-11 12:15:47'),
