  ('zcrm_1579374000030735045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '2-8-19 Enrolling now on his phone and we''re hoping it will work. I completed the first page for him and now he can login himself. It ran into an error otherwise. I think it''s a phone app problem!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-08 13:32:35', '2019-02-08 13:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030724023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'Sherry called for 1099 and would not accept the answer I gave her asking-  Patti talked her through it.  All I did was reiterate everything that I had already sent her via email earlier today. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-08 13:29:36', '2019-02-08 13:29:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030735034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928113', 'Heather Lakey', NULL, '2-8-19 Heather is 40 and husband 42. Liking the Self Directed option best bc Never go to dr. She gets her pap smear done at her local Family Planning facility and husband doesn''t go to dr. ever. She goes 1x a year to get her inhaler refilled. I should let her know maybe can do that through Teledoc possibly. Told her to call Concierge for pricing on inhaler. They are totally healthy, no issues otherwise. They don''t have ins. now because earn too much for subsidy and cost is just too high. Wants to enroll for March 1st start and will do on her own and email me when done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-08 13:14:17', '2019-02-08 13:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030735026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706105', 'Joseph Freije', NULL, '2-8-19 Turned 26 years old as of Aug. 2018. He bought a Crossfit Gym 2 years ago that he runs. So, he super active, fit, health conscious, coaches. He has a girlfriend who he was trying to wait to join her plan but realized he needs his own until then. He listened to my Audio for the MPB GROUP. Enrolling now. COMPLETE into MPB Group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-08 13:02:13', '2019-02-08 13:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030724018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029337149', 'Michael Taylor', NULL, 'he wanted to know how to upload bills for his sons pediatrician and spranged ankle treatment from earlier this year.  I told him that it would be considered pre existing but he said that he was a previous Sedera client, I told him that he would need to get this sorted with Sedera.  I gave him their number as well as transferred the call to Marquis.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-08 12:04:09', '2019-02-08 12:04:09'),
