  ('zcrm_1579374000030636003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384233', 'Gregory Tatham', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Did not get QR Life Code card. Sending out today one for him and member request for his wife as well.  Putting in request for RCI card did not get as well.Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-07 09:27:28', '2019-02-07 09:27:28'),
