  ('zcrm_1579374000030608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028461003', 'Suzanne Dugger', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-02-07 07:52:29', '2019-02-07 07:52:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030589003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962935', 'Sherri Kikly', NULL, 'REMEC employee. Member stated she didn''t have any cards from dental, vision, Redirect or Mpowering Benefits. Reassured member that I would find out about the status of her cards. Member was confused about the plan. I encouraged her to schedule another welcome call to answer any additional questions.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2019-02-06 18:32:25', '2019-02-06 18:32:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030575032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '2-6-19 Called to request pharmacy card and LHS card. Told her to call Concierge for medications for best prices and sent her the form to get a quote. Also told her to call LHS directly for new LHS cards and try possibly login online to request more cards to avoid waiting on hold.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-06 16:17:10', '2019-02-06 16:17:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030566016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939131', 'Laura Clemmons', NULL, 'Laura called in to ask if vaccines given at the time of a wellness pediatrician visit is covered.   I told her, yes, as long as it is coded as preventative.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-06 14:47:39', '2019-02-06 14:47:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030575022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, '2-6-19 Followed up with Jill to answer any further questions about setting up her annual wellness visits. She''s figured it all out after 2 calls to MPB and is setting up her first well woman visit and hoping they''ll do the other traditional physical check. Then she''ll ask for where to go for her mammogram and colonoscopy, Sending her daughter to U of OR for $45 wellness visit through them since it''s cheapest and she doesn''t have a car to go elsewhere. She''s all set to go and knows to show card for those visits and not for anything else. Already discovered allergy appointment will be about $120 as cash pay. No problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-06 14:22:20', '2019-02-06 14:22:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030575011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928157', 'Brenda Penner-Howell', NULL, '2-6-19 Kaye is turning 58 next week, Mark is 60. They are healthy. Mark was treated for an enlarged prostate last year and takes meds ongoing for it. Knows that is pre-x. He also had a skin cancer removed 10 years ago and gets checked often now so no issues. Also told her that''s not part of free annual wellness visits and will have to pay for that on own. Kae is now self-employed. Curious if she decides to get a job with benefits if she can cancel at any time. Told her it''s month to month. Recommending they get 2 separate policies. PSDHC for Kae at $322 and ReDirect for Mark at $507. Follow up appt next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-06 13:58:50', '2019-02-06 14:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030575003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '2-6-19 John is 53 and wife 40. He listened to the Association audio and likes the $1500 level since he and wife are healthy and rarely go to dr. He''s paying $1100 a month to Cobra now! Cobra expires in June. Lives in ID. Only health issue is high blood pressure sometimes and uses lo does lisinopril to manage it. Weight fluctuates by 20 lbs. When weight is lower he doesn''t use meds and when weight is higher he needs the meds.  Knows it''s a good incentive to maintain lower weight.  Knows deadline and will reach out before 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-02-06 13:28:56', '2019-02-06 13:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030566008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677458', 'Susanne Kortals', NULL, 'I assisted her with Sedera as well as ASI billing today.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-06 13:14:24', '2019-02-06 13:14:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030566003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'Aine would like a call from John soon, she wanted to get advice from him.  I told her that he was unavailable, I asked if I could help but was unable to, I transferred the line to Liberty to someone named McKenzie.  This is concerning her doctor finding something on a mammogram.
