  ('zcrm_1579374000030365028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, 'Jill called in stating that she couldn''t find any doctors off of the MultiPlan search, I guided her with that, I asked if she would like me to do the searches and she declined.  She stated that she was nervous about her and her daughters'' visits because her daughter has allergies and uses an inhaler regularly.  I explained how she should view that doctors visit as out of pocket, she said that Wendy told her that it would be covered 100% , she kept repeating that she was told that everything is covered at 100%., I chimed in to say that everything that is coded as preventative will be covered at 100% - imediately deffensive, stating that this was NOT what she was told. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-04 13:43:39', '2019-02-06 14:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030378046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584192', 'Gregory Skochko', NULL, 'Per Jenny cancel due to non pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-02-04 13:15:33', '2019-02-04 13:15:33'),
