  ('zcrm_1579374000030365018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830116', 'Kevin Morrow', NULL, 'Brenda called in for John originally, when I told her that he was on the other line, she asked if I might be about to help.  I said that I''d be happy to, she would not stop repeating that John told her that everything would be covered 100% , she was miffed that she received a bill back about her bone density scan.  I told her that I would send her a form to fill out and that I would pass it along to ASI, and then she was worried of who it went to,  I told her that it went to me and then to ASI.  I doubt she will take this help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-04 11:15:22', '2019-02-04 11:15:22'),
