  ('zcrm_1579374000030263018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, 'Paul called because he has been talking to his doctor about back pain, he has had an MRI already and now the doctor is going to be giving him shots of medication to see if that will help.  The total bill so far is around $600- I told him that he needs to give Sedera a call if he knows he will go over or close to his IUA, also he needs to call them and go through the 2nd MD program if there is talk of surgery.  I told him the correct bills to collect that will be accepted by Sedera.  I sent him the email about how to upload them to the app. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-01 11:47:58', '2019-02-01 11:47:58'),
