  ('zcrm_1579374000030263013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, 'They are out of town on vacation in Idaho, and they would like to go to an urgent care to rule out pneumonia because Greg has a terrible cough.  I told them to present themselves as cash paying patients, ask for a discount, grab a detailed medical receipt before they leave.  I went over their IUA, and what constitutes as a need.  I did bring up the idea of them maybe using Teladoc, but they declined because they would like a doctor to listen to his lungs.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-01 09:44:21', '2019-02-01 09:44:21'),
