  ('zcrm_1579374000030263008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'I spoke to Bridget at Sedera she said that I just needed to explain to Alicia that the program is through Sedera and not to ask them for help as if they were goodrx. I let Alicia know she was appreciative of our help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-02-01 09:34:04', '2019-02-01 09:34:04'),
