  ('zcrm_1579374000030203024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '1-31-19 Called to ask about how to use membership. Wants mammogram and ob-gyn visit, etc. She didn''t have time to focus now bc moving her mom. But, will call me or Concierge in a week or so to figure out how to go about it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-31 15:34:04', '2019-01-31 15:34:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030227008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266293', 'Lori Kinzer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request prior to starting. Said that she was signed up through the Sedera website.  and a mistake was made.  I called her out on that and said that Sedera does not sign up individual it''s all done thru employer groups.  I will notify Sedera and refund Her February share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-31 14:03:54', '2019-01-31 14:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030200011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447288', 'Michael Sherman', NULL, 'called to ask if if dental implants are covered by his plan.  I told him no, but to check with Kevin to see if he was offering any dental coverage.  Then he said he already had coverage but he was waiting for it to roll over, but he can''t wait.  I apologized I couldn''t help more.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-31 13:43:01', '2019-01-31 13:43:01'),
