  ('zcrm_1579374000030204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322546', 'Christopher Roussin', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-31 11:08:23', '2019-01-31 11:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030203003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '11-23-19 Sondra has been on Medicaid but will be bumped off. She had the flu when we talked but usually super healthy. Referred by Mary Geitner. Shawn her husband is on Bright Health now for $440 and daughter on another plan for $267 totaling $707 for just two of them. Live in 80026. Sondra has Carpel tunnel syndrome and uses self care and acupuncture to heal. Daughter has Sensory Processing Disorder and needs OT for that. Told her that would be paid on their own. Sondra and Shawn are Not married and file individually. She said they can file together is need be. Their daughter is theirs biologically and technically Common Law married. Sondra is 49.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-31 11:08:23', '2019-01-31 11:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030200003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, 'Karen''s son has been having issues with his shoulder- she wanted to know the process if this escalated over her $1500 IUA- as of now her son has been to a doctor and had his shoulder "set" and they are hoping it just heals naturally.  I told her to call back if she had any further questions. sent Sedera bill submission email as well as gave their number, I told her to give Sedera a call as soon as she thinks that the medical costs will either get close or go over her IUA- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-31 11:03:51', '2019-01-31 11:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030145031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Annette called in and said that she needed to submit bills for a shoulder issue that totaled $1800 I gave her Sedera''s phone number, transferred her to Marquis, sent uploading bills to Sedera , sent bill help form because of a billing issue concerning polyps with ASI.  Tried to explain the difference between preventative care and illness/injury- she self-admittedly doesn''t know anything about the program.  I told her to call me with anything that she didn''t understand. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-31 10:41:43', '2019-01-31 10:41:43'),
