  ('zcrm_1579374000030061048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521016', 'Catherine Jaimes Llanos', NULL, 'Catherine reached out via Skipio about an unpaid bill with ASI, I grabbed all of the info and sent it out to Leena for an explanation.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 14:33:39', '2019-01-30 14:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030061043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'Brad and his wife called in pretty distressed, their daughter Sophia fell out of bed and his her head last night, and today she is exhibiting neurological symptoms and vomiting.  They were nervous about going to the ER right away due to cost- I told them to put at least $1000 into their HSA and not to pay any more than that amount.  I gave them Sedera''s phone number, sent corresponding email- asked to transfer them but they declined. I wished them luck. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 14:29:38', '2019-01-30 14:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030110003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028501151', 'Amanda Noble', NULL, 'Member had not received her RCI or Mpowering Benefits Card at the time of welcome call, but stated she had a pile of mail to go through. i encouraged her to call if she did not receive her cards after going through her mail.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-01-30 14:26:10', '2019-01-30 14:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030061038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027923126', 'Canelus Augustin', NULL, 'he called wanting an explanation of why his redirect card didn''t look like an insurance card.  I tried to explain,  I left a message with redirect to get back in touch with him. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 14:03:37', '2019-01-30 14:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030061033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027923258', 'Angela Brown', NULL, 'Angela called in because she still hasn''t gotten her Redirect cards yet.  - I reached out and asked that she be contacted. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 13:56:31', '2019-01-30 13:56:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030061028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008628057', 'Anthony Belisle', NULL, 'called in because the attachment I sent didn''t make it.  sent out again- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 13:33:39', '2019-01-30 13:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030061023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255542', 'Angela Brown', NULL, 'called in saying that she hasn''t received any insurance cards yet- I told her that I had Kyle and Guy in the office today and I would let them know that she would like a call back.  She said that we told her to go to Jennie Franco, and that Jennie Franco sent you an email and told them to go back to us. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 13:14:57', '2019-01-30 13:14:57'),
