  ('zcrm_1579374000030061013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862222', 'Christopher Morano', NULL, 'he had to the go to the ER to get some stitches, I sent him an email with link and directions to submit bills to Sedera, gave him Sedera''s number and transferred the call to "Dia".- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 12:30:02', '2019-01-30 12:30:02'),
