  ('zcrm_1579374000030056003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, '1-30-19 Spoke with Darius, Kelly and John about Lori''s preventative screening treatment for any cancer. According to John the dr. billed it as preventative and the hospital would NOT bill it as such, hence where the problem lies. It has been negotiated by Sedera/Karis Group and then refunded to Lori this one time. I asked Darius to confirm that this was a one time treatment and she will not be looking to have this done again next year. He will confirm. She has only had it done once since her double mastectomy 10 years ago when they found potential cancel cells but no cancer yet. Family history drove double mastectomy decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-30 11:58:47', '2019-01-30 11:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030027023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'I helped him with another list of doctors.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 11:31:22', '2019-01-30 11:31:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030027018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977323', 'Juana Moody', NULL, 'Juana called to say that she has been trying to get a hold of Redirect for a week with no response and that she didn''t have a Spirit dental card.  I reached out to Redirect on her behalf,  gave her Jennie Franco''s phone number so that she could inquire about a card, and asked Guy to figure out from Ron what is going on with Redirect. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 10:53:35', '2019-01-30 10:53:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030024028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with member and wife Ashley. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-30 10:53:06', '2019-01-30 11:25:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030024023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-30 10:50:45', '2019-01-30 10:50:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000030027013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'Admittedly Kathy has already called APEX and SEDERA to inquire why her mammography that they are telling her is diagnostic isn''t being paid for by anyone.  She is trying to make a distinction that THIS mammogram is JUST the screening kind, and the others were diagnostic.  So I told her that I would once again ask APEX to get an explanation from them.  Also, she is cancelling by the 1st of April- I sent her a form.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-30 10:49:23', '2019-01-30 10:49:23'),
