  ('zcrm_1579374000029951063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032104090', 'Chelsey-Rae Williams', NULL, '1-29-19 Chelsey is 26 and ending job March 29th. Wants April 1st start date. She has endometriosis but there''s nothing to do for it. No meds, no treatment. She will likely choose the $215/$1000 IUA. We are meeting Feb. 8th at noon for enrollment to MPB Group!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-29 15:15:57', '2019-01-29 15:15:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029951058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, 'he called in a question about derm bills- I went over why it isn''t covered by his ASI card as well as went over when he could submit the CPT coded bills to Sedera and open up a need.  I sent the corresponding email as well as a link to the library of Sedera videos.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-29 14:29:54', '2019-01-29 14:29:54'),
