  ('zcrm_1579374000029951008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Regina called in because she was at the doctors office due to her knee bothering her,  she wanted to know how to proceed because she had never used her plan before.  I told her to present herself as a cash paying patient, ask for a cash discount and to ask for the CPT coded medical bill.  I sent multiple educational emails, told her to call Sedera if she thinks that the doctor  is going to order an MRI, because that would put her over her IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-29 08:55:20', '2019-01-29 08:55:20'),
