  ('zcrm_1579374000029951003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Reid could not help with the cost.  Donnatal is only sold in the US, not overseas.  I found the cheapest coupon for $855 (90 day supply) and sent it as well as my suggestion with info on how she might want to utilize the 2nd MD program to see if there is another avenue that would give her the same results with a different medication for a more conservative price. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-29 07:59:21', '2019-01-29 07:59:21'),
