  ('zcrm_1579374000029888068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111417', 'Dimitri Soris', NULL, 'Dimitri called back wanting to know what he should do with a $106 derm bill- he asked if he should pay it. I told him that yes, he should pay it, but keep the medical resceipt. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-28 13:49:09', '2019-01-28 13:49:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029888063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977604', 'Michael Perkins', NULL, 'Michael called in because his daughter has been running a low fever and he was worried about her.  He thought that we could tell him about doctors in his area that are in network- he said that his daughter already had a doctor but he thought that his card might cover it.  clearly this person had no idea what product he ended up getting. I am going to send him a prescription medication quote out to him, and I already sent him Teladoc instructions. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-28 13:34:04', '2019-01-28 13:34:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029895013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029894103', 'Deborah Doolittle', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-28 13:13:50', '2019-01-28 13:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029888058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111417', 'Dimitri Soris', NULL, 'called in wanting to know what he received a bill from collections concerning his ankle.  I went through all things preventative and injury/illness care- when I asked about this bill and whether or not it exceeded the $1000 amount he said that yes...his bills were over the $4000. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-28 12:58:46', '2019-01-28 12:58:46'),
