  ('zcrm_1579374000029888003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'right now Monica is trying to explain to Matthew why the bill he submitted wasn''t adequet to submit.  Working on the VerMilyea family to help them understand what the process is. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-28 08:03:55', '2019-01-28 08:03:55'),
