  ('zcrm_1579374000029884003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177461', 'Lynn Taylor', NULL, 'Left a message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-28 07:50:11', '2019-01-28 07:50:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029835023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919234', 'Casey Hebb', NULL, '1-25-19 Casey called bc her daughter is in the hospital with the flu and pneumonia. They retroactively instated their Cobra to take care of this incident and one previously with Anthem. Their ded. is $3K. If they exceed 23 hrs in the hospital they will be considered out of network and she wanted to self pay and run it through Sedera. I spoke with Patti and she suggested I tell her to remain in network which means her daughter will have to be moved to another hospital since it will now be out of network. Called Casey and told her to do so. Then Dania called me back and she recommended the same thing. Stay in network and Sedera will be secondary ins and will pick up that which ins did not. They Casey asked about their past/initial incident in how to handle that. I didn''t have a good answer. That incident was while they were members but also still with Anthem retroactively. She will deal with that when she gets the bill and will ask Concierge for assistance at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-25 17:47:24', '2019-01-25 17:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029835018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '1-25-19 Santi and Maggie are married. Santi will be getting his SS # in 10 days. Maggie is Robin Tolan''s daughter. Therefore they are eligible for the MPB Group! I explained the Assoc first until I realized they are eligible for the group and Maggie is Robin''s daughter. Santi isn''t earning money in the US yet. But, their household income will be $50K-$60K which means Santi can''t get a subsidy and Maggie gets ins through work. Work pays $220 and she pays $220 for her ins. She will ask if work is willing to pay $220 towards this instead. Then the cost for the 2 of them will only be slightly higher than what she''s paying for herself right now. They don''t have pre-x and are healthy. Santi is 29 and Maggie''s 31. They were asking about maternity and what that would cost. Excited about home births and birthing centers to lower cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-25 16:05:37', '2019-05-31 15:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029835013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, '1-25-19 Talked with Mike and Linda again about adding a DPC to their membership. Patti received permission from Elizabeth Vargas to add a DPC to their Select membership if they choose. They had spoken with John who mentioned they can lower their monthly by increasing their IUA in June. They are considering doing that to counter balance the additional fee for the DPC. I told them they can no longer fund their HSA if they join the DPC. They laughed at how ridiculous the gov is. They currently have the $500/$599 MPB Group membership. They may increase their IUA to $1000 or $1500 in June or they may just join the DPC now. They also asked if they can just join the DPC and not worry about the discount if that helps. They can but might as well get the discounted rate. Linda has Lyme disease which is likely why they want to add the DPC for help with that. The DPC cost will be $140-$170 depending on the level of membership they choose. They will let me know when they run the numbers.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-25 14:55:02', '2019-01-25 14:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029801129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'wanted to know if he could use any of his services for his injuries caused by 2 seperate car accidents- Patti and I told him that Sedera would be secondary to the car insurances involved. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-25 14:53:01', '2019-01-25 14:53:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029801124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, 'Jenifer called in convinced that there was a tax form that she needed to file in regards with us, Patti explained why she didn''t.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-25 14:02:46', '2019-01-25 14:02:46'),
