  ('zcrm_1579374000029835003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447212', 'Charlene Bocek', NULL, '1-25-18 left vm to help her with her membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-25 12:19:54', '2019-01-25 12:19:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029801119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, 'called in sick with the flu and wanting to use Teladoc- I sent set up instructions as well as prescription medication quote form.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-25 12:11:42', '2019-01-25 12:11:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029801114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003156017', 'Myla Illene Roggensack', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent link.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-25 11:23:39', '2019-01-25 11:23:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029801106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038052', 'Paul Squier', NULL, 'called in for ID cards that were promised a month ago- I sent a request to ASI for a PDF copy and 2 hard copies to be sent his way and tagged him in the post.  He confirmed his address with us.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-25 11:13:14', '2019-01-25 11:13:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, 'Sent email to member to please contact us with updated address and phone number. Her RCI card got returned to us.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-25 11:12:44', '2019-01-25 11:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029801101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447212', 'Charlene Bocek', NULL, 'Charlene called in wanting to know if she still had coverage since the old portal was down- I explained that that particular portal was no longer there, and that a new portal was being worked on- she was upset and said it was shady.  Then she wanted to complain that her doctor''s office didn''t even know who we were and that was also shady.  I asked how she presented the card and told her that I would be sending her a script of sorts that will help.  I confirmed that her doctor was in network, and explained the importance of making sure that her visits with the doctor are preventative only- she asked what would happen if she told the doctor that she had bad menstrual cramps would that make it so that the visit may not be covered- I told her that if the doctor found it then necessary to run an ultrasound and labwork, then she would be a self-pay patient up to her IUA with Sedera.  She told me that I sounded stupid, I said I agreed the ACA can sound pretty stupid at times.  And she said THATS! why I don''t deal with doctors.  and she hung up.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-25 11:06:52', '2019-01-25 11:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029815013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610341', 'Guadalupe Bravo', NULL, 'Received an email from Darius saying that Husband went on Medicare effective 1/1 wanted to cancel for just him.  Told Darius that that would be a problem at this late date.  I told him that I would send him 2 links For Cancellation Request &amp; App link for wife to re-enroll.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-25 10:40:12', '2019-01-25 10:40:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029815008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019069', 'Steven Beard', NULL, 'Member submitted a Member Change form to remove Steven from the plan as he will now go on Medicare.  I have left a VM to explain that spouse Darcy will now have to re-enroll on her own as Steven is primary on this coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-25 10:05:10', '2019-01-25 10:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029803013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-25 09:20:08', '2019-01-25 09:20:08'),
