  ('zcrm_1579374000029734122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, 'Suzanne called in wanting to know how much the costs of Adderall and Ambiens were............I searched, and gave her a ballpark, I confirmed with her that YES she WILL need scripts from the doctor to purchase them.  I sent a prescription med quote form and asked that she fill one out next time.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 14:35:10', '2019-01-24 14:35:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029783008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '1-24-19 She''s interested in adding her daughter to membership but seemed like the additional cost was more than she was hoping for at $427/$1000 IUA. She was asking about getting a tonsillectomy for her daughter because she gets strep throat often. I told her that will be considered pre-existing. She has has strep within the last year or so. I told her she can utilize the Teledoc for strep throat and meds if that helps. She''s going to research other options and let me know if she wants to add her daughter who is 18.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-24 14:21:07', '2019-01-24 14:21:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029769067', 'Robert Ferrara Jr.', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-24 13:06:56', '2019-01-24 13:06:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439212', 'James Backes', NULL, 'accidentally called in here rather than to redirect- I transferred the call to the right place. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 13:04:32', '2019-01-24 13:04:32'),
