  ('zcrm_1579374000029734097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871102', 'Julie Weck', NULL, 'complained that she never got an address change form- I guided her to it.  also complained that there wasn''t any gyneocologists in her area- I helped her find 132.  I also sent her a payment update form. I made her happy in the end...............KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 11:51:54', '2019-01-24 11:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006552001', 'Lina Madison', NULL, 'called to update her email address with us. transferred the call to Liberty. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 11:48:32', '2019-01-24 11:48:32'),
