  ('zcrm_1579374000029783003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '1-24-19 Cami wants the MPB Group option for her and her wife Susie. Cami is 39 and just has allergies. Wife has bad vision. Cami has an Assoc of 3 members. I think that''s Rachel Holden and Katy Doty perhaps. But, really has Western Winter Sports Reps Assoc with 1100 Sales Reps she wants to share this with. Also works with 2000 retailers and small manufacturers. She will broach with her Board of Directors likely around March 5th for Assoc solution. Also wants info about small biz Group option. But wants to sign up herself for March 1st start date and knows the deadline of Feb 20th. Wants instructions to complete now and may add wife later or have her join her own membership. Legally married and file separately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-24 11:35:21', '2019-01-24 11:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029782003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741314', 'Demitrios Vassaras', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Putting in request for a replacement RCI card.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-24 11:21:08', '2019-01-24 11:23:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, 'Julie called in wanting to know if her plan covers her kids'' braces, I told her that she should speak to Wendy about maybe jumping on a discount or dental insurance plan.  Gave Wendy''s direct, and transferred the call.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 10:47:48', '2019-01-24 10:47:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, 'called to see if she could use her HSA for supplements that her daughter needs for a "pre existing condition" I told her that she could try going to the pharmacy counter to use it- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 10:42:29', '2019-01-24 10:42:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'answered all questions concerning HRA''s -36 month look back- 2nd MD info, Sedera''s phone number- and stressed the importance of giving them a call.   He has a history of getting hernia''s repaired- first one 10 years ago and another one 1- 2 years ago. sending this to Dania.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 10:38:13', '2019-01-24 10:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-24 10:28:08', '2019-01-24 10:28:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322508', 'Kirk Marshall', NULL, 'called because she couldn''t log in to her HRA, I told her that she will be receiving an email when she will be able to do so.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 10:22:39', '2019-01-24 10:22:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361581', 'Kathryn Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-24 09:50:35', '2019-01-24 09:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322508', 'Kirk Marshall', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out a 2nd QR Life code card for husband Kirk. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-24 09:24:27', '2019-01-24 09:24:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'wanted to know about what he should expect at his year renewal- I told him about the fee as well as that he will be contacted in regards to what he needs to do to remain compliant to the plan.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 09:18:22', '2019-01-24 09:18:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028801034', 'Keith Lackman', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book his 15 minute welcome call online. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-24 08:56:07', '2019-01-24 08:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743101', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, 'Maria had so many questions about preventive care and what constitutes as illness and injury- she admittedly knew nothing about the program- I answered all of her questions, gave her Sederra''s phone number, asked if she would like to be transferred (she declined) I sent her many emails as well, she thanked me. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 08:39:27', '2019-01-24 08:39:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003197186', 'Kathryn Richmond', NULL, 'called because she decided to cancel with us, I guided her to the cancellation form online. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 08:14:42', '2019-01-24 08:14:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674456', 'Kevin Moyer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-24 07:56:13', '2019-01-24 07:56:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029770003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005597027', 'David Burnett', NULL, 'Member called and I re-send him an invitation from Zoho Subscriptions as he is more comfortable updating his CC info online.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-01-24 07:52:33', '2019-01-24 07:52:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029734052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, 'called in because she is sick with the flu, and wanted to go to urgent care, I told her the better choice will be to use Teladoc, I guided her to the directions on our .com site, and told her to have the doctor send any scripts to anywhere but Walgreens because they can be pricey- I told her to call me back with the scripts so that I can send her a coupon. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-24 07:37:11', '2019-01-24 07:37:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029757031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, '1-23-19 Healthy, 62, Referred by both Robin Tolan and Deb Rice. But, seems Robin Tolan is the person who should receive the referral credit. Both are part of the MPB Group. Kathy has a family of 4 she wants to refer as well. Kathy takes 1 pill one time a month for potential osteoporosis, no diagnosis, more preventative measure. Lives in Carbondale. Has a Cigna plan now for $170 and company pays the rest. She''s planning to give notice and wants a March 1st start date. Like the $1000/$249 option and knows price will increase in June by $20+ dollars or so. Will get back to me next week after reads info I send.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-23 16:10:28', '2019-01-23 16:10:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029757023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416027', 'Judson Rogers', NULL, '1-23-19 Spoke with Judd about Lindsay''s mammogram. It was a basic mammogram done. The radiology facility that reads the mammogram is the out of network component that is out of their control. The bill is about $150 remaining. He does think ASi paid a portion of it. He mostly wants to know how to avoid this problem in the future and what to tell their friends so they don''t run into the same problem. They''re willing to come to Boulder or go elsewhere for her mammogram in the future if need be to avoid paying the excess fee for radiology component of reading test. No diagnostics were done, purely annual mammogram screening. He''s willing to pay this portion but wants help for future! The LOVE Sedera thus far. Lindsay had a bike accident and child has some respiratory challenges that have been handled incredibly well by Sedera so far. They are thrilled with that and telling friends. They have at least 2 committed referrals so far that they will be paid on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-23 15:45:33', '2019-01-23 15:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716070', 'Pete Greason', NULL, 'we had a great talk with Pete and his wife, went over preventative care and sent supporting emails. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-23 14:46:41', '2019-01-23 14:46:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, 'MPB Concierge Private . 04:26 PM

she just was wondering why her name was on all of the RCI cards that were sent out- I told her that it was because she was the Primary.  She asked how the doctor offices would know who her children were, I told her that they would present their cards stating "My mom is the primary... and I have coverage under her" I went over finding doctors in the network and sent out provider email, I asked if she wanted me to send her daughters the email as well so that they can do their own searches, but she declined.  no further questions. ticket closed.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-23 14:31:05', '2019-01-23 14:31:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, 'called in to inquire about preventative care visits- sent all supporting emails.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-23 13:45:31', '2019-01-23 13:45:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130153', 'Zachary Mixon', NULL, 'Called and mailbox was full. Sent email to reschedule welcome call', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-01-23 13:02:59', '2019-01-23 13:02:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029748033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'called inquiring about why her husband was being billed for preventative services "shouldn''t all preventive services be covered?"  she is going to send in what statements she is looking at. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-23 12:16:51', '2019-01-23 12:16:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029757008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, '1-23-19 Looking to join his local DPC for $75 for just him. He''s 45, wife is 42 and kids. Wife and kids will stick with trad ins. for $800 while he tests this membership first. He did have testicular cancer which is super slow moving and a 99% cure rate. He''s 4 years out and he''s not worried that it will ever come back. He understands if there''s a recurrence with his cancer that it will be his responsibility to pay for 100%, no cost sharing at all. He''s well aware and not concerned. He also takes allergy shots and psychotherapy that he will pay for on his own. He already pays as a cash paying patient for those. He owns a small biz with 8-9 PT employees. Was curious if creating group would make sense but truly not enough to have solid group of 6+.  Therefore, Assoc option best for him for now. Paying $800+ for family now and it would be much cheaper if pay for HES+DPC. They may transition whole family later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-23 12:10:17', '2019-01-23 12:10:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029716013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752164', 'Q. Patrick Coleman', NULL, 'Member called to say that his partner now had Health Insurance and wanted to cancel eff 2/1 and would he get a refund.  I advised that when he submitted Cancellation Survey I would process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-23 11:55:58', '2019-01-23 11:55:58'),
