  ('zcrm_1579374000029646003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862358', 'Edward Judd', NULL, 'Spouse of this member called in to say that they have gone to different coverage and did not renew this plan wants to be cancelled.  I will email with Cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-22 06:22:32', '2019-01-22 06:22:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029600038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584155', 'Hali Nurnberg', NULL, 'called to change billing info- sent form-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 14:39:11', '2019-01-21 14:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029641003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230005', 'Megan Kram', NULL, '1-21-19 Has a hip problem and will need surgery. Hoping to get coverage through county job soon. But in interim, income will be about $17K until Airbnb which will add about $6-$8K in May or June. Cigna looks to be best option for only $51.03. But, Dr. White said he doesn''t accept it but it''s showing that he does. 80218. Dr. Theiss shows as accepting it also. So, that may work. Otherwise Friday Health Plans Dr. White says accepts. So, maybe that as alternative. If she wants to keep her Drs. then PHCS  Co-Pay Network Plan will give her freedom to see whoever but not protect her for catastrophic. She''ll call drs. for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-21 13:52:19', '2019-01-21 13:52:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029600033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311418', 'Jonathan Archer', NULL, 'Jonathan sent in a prescription med request today for a very expensive insulin.  The best price I could find for him was at Blink Health.  I also have informed him that Reid is also working on a quote for him.  Fingers crossed. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 13:30:09', '2019-01-21 13:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029635028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616121', 'Catherine McDowell', NULL, 'Enrollee called in and told me that she had made a mistake when putting in the Pmt information.  I advised her that Set up fee was charged already I just changed monthly &amp; yearly renewal to bank info.  Member also said that Justin helped her enroll.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-21 12:27:29', '2019-01-21 12:29:12'),
