  ('zcrm_1579374000029600028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207130', 'Monica Robinson', NULL, 'called back confused because she had spoken to APEX and they told her that there was no $1,000 deductible with them and they are for preventative care only.  I told her that wasn''t the right number to call and told her to speak with Sedera about in tomorrow.  She said that she got a treatment plan from her chiropractor today and wanted to get it approved with Sedera so she know that she isn''t just "throwing her money away" she told me that she will be calling Sedera in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 11:57:50', '2019-01-21 11:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029600023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839147', 'Ashleigh Bechtel', NULL, 'Ashleigh called in wanting to know if she should submit a bill for a thyroid ultrasound.  I asked whether she had a previous diagnosis before membership or if this was something they had just discovered.  She said that this was a diagnosis, so I told her to make sure that she had all of the CPT coded medical bills, not just cash receipts and to submit them after she goes over IUA and to give Sedera a phone call at that time.  I gave Sedera''s number and sent a how to submit a need to Sedera email.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 11:55:56', '2019-01-21 11:55:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029632043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311418', 'Jonathan Archer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-21 11:26:30', '2019-01-21 11:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029600018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870100', 'Kelly Henson Renoud', NULL, 'Winston (AnaMarie''s father) called in to begin submitting AnaMarie''s hospital bills, last week there was an emergency where her school thought that she was having a heart attack and she was rushed to the hospital.  I sent over the email for submitting bills to Sedera as well as gave Sedera''s number and attempted to transfer him, but realized that they may not be there because of the holidays. I called him back to tell him to call again tomorrow.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 11:26:02', '2019-01-21 11:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029635023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881255', 'Cyndi Suttle', NULL, 'Member called in and advised that she would be going on Medicare eff 4/1 however had not gotten verification of that yet.  I sent her cancellation link and told her to submit in early March for cancellation to be effective 4/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-21 11:12:04', '2019-01-21 11:12:04'),
