  ('zcrm_1579374000029600013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330172', 'Rose Sonrise', NULL, 'Rose called in to ask if she would be covered when traveling to Mexico for a week, I told her that yes, as long as they bill her in English.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 10:02:34', '2019-01-21 10:02:34'),
