  ('zcrm_1579374000029600008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522064', 'Anne Kubitschek', NULL, 'Member called in because she said that she had tried calling the redirect phone numbers that she was provided but she said the line would pick up and she heard nothing, she said she tried that twice.  I asked her to hold while I tried to get a hold of them herself and the voice prompts were right there like they always are. transferred the call. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 09:34:38', '2019-01-21 09:34:38'),
