  ('zcrm_1579374000029604018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330090', 'Michelle Preuss', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member requested a replacement of RCI Card. contacted RCI to send out new card. Went over pre-existing conditions coverage. Told her a 3-d mammogram is not covered just a regular mammogram under preventative services. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-21 09:02:18', '2019-01-21 09:17:39'),
