  ('zcrm_1579374000029604003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082502', 'Kelli Crooks', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-21 07:51:59', '2019-01-21 07:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029600003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207130', 'Monica Robinson', NULL, 'Monica called in because over the weekend she needed to go to Urgent Care for severe back pain and the doctor there told her that she needed to see an orthopedic surgeon, she wanted to know if she needed to go to any special kind of facility so that she stayed in network. I told her that there wasn''t any network, but told her that she needs to keep Sedera informed as to what is going on and that they will have her go through the 2nd MD program, I sent her that info, gave her Sedera''s phone number as well as sent instructions on how to upload bills to them.  She said she was collecting the receipts. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-21 07:50:22', '2019-01-21 07:50:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029506018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870023', 'Zulma Fuller', NULL, 'Zulma called in to ask if there may be any additional help for her children''s mental help that we might be able to give, I told her that it would be a question for Sedera- I gave their phone number, then transferred the call to Marquis.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-18 14:12:53', '2019-01-18 14:12:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029532008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Member submitted a change of payment form. FTNI updated with new info.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-01-18 13:09:17', '2019-01-18 13:09:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029532003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005322969', 'Kenneth Peter', NULL, 'Member submitted a change of payment form. Info on Zoho Subscriptions updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-01-18 12:59:08', '2019-01-18 12:59:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653045', 'Mary Poole', NULL, 'Member called to ask for a full refund for Jan.  Stating that she was sick and doesn''t think that she should have to pay for something she didn''t use.  Does not remember Wendy at all.  Does not remember getting a letter from LHS.  
Refunded for November.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2019-01-18 12:54:14', '2019-01-18 12:54:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029506013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025174061', 'Phillip Jackson', NULL, 'he called in to make sure that we had the correct payment information and make sure that we hadn''t cancelled him. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-18 12:51:21', '2019-01-18 12:51:21'),
