  ('zcrm_1579374000029416023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, 'I finally got a hold of Carolyn and she said that she thinks she answered her own questions because she wound up calling- APEX, RCI, and Sedera after her welcome call with Liz.  She said that the welcome call made her feel more confused because Liz told her that her insurance was HMA- and didn''t understand why her card said RCI/APEX.  She kept saying that so far everything is so confusing.  I apologized and said that Welcome calls are not supposed to be confusing, and that I would have Vanessa get in touch with her ASAP for this. I ran searches for a primary doctors in her area, as well as sent supporting emails- one for provider search, the other for nomination- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-17 11:34:31', '2019-01-17 11:34:31'),
