  ('zcrm_1579374000029416018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605467', 'Sandra Walker', NULL, 'Sandra called for the best place to get a Shingles vaccine.  I told her that it would be best to go to her Dr, so that it would ensure that the doctor is coding it as preventative rather than just going to a pharmacy. I offered to transfer her to Liberty so that she could double check with them to make sure how it is coded and covered- but she said that she had already spoken to them._ KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-17 09:35:11', '2019-01-17 09:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029416013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740037', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, 'Lauren called in for help finding a doctor that can look at her ring finger that has been swollen and red for 6 months and she didn''t know how to use her program.  I did healthgrades.com searches on both hand specialists and rheumatologists in her area.  I also told her that she might want to go ahead and use Teladoc to inquire about what direction she should go in.  I reminded her of her IUA and gave her Sedera''s phone number telling her to be sure to call them if the expenses go over or are expected to go over to let Sedera know what is going on. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-17 09:04:31', '2019-01-17 09:04:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029423013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029420050', 'Jason Liddell', NULL, 'Employee Only $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-17 08:58:19', '2019-01-17 08:58:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029423008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899380', 'Dane Gaskins', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation survey I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; ASi and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-17 08:41:51', '2019-01-17 08:41:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029423003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666856', 'Patricia Lewis', NULL, 'Member called in and I returned her call.  Said she spoke to Liberty and was told that she didn''t need our service.  I will cancel her going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-17 08:18:00', '2019-01-17 08:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029416008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003197186', 'Kathryn Richmond', NULL, 'called wanting an explanation of benefits- she said that she would like to think about it some more whether or not she wants to cancel.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-17 08:17:00', '2019-01-17 08:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029416003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'I updated Joy to let her know that the check in question will be going out in 2 weeks from ASI, and there is nothing for her to worry about. _KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-17 07:45:20', '2019-01-17 07:45:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029374051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005322969', 'Kenneth Peter', NULL, 'sent change of payment form.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 14:51:18', '2019-01-16 14:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029374046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'called in asking for John,  they were having trouble submitting bills to Sedera, it kept freezing up on them.  I told them that John was on a call but I could put them in touch with Sedera- Lori said "that''s ok" and hung up on me. I will let John know.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 14:45:19', '2019-01-16 14:45:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029374041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021609048', 'Nicole Browning', NULL, 'Nicole called in wanting to update us on 2 elective surgeries that she is having done,  an enlarged thyroid that was just found and what would be covered if complications arose.  I told her that she needed to give Sedera that update, I gave her the number as well as transferred the call to Marquis.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 14:34:40', '2019-01-16 14:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029374036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674338', 'David Garlock', NULL, 'Lisa called in because she said that no one called her for her welcome call, I jotted down her number and gave it to John.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 14:23:14', '2019-01-16 14:23:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029374031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006263049', 'Peter Sarata', NULL, 'called in to have his bill explained, he didn''t know why he was being congratulated for joining when he has been with us for 2 years.  transferred the call to Sunny- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 14:15:47', '2019-01-16 14:15:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029387023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028543181', 'Danielle Dean', NULL, 'Received email with Danielle''s new home address.  I will resend MPB Card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-16 14:00:25', '2019-01-16 14:00:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029366137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-16 11:03:42', '2019-01-16 11:03:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029374023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, 'Eric called in wanting to find a doctor and facility to have a colonoscopy done, that are on the plan that he has.  He said that he wanted to find an actual specialist that his wife knows.  I told him that this would not be covered if not a preventative care visit and there was symptomology that he needed to present to a specialist.  He said that there was not and that he knew how the plan worked that way. I also told him that we request that our members DO NOT have big ticket items done for the first 3 months that they are with us.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 10:56:57', '2019-01-16 11:25:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029365081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004997191', 'Sandya Narayanswami', NULL, '01.16.19:  Called Sandya''s phone number on file - phone has been disconnected.  Called Kelly to find out about her call w/Sandya and phone #.  # not Sandya''s.  Emailed Sandya explaining situation and asking her to contact me or Sunny.  Sandya emailed back and called. Spoke w/her - explained HES/LHS situation. She said she has a number of health carriers covering her healh care needs.  Using LHS as her secondary carrier and BCBS as her first which is expensive and comprehensive except for minor needs that LHS covers.  All is too expensive -she wants to cut down on these  expenses and doesn''t feel HES is necessary if she no longer has the concierge to help her with LHS needs.  Will decide to continue w/HES or cancel and will call Sunny.
I briefly told her about HEP and said I will send her info.  I suggested she review it, then compare all that it offers to all her other carriers to see which program would best suit her needs.  Sent link to click funnel.
Called Sunny to give her an update on this situation.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-01-16 10:33:36', '2019-01-16 12:13:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029387018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029337149', 'Michael Taylor', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-01-16 10:23:30', '2019-01-16 10:23:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029358069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029420050', 'Jason Liddell', NULL, '11-16-19 Jay is a Talent Hunter and co-founder of his own biz. Was a 2 man biz but other emp moved back to Bermuda so now only legally 1 for ins. purposes. Super active, no health issues. Just wants to be protected in case he crashes his bike or in other sports he does. Maybe needs allergy meds, allergic to pain killers. Coverage ended Dec. 31st. May do Cobra for Jan. Wants a Feb. 1st start. Can join the MPB Group since referred by David Peck. Will work on app on own and must complete by Fri bc he''s traveling over weekend as well. Wants the $500/$299 option and will pay for it from his biz account. Not sure if he wants to set up an HSA or not. Explained the benefits. He''s 42.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-16 10:22:38', '2019-01-16 10:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029366132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126003', 'Christopher Martine', NULL, 'Sent out new QR life code card for member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-01-16 10:09:21', '2019-01-16 10:09:21'),
