  ('zcrm_1579374000029374018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126003', 'Christopher Martine', NULL, 'he called in with questions about getting a flu shot, I talked him through the process of submitting the bill on his own.  cash discount/ 130 % medicare allowable- send preventative care email.  Put in a request with Vanessa to send out a new Mmpowering Benefits card.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-16 10:00:35', '2019-01-16 10:00:35'),
