  ('zcrm_1579374000029358056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '1-15-19 Patti will check with Jennie to see if we can leave their membership alone for HES for one $50 fee for entire family even though they will split the family for their recent divorce. I gave her LHS # to call to split up membership. Will want to keep kids on one membership with one of adults. The other adult can pay for the HES portion perhaps. Told her to update the cc on file with the online form if they switch who is paying for that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-15 16:53:44', '2019-01-15 16:53:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029358046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781197', 'Daniel Siegrist', NULL, '1-15-19 Seriously considering Peak Med DPC with HEP Assoc for his family of 5. Healthy. Only issue is wife has non-insulin diabetes and has been managing it with diet and such and hasn''t had any issues since he''s known her for 10 years. Completely stable last 6-7 years with it. Cost for $1500/ $501 and DPC is $79 for each adult and $39 for each child. Understands deadlines and may move quickly. Really likes the DPC model.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-15 15:29:46', '2019-01-15 15:29:46'),
