  ('zcrm_1579374000029209023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, '1-10-19 She did a bunch of research and landed on MPB as best option so far. Husband has high blood pressure meds that he must take bc he drives for living and has CDL license and gets a CDOT physical. Only other issue is he''s had sun spots removed that may have been cancerous. I explained Pre-X clause and she understands. They are both in their late 50''s. Husband is turning 59 on July 31st, 2019. Their Kaiser plan was costing $1592 in 2018. Like PSDHC option to open their own HSA at their Credit Union.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-10 14:23:26', '2019-01-10 14:23:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029219018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910021', 'Sonja Ferdows', NULL, 'Sonja called upset that "we" were not paying for her hospital stay last month when she caught a virus.  I told her why it bounced back from ASI and all she could talk about was how confusing and horrible our plan was, and gave us advice on how to change.  I apologized- she didn''t like that either.  I gave her Sedera''s number- transferred her- sent how to upload bills.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-10 14:19:45', '2019-01-10 14:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029209018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459064', 'Lisa DeGan', NULL, 'Mpowering Benefits cards sent to Lisa and spouse, Joel.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2019-01-10 14:18:26', '2019-01-10 14:18:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000029219013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471183', 'Daniel Walsh', NULL, 'Daniel called from a doctors office confused as to what he was to show as insurance for his preventative care visit.  I gave him ASI''s number, as well as requested a PDF card to be sent to him. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-10 14:04:10', '2019-01-10 14:04:10'),
