  ('zcrm_1579374000029161013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419055', 'Shermin Farzam', NULL, 'She called in upset because she went to a facility that was on the list I sent her from new choice wouldn''t give her the discount that "we" sent her in an email.  She was livid- completely different person.  After awhile she calmed down..John told me to have her send in her bills as she gets them and the karis group can negotiate down the amount for her.  Also- I told her that Sedera will reach out and negotiate down the best price for her neck ultrasound. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-10 11:07:43', '2019-01-10 11:07:43'),
