  ('zcrm_1579374000028957018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, 'I am going to help get some med quotes for one of her sons, the other son is going to see an otho because of a skating accident.  I gave her Sedera''s number and urged her to call them sooner than later, I also emailed a how to on submitting needs to Sedera, as well as 2nd MD info.  Member was very happy that I called her back to help her figure out everything that is going on in the family. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-07 10:44:51', '2019-01-07 10:44:51'),
