  ('zcrm_1579374000028966008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000518266', 'Daniela Dadurian, M.D.', NULL, '01.07.19:  Cindyann from Dr. Dadurian''s office called Patti, asking what the $50 invoice she received is about. Said Dr. cancelled LHS last May.  Patti told her they would credit back her $50 for this month.  She was ok with that.  Patti told her to speak w/me.  I called and explained the history of the HES program for Dr. Dadurian. I told Cindayann I was never notified by Dr. Dadurian that she cancelled HES.  Cindyann is calling LHS to inquire about the Dr.''s membership.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-01-07 09:48:48', '2019-01-07 09:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028957013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, 'called to ask about $50 yearly renewal charge. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-07 09:45:04', '2019-01-07 09:45:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028957008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in wanting to have a derm billed explained, she was under the impression that it was preventative. I explained to her that it wasn''t and sent preventative care email with ACA attachment. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-01-07 09:35:22', '2019-01-07 09:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028966003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000518266', 'Daniela Dadurian, M.D.', NULL, '12.13.18:  Attended Dr Dadurian''s Holiday event. Dr. Daddurian complained that she has been trying to get reinbursed by Liberty Health Share for months and they won''t pay her and now won''t even take her calls.  I told her we are no longer dealing with LHS and have a new program I''d like to discuss w/her.  She doesn''t trust health sharing programs at this point. Told her we need to discuss and I will contact her to set up a meeting after the holidays, as she will be on vacation until then.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2019-01-07 09:34:16', '2019-01-07 09:34:16'),
