  ('zcrm_1579374000028955008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028801034', 'Keith Lackman', NULL, 'Member called and let us know he received a call from his bank saying that the account number we have on file has an additional number 1 in the end. FTNI record does not show an additional 1 in the end. I let the member know the account  is saved correctly but that we will keep an eye on his 1/22/19 payment.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-01-07 07:49:35', '2019-01-07 07:49:35'),
