  ('zcrm_1579374000028864038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, '1-3-19 Earl will be turning 60 in March. If joins for Feb. 1st then will have price for 50-59. Cathy is 57. They are healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. using Freedom Life and Cap Rock for wellness. Cap Rock is not covering all of their wellness visit labs and super frustrated. Also ded is $10K or $12K per year and paying around $800 for that, showing $1800 for C4. This will be $574 for PSDHC in 50''s. Pondering without MEC but is now preferring to keep MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-03 16:09:37', '2019-01-03 16:09:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028864033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '1-3-19 Checking on his DDP plan and forwarded him the info from DDP. Told him about small rate change in June 2019. He''s fine with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-01-03 15:32:05', '2019-01-03 15:32:05'),
