  ('zcrm_1579374000028609013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve called in because he received a bill for $120 for his wives mammogram,  he just wanted everything explained is all...he asked if it would be ok for him to call ASI himself, and I said of course!  Did I mention that these clients were mpowered yet!-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-27 13:04:57', '2018-12-27 13:04:57'),
