  ('zcrm_1579374000028351078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027982015', 'Sarysabel Cruz', NULL, 'Received a call from Florida Hospital asking how our plan worked and to explain the IUA.   I identified the member and she was there to schedule an outpatient procedure.  I explained she needs to call MPB member services first and they will connect her up with Redirect Health which she need to speak with to schedule this type of procedure first.  Also that her plan was not effective until 1-1-2019.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-12-19 13:38:16', '2018-12-19 13:38:16'),
