  ('zcrm_1579374000028339078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881277', 'Brandon Dwight', NULL, 'Mary from Apex finally got back to us concerning Brandon''s bills, she said that they have 2 bills on file from Aug 15 and 16th.  We know that the one billed on the 15th was for lab work, $1,497 she also said that his membership with them was July-Sept of this year. waiting for an update on the status of the claims. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-19 12:53:52', '2018-12-19 12:53:52'),
