  ('zcrm_1579374000028339068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220137', 'Deoni Levy', NULL, 'Deoni called in for a few different things, one of them being that her daughter had just gone to a foot specialist and now needed an MRI.  She told me that during her daughters softball season this year her ankle really started to bother her to the point of just yesterday seeking a specialists opinion, now he is ordering an MRI.  She was calling because she heard that we could price out facilities to keep the cost down.  I told her that because there were symptoms before her start date with us that this would not be considered as a need that Sedera would share in, she understood.  I got her in touch with Liz for her welcome call, I sent her all of the info she needed to find the best price on an ankle MRI, I told her to be looking out for an email to let her know when she can fill out her HRA,  I am also going to send her her guidelines because she cannot find the Sedera Welcome Pack.  Very sweet, and excited about this program. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-19 11:58:43', '2018-12-19 11:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028339063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354134', 'Mary Geitner', NULL, '12-19-18 Thanks for your note.

