  ('zcrm_1579374000028339053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354115', 'Cheryl Roether', NULL, '12-19-18 Thanks for checking with me Wendy! We have decided to postpone, at least for a little while. In talking with my Oncologist, it''s possible my cancer could recur although more than likely it would be a new cancer. We are also waiting to find out something on Darrel that could be considered a pre-existing condition. If that turns out to be nothing (which I believe it will), we may enroll him and drop the marketplace coverage. So we will be in touch!

