  ('zcrm_1579374000028339043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819433', 'Kaimey Ela', NULL, 'Kaimey called in uncertain as to how to approach her doctors office tomorrow when she goes in to get hormone therapy.  She already knew that she needed to present herself as a cash paying patient, but the doctor was pressuring her to bring in her APEX card anyway.  I told her that there was no need for that.  I also looked up her doctor to make sure that they were in network for her preventative care visit and they are. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-19 11:16:33', '2018-12-19 11:16:33'),
