  ('zcrm_1579374000028295083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294174', 'Mark Schwinge', NULL, '12-18-18 Thanks Wendy.  It doesn''t appear that the Sedara option will work for me due to its higher costs compared to Medi-Share.  Thank you for the information, however. 

