  ('zcrm_1579374000028295048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294073', 'Amber Shipley', NULL, '12-18-18 I helped her enroll in 2019 plan. She was auto enrolled at a higher income at $24K but the system was showing $20,500 and allowed us to proceed with that income which is more accurate. She thinks it might be even lower at $18K. Chose Cigna 4500 cheapest option bc 3500 wasn''t gaining her anything. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-18 16:06:04', '2018-12-18 16:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028295043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020307107', 'Heather Piper Musmanno Bianciotto', NULL, '12-18-18 This is a courtesy notification to let you know that we have processed a request to enroll the following into Direct Dental Plans:

