  ('zcrm_1579374000028295038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, '12-18-18 She and husband will have to pay $1300 mo for trad ins now with a $6500 Ded each. Husband takes blood pressure meds but well managed. Husband had injury to arm this past year. She had sinus infection. That''s it. Lisa writes about insurance for a living so she has an understanding. But, this was still overwhelming to her. She wanted to see financials but I explained the back up plan. She will share with her husband and wants to take time to ponder it all. She doesn''t want to rush her decision. Looking at PSDHC $1500/$574 for HSA compliance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-18 15:14:41', '2018-12-19 13:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028285038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, 'Dave called because Teladoc didn''t recognize him, he said it was for his daughter, and he didn''t want to take her to the ER.  I then scrambled all around to get in touch with someone over at Sedera...only to update Dave, and then he told me that she wasn''t sick now, but he wanted to know that it worked if she were................KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-18 14:59:44', '2018-12-18 14:59:44'),
