  ('zcrm_1579374000028285018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207130', 'Monica Robinson', NULL, 'As it turns out the provider that Monica went to let his contract with PHCS lapse leaving Monica with the bill- I spoke with Jamie at RCI and she said that if the provider didn''t mean for the contract to lapse, she could resubmit the bill to RCI for pricing and reimbursement.  Monica did say that she spoke to a "lady" who told her that her doctor was in network, but when I asked her if she remembered the name of the lady and she said she didn''t. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-18 10:19:04', '2018-12-18 10:19:04'),
