  ('zcrm_1579374000028157040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000173858', 'Caren Nealon', NULL, '12.15.18:  Called Caren to ask if her address is the same so I can send her a check for Christine Pembleton.  Also asked if she referred a man named Tom for HEP. She texted me that she referred him but his nameis Greg Valli. The phone number he left is his cell phone. Caren also asked me to send her info. re: HEP and call her next week to talk about it.. Emailed her link to funnel.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-15 08:41:24', '2018-12-15 14:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '12-14-18 46, supposedly healthy, sort of understands Pre-X clause but was asking weird questions. He wants a blood panel done and wants to know cost which I couldn''t give him. I told him if it''s part of wellness visit it''s up to his doctor to code it as such. If it''s outside the scope of wellness then he''ll have to pay for it. He didn''t like that answer and says I''m being elusive and it''s the only thing he wants. He will call his Dr. and get back to me on Monday. He didn''t think his UHC/Golden Rule is traditional insurance. He''s not very informed. He''s paying $5920 annually which is $493 monthly. He also wants to see an optometrist for vision stuff and I told him he needs separate ins for that which I can send him. He sees Dr. Iannotti for wellness but only saw him once. So, he''s willing to go elsewhere. He''s frustrated and putting that onto me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 17:11:19', '2018-12-14 17:11:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028222001', 'Elizabeth Shelton', NULL, '12-14-18 Referred by DPC Jamie Glover''s office. She has chronic fatigue that is managed and impriving from anti-viral meds and has depression. 45 and paying $450 with Anthem. Will join DPC. Loves that solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 16:48:34', '2018-12-14 16:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028150018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, 'member called in because she was "having trouble enrolling" as well as the IUA amount not being correct.  I said I would love to help...I just needed to know what plan she was signing up for...and she instantly got upset and repeated her concern/question- I repeated that I needed to know the plan she was on so that I could help find her application and fix the issue, she yelled and screamed "you know what?! I''m going to call back later....I''ll just call back later!" - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-14 15:08:24', '2018-12-14 15:08:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '12-14-18 Spoke with Michelle to complete the enrollment for for MPB only and to let me know. I''ll coordinate with Sedera to adjust her membership. She must be on own plan for the MEC+ component of the membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 15:03:37', '2018-12-14 15:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '12-14-18 Left vm for Art to complete the form so Michelle can enroll herself into the membership on her own to remain legal with current ins laws.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 15:02:21', '2018-12-14 15:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028150013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005236', 'Jason Reichert', NULL, 'Jason called in wondering about how cancellation works- he is not sure about doing it just yet.   I am going to contact Wendy about this. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-14 14:19:31', '2018-12-14 14:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019308021', 'Rachel Ravey', NULL, '12-14-18 She has a few more questions before she enrolls. Can talk on Monday if need be. I told her to email me if we don''t connect today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 14:09:10', '2018-12-14 14:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028151011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115365', 'Elizabeth Bennett', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-14 13:11:14', '2018-12-14 13:11:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, '12-14-18 Lived in Europe past 30 years and only been here for 4 months. Has STM for around $300+ Healthy, no pre-x, no meds. Joining MPB Group! 54 and Jan. 1st start. Just completed enrollment with me on phone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 13:01:32', '2018-12-14 13:01:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028152003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459064', 'Lisa DeGan', NULL, '12-14-18 "Hi Wendy!
We spoke on Wednesday regarding health insurance for my family.  I received your referral from Anne Singleton and need insurance for a family 4 as follows:
Me: Age 34, healthy
My husband Joel: Age 39, healthy
Son Jayce: Age 5 healthy
Son Brody: Age 3 healthy

We were looking into the plan that had a $500 deductible per each ''event'', I believe the plan was around $700/month?

Could you send me the application for this?  I''d like to go ahead and fill it out so we can have the new coverage go into effect on Jan 1st.  One last question, does this include dental as well?

Thanks so much!
-Lisa
(303) 667-5470"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-14 12:53:13', '2018-12-14 12:53:13'),
