  ('zcrm_1579374000028110024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'Elena called in because her eyes have been bothering her so much, she just needed to advice on where to go next.  She used Teladoc twice now for steroid drops and oral steroid medications...it worked for a time, but she can''t be on steroid''s that long.  She has seen the eye doctor now and they told her that she needs to see a specialist.  Elena is confused about what type of specialist to use, and Immuneologist or an Allergist.  I told her that she should utilize the 2nd MD program, I sent her all of the info.  She was pretty excited about it! - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-14 10:42:40', '2018-12-14 10:42:40'),
