  ('zcrm_1579374000028116034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '12.14.18:  Texted Daryl can talk. She asked for funnel link again to review it before we talk.  Explained HEP again and the Partially Self-directed plan. Daryl wants that option.  Sent her enrollment instructions and HSA bank brochure.. Said she will talk it over further with her husband, Kevin and will get back to me. Texted me she will enroll shortly.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-14 07:33:59', '2018-12-14 14:49:55'),
