  ('zcrm_1579374000028110014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809003', 'Tommy Turner', NULL, 'Tommy called in so that he will know what to expect for year renewal- I told him that he will be charged $50 dollars at his anniversary plan start, and that he will receive a text from Sedera with a link to resign the membership guidelines.  He wanted to say thankyou to all of us for being rockstars!  and said that we probably don''t hear that often enough from people but that he wanted to tell us that it''s true.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-14 07:29:15', '2018-12-14 07:29:15'),
