  ('zcrm_1579374000028121008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218052', 'Michele Collins', NULL, '12-13-18 Dan had cancer 5 years ago so not good option for him. Michelle is 47 and Dan 53. Live in Fruita. Did not understand how program work. Ryan spoke with them 6 weeks ago and thought they were up to speed. They are not and she may not join since Dan shouldn''t join.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-13 15:03:45', '2018-12-13 15:03:45'),
