  ('zcrm_1579374000028079109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990359', 'Mark Dieringer', NULL, 'Spoke to member and explained the charge. He claimed he was promised to not be charged an annual fee for the first 3 years of his membership due to the initial account set up fee of $150.00.. wanted to cancel, told him I will send him a cancellation form, said he will not sign anything... Left Analisa a message and send him an email including the cancellation survey and also his initial signed application where he agrees to pay the annual fee.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-12-13 12:23:21', '2018-12-13 12:23:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028092045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929321', 'Ruth Jackson', NULL, 'Ruth called in to order a Liberty card, I transferred her to their number. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-13 12:21:37', '2018-12-13 12:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028093068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082563', 'MINHTRIET DANG', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-13 12:13:56', '2018-12-13 12:13:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028092038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Alisha asked for help with a prescription and "Telemed" - I first asked her if she needed help with a prescription, and if so I could help her, then she said she needed to ask a someone to write a prescription.  I then transferred her to Teladoc- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-13 12:01:17', '2018-12-13 12:01:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028121003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '12-13-18 She''s enrolled in PSDHC for $375 a month. She just has non-insulin diabetes, super minor case, only 2 points away from normal. She will pay via check every month. She''s mailing in her check and signed form. I was able to reset her password temporarily to sign the doc. I used 11112222 for the password and told her. She''s all set to go now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-13 12:00:11', '2018-12-13 12:00:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028093063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082502', 'Kelli Crooks', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD +Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-13 11:53:29', '2018-12-13 11:53:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028092033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990359', 'Mark Dieringer', NULL, 'Mar upset about being charged $50 for yearly renewal fee. he is upset because he was told it wouldn''t come out this year but the next. Sunny is speaking to him now. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-13 11:51:03', '2018-12-13 11:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028092028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026552012', 'Karen W. Isaac', NULL, 'mistakenly called in to sign up for a health savings account. - I emailed her all of the info and instructions that she needs. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-13 11:36:02', '2018-12-13 11:36:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028092023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, 'Spoke to wife Carrie scheduled their 15 minute welcome call for Wednesday, December 19, 2018 at 10:00 a.m. mountain time/ 12:00 noon eastern time. Vanessa orozco', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-13 11:21:38', '2018-12-13 11:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028117003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919914', 'Tracy Sutton', NULL, 'Called in and I walked her through the HRA login to complete', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-12-13 11:12:04', '2018-12-13 11:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028116021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '12.12.18:  Peggy enrolled today in the Partially Self-directed option at 5000 IUA. Stan emailed me that she was enrolled and asked if they needed to do anything further.  I emailed that they will be receiving emails to instruct Peggy on setting up her membership account and will also get a welcome call, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-13 11:09:29', '2018-12-14 14:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028116013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '12.10.18:  Called Stan - he had more questions which I answered.  Also sent him Sedera Guidelines and Healthcare.gov list of services and screenings. Also included the enrollment instructions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-13 11:00:20', '2018-12-13 11:01:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028116008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, 'Peggy has an HSA already.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-13 10:58:52', '2018-12-14 14:44:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028093058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $500 IUA 40-49 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-13 10:58:40', '2018-12-13 10:58:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028116003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '12.06.18:  Stan emailed. They are ready to select a plan (probably Co-pay) but have a few more questions and would like to talk. Emailed Stan to set up a time wither today or tomorrow.  
Spoke with Peggy & Stan. Explained entire HEP program again and the 3 best options for her.  She chose the Partially Self-Directed. Gave them prices for this plan. Said they''d talk it over and get back to me. They also asked if they could find out if their doctor is in the PHCS Network. I sent them the link to the directory.

11.26.18:  Cathy Prosser (Karl Schoepglin''s wife) called.  Referred her brother-in-law who is interested in HEP for his wife, Peggy.  He has Medicare but she is 61 and needs insurance.  I called Stan and explained HEP.  Also sent him link for funnel.  Said he needed a few days to review it and would get back to me.  Peggy has been enrolled in a high deductible short-term plan - cheap but no coverage.  Peggy is basically healthy w/contolled medication for high blood pressure and cholesterol.  She had a hip replacement 3-1/2 years ago.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-13 10:55:21', '2018-12-14 14:39:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028093053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082373', 'Lawrence Sampson', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-13 10:43:24', '2018-12-13 10:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028110006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026552012', 'Karen W. Isaac', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member requested dental and vision plans available. Reaching out to Wendy to send her that info. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-12-13 10:32:32', '2018-12-13 10:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028092018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078069', 'Lauren Ankenman', NULL, 'called in wanting to know by what time she would need to cancel so her card wouldn''t be charged again.  I told her the 20th. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-13 10:21:33', '2018-12-13 10:21:33'),
