  ('zcrm_1579374000028039264', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459064', 'Lisa DeGan', NULL, '12-12-18 Lisa-33, Husband 39, 2 sons 3 and 5. Self-employed. Was using Unity Health for around $1000 a month and it was very limited in coverage. Looked up Dr. Bryan Kono and Dr. Beatrix Linn and both in network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-12 22:11:06', '2018-12-14 12:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028039259', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007599066', 'Gena Weir', NULL, '12-12-18 She needs STM while hoping to get a new job with CU in Jan. Not sure when she''ll know. Looked at IHC for around $462 (I think) for her and 2 daughters but couldn''t send app in an email. So checked National General and their prices were better and it included an accident policy and way lower OOP. Also was able to send her the app so she can join whenever she''s ready to. Much better. Might be able to cancel our appt on the 21st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-12 19:20:42', '2018-12-12 19:20:42'),
