  ('zcrm_1579374000028039028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, '12-12-18 Kelly just enrolled with me on line. She chose the $500 / $269 as a 29 year old. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, runs own pet sitting biz. Ins quoted to be $450-$500 for her this year! She travels out of the country sometimes and likes how this works. Turning 30 Nov. 28th, 2019. All set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-12 14:37:53', '2018-12-12 14:37:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028021026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, 'Dave called in saying that he broke a non- weight-bearing bone the day after he enrolled with us, he said that he had to go to the ER, and that he thinks the bill will be about $1900, he hasn''t paid anything yet, I gave him all of the info that he needed, he did not want to be transferred to Sedera, and I had to convince him to take their phone number.  He swore that the doctor said that he didn''t need surgery, and I really had to push back to be able to say that IF he DOES get an opinion of surgery that he NEEDS to call Sedera and let them know....He kept saying that he knows how everything works, and he thanked me for my help. I am sending him the how to email on submitting bills to Sedera.   I am going to slack this note as to give Sedera a heads up. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-12 14:07:40', '2018-12-12 14:07:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028039023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991230', 'Earl Gero', NULL, '12-12-18 Melina called me back to share more info about Earl. He went in and got MRI for sleep apnea problems. He''s aware it will be his cost since pre-x. Melina is trying to educate him about membership as is Dr. Brickley but he''s not as involved as anyone would like. Melina will encourage him to join the Welcome Call at the very least. She''s provided him with ALL info and he at least understands he will not get his current expenses shared bc pre-x. When he called into Concierge  Melina says they wouldn''t help him find a cheaper MRI location so they just went by Dr. Brickley''s recommendation and paid $800 for full neck and brain scan. Discovered no problems!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-12 13:55:41', '2018-12-12 13:55:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027996058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282111', 'Patricia Janes', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request I will notify Sedera &amp; ASi and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-12 13:35:26', '2018-12-12 13:35:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000028039018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, '12-12-18 Emily 30 and Aaron 37 are healthy, young, fit, currently no kids but looking to have them in 2 years of so. No meds, no tobacco, likes health sharing concept. Aaron did have his esophagus stretched in recent past and might need to have that done again. Told her if there''s a chance he will need to do so this year then he should stick with trad ins. Priced out for couple and single for her. Explained maternity options to lower cost. Will decide in next few days. I sent her enrollment instructions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-12 13:34:51', '2018-12-12 13:34:51'),
