  ('zcrm_1579374000028039013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082151', 'Pamela Oberly', NULL, '12-12-18 This is Ryan Hoff''s client that he''s referring to me as an RI until he becomes certified. He will earn the $100. Pam is 56 and John is 58. Pam had breast cancer 11 years ago. I was very clear that is her cancer returns and doctor considers it recurrence it will NOT be a shared cost. She understands. She was cleared after 5 years. John had a few knee surgeries years ago. I told them to talk with their doctor to see if there''s a chance of recurrence for either of them. They are ready to enroll now and sending instr to Ryan. They are choosing the $1500 IUA and Partially Self Directed bc their doctors are Not in network and don''t want to change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-12 11:26:03', '2018-12-12 11:26:03'),
