  ('zcrm_1579374000027929054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, 'Lindsay Patterson called in a pretty much emotional wreck, yesterday her daughter had to have an xray done, her doctor suspecting a tethered spinal cord.  She paid $700 out of pocket for the xray, the doctor says that he would not know for sure unless she had an MRI done.  I transferred her to Marquis at Sedera.  I will check in with her later this week. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-11 14:39:23', '2018-12-11 14:39:23'),
