  ('zcrm_1579374000027875058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862462', 'Randy James', NULL, 'Spoke with Randy''s wife Rachelle and she said they will take care of the HRA this week. Super nice lady.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-12-10 18:13:35', '2018-12-10 18:13:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027902046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177182', 'Anna Thexton', NULL, '12-10-18 Talked with Anna previously and again today. Christian "Figge", her boyfriend joined us today as well. He''s a little more confused in how it works but I think he''s on board now. They are both super healthy, fit athletes but might have old injuries they need to tend to. But, no real pre-x. Listened to the audio and visited the site extensively. Looking for Jan. 1st start date. Sending Anna enrollment instructions and can help Figge if need be. He''s currently with Kaiser, not sure about her. He has migraines and some meds he wants me to price out. He''ll email them to me. They want a Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-10 17:59:44', '2020-09-01 20:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027875053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809203', 'Heidi Beasecker', NULL, 'She called back and said that she is choosing a different group insurance plan through her real estate association.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-12-10 17:33:08', '2018-12-10 17:33:08'),
