  ('zcrm_1579374000027884111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786019', 'Amber Senator', NULL, '12.01.18:  Amber called.  Is ready to enroll.  Amber enrolled today for Jan. 1 start.  Decided on Co-pay option w/a $500 IUA for member only.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-10 17:18:09', '2018-12-10 17:18:09'),
