  ('zcrm_1579374000027902041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, '12-10-18 She joined on her own and then I explained incidents, pre-x, naturopathic, dr. network in their area. Her Dr. Ann Mass is Not in network. She will pay for her visit as self pay. But, she will also utilize the HSA to gain tax benefits. Self employed. Nice and easy going. Ready to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-10 17:13:18', '2018-12-10 17:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027875038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809245', 'Eliza Katzin', NULL, 'Spoke with Eliza. She does not want to complete the HRA because she is leaving the membership. She said it was a hassle for doctor bill and perception to be paid.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-12-10 16:54:46', '2018-12-10 16:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027902036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '12-10-18  53, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, self-employed realtor, owns own company, goes to his preventive visits every year. Has genetic high cholesterol which he''s on and off meds/statins for. Buys meds at Goodrx. Doesn''t have a DPC in his area but Sedera was pushing DPC. Has HSA already. Gets blood work 1x per year, chiro on occasion for preventive and derm check 1x per year. Wants to protect his assets in case of major health event. Mentioned Living Benefits. His wife has disability and is retired and has 2 life policies. He doesn''t have any. We should look at policy for him. His estimated income necessary if something bad happens is $3500-$4000 per month to cover expenses. Mortgage is $277,000 and plan to pay it off in next 3 years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-10 16:49:05', '2018-12-10 16:49:05'),
