  ('zcrm_1579374000027902031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165390', 'Viki Lawrence', NULL, '12-10-18 Broke and dislocated shoulder. Trying to see ortho asap. Hoping to get into surgery in Dec. to avoid paying ded. twice. Might keep Bronze plan if can get surgery done this year. Then will only have to pay for PT next year. She''ll decide once she sees ortho.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-10 15:59:56', '2018-12-10 15:59:56'),
