  ('zcrm_1579374000027902021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924354', 'Darrin Hallman', NULL, '12-10-18 Darrin 46, Rochelle 36, kids 14, 11, 8. Son was cleared from small hole in heart from birth. No symptoms, no treatment ever and again cleared of that 2 years ago entirely bc hole had filled in. Not putting as pre-x bc no symptoms or treatment and diagnosis was 8 years ago and cleared 2 years ago. Listened to my recording! Darrin''s neck was fused in 2000 and now it''s bothering him a bit. He gets injections on occasion. He knows he''ll pay the cash price for those injections. He thinks they cost around $300-$400 retail. He also has a heart murmur and takes a blood pressure med to help the heart murmur called lostartin or something close to that name. Already have an HSA. They were referred by a local group called Alive and Well who have a group membership. Just enrolled into Assoc PSDHC $1000/$706 for family of 5. We need to look at LIVING BENEFITS for his heart situation. They each have term policies. His is for $2M and hers is for $1M. He will send me info about each of their policies as well as their necessary income they''d need on a monthly basis if one of them has a major medical incident.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-10 13:42:38', '2018-12-10 13:42:38'),
