  ('zcrm_1579374000027800043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082222', 'Daniel Oehrle', NULL, '12-7-18 Thomas Williams will be paying for Daniel and his twin brother. They are Tom''s nephews. They are 33. Neither currently have insurance. They can join the MPB Group and choosing same membership as Tom at the $500 IUA level. No pre-x, YES on tobacco. Told him of the $75 surcharge and limitations when 50+. Sounds like he uses it off and on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-07 16:02:37', '2018-12-07 16:03:04'),
