  ('zcrm_1579374000027559063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885255', 'Azucena Soto', NULL, '12-4-18 Healthy, no tobacco, not overweight. Used ACA and paying $1500-$1600. She has hypothyroid  for 20 yrs. and takes meds. Might have had an HSA many years ago but no longer. Went to Dr. 1x per year. She will be 60 in Jan. She should use the Provider Directed option and husband should use PSDHC since cheaper to split them up. 60 at $500 IUA ReDirect - $578 and 58 PSDHC 58 is $375. Total is $953.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-04 16:18:43', '2018-12-04 16:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027536063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005095032', 'Gina Ricci', NULL, 'Member called in after hours to cancel.  I got msg via the Betties.  I will cancel her subscription.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-04 15:42:16', '2018-12-05 07:14:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027572023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977255', 'Carrie Mitchell', NULL, 'Selerix SSN - 951-70-0005', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2018-12-04 15:18:07', '2018-12-04 15:18:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027559053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885127', 'Bergen Kunselman', NULL, '12-4-18 Bergen is 41, husband 38 and kid 5. Husband and child healthy. Bergen takes 4 meds for mental health stuff that she''s dealt with for 20 years. She understands if she lands in the ER for mental health it''s her responsibility to pay for. She''s never been in ER for mental health. Paying $800+ month now. Goes to Dr. Bryan Kono and he''s in-network. Assoc PSDHC option with HSA $1500/$655.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-04 14:55:59', '2018-12-04 14:55:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027572018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177256', 'Russell McKendry', NULL, 'Presentation completed. She and husband will likely choose Partially Self-Directed. Mympb.com given as the first step in the enrollment process.', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2018-12-04 14:44:07', '2018-12-04 14:44:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027523050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'asked if she had a medical emergency would she need to make sure that they were in network.  I told her that there is no network with Liberty, she asked if she could go to Keiser, I said yes, in an emergency situation she can can go to anyone, because she will be submitting the bills to Liberty.  She said John told her that she shouldn''t go to Keiser, I said that it was probably because he meant that she shouldn''t go there for preventative care and it would probably be best practice to call Liberty at that point. Then she said goodbye and hung up.   but after reading these notes, that just seems like a regular thing she does. hang up. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-04 14:43:21', '2018-12-04 14:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027559048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082183', 'Eliot Hinshaw', NULL, '12-4-18 Ryan Ashley plans to pay for the Hinshaw''s membership through their church. Eliot is 28, wife 25, 3 and 1.  They were doing C4 before and then LHS now. Looking for Jan. 1st start date. Explained whole membership MPB Group to Eliot and will share with his wife. I''ll send email and audio. We are enrolling him on Friday with list bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-04 14:10:18', '2018-12-04 14:10:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027523045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023291015', 'Robert "Kevin" Sanders', NULL, 'Robert, or Kevin that he goes by called pretty upset from having to call redirect 6 times due to foot pain and hasn''t gotten an appointment made with a specialist yet.  I spoke with David Slepak and he told me to next time send disgruntled clients to redirecthealth.com/extrahelp  that the message that the client has will go straight to upper management to get resolved. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-04 14:00:57', '2018-12-04 14:00:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027536058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529333', 'Joseph Hartzell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-04 13:34:05', '2018-12-04 13:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027576003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, '12.04.18:  Texted Karen - asked if she recvd my email of 11.27 and reminded her of the deadline to enroll for Jan.1 start.  Asked if she is still intending to enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-04 12:51:59', '2018-12-04 12:51:59'),
