  ('zcrm_1579374000027531023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '12.04.18:  Left Daryl a text message to ask if she is ready to enroll and to let me know either way. Recvd text response: thanked me for checking in, said she should have some time this week to talk. Told her to let me know when so I can schedule a call. Said she would.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-04 11:52:50', '2018-12-06 06:52:51'),
