  ('zcrm_1579374000027568013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '12.04.18:  Spoke w/John re: pricing for current group plan w/higher IUA:  Price for program will go up from $249 - $268 as of June 1, 2019.  With higher IUA of $1500 price would be $247 (current IUA is $1000).  Discussed this w/Cathy. Said he''ll stay on this plan.  Also, Karl is getting Sx on skin cancer on his ear.  John told Cathy she needed to call 2nd MD.  She told me when she called them the girl she spoke to was totally confused. I told her to call Sedera and let them know. She emailed me back and said Sedera said they will deal w/2nd MD for her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-04 11:05:43', '2018-12-04 11:05:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027568008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005903147', 'Owen Chikazawa', NULL, '12.04.18:  Own emailed. Said cancellation had nothing to do w/the program. He found healthcare on healthcare.gov that is much cheaper for them. Emailed him back to thank him for letting me know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-04 11:01:04', '2018-12-04 11:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027559033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233260', 'Brandy Echery', NULL, 'Risk assessment paid twice by mistake. Correct date paid was 10/9/18', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-12-04 11:00:16', '2018-12-04 11:00:16'),
