  ('zcrm_1579374000027565003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038265', 'Robert Burg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Robert and Kathy Tagenel the referring member as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-12-04 10:27:17', '2018-12-04 10:56:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027523035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005039', 'Ryan Richards', NULL, 'called for cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-04 10:23:42', '2018-12-04 10:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027523030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Therese called just after 5 and we had very long conversation going over how she needs to be remaining compliant with her plan, preventative care, and someone that she was thinking of referring (last year diagnosed with breast cancer and mastectomy)   - she had a question about 2D vs 3D mammogram, sent it to Leena, waiting on an answer.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-04 10:09:09', '2018-12-04 10:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830370', 'Michele "Shelly" Valinttine', NULL, 'called in regarding HSA use for family members not on the plan.  Yes they can.  all eligible dependents (based on tax return) can spend out of that account even if they aren''t on the plan.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-12-04 10:06:50', '2018-12-04 10:06:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027536028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529094', 'Dustin Smith', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $500 IUA 30-39 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-04 09:56:31', '2018-12-04 09:56:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027523025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282111', 'Patricia Janes', NULL, 'called to ask about options with her health plan, she wanted to know the amount if she added her family, and inquired about health and vision plans. I told her that Analisa would be the best person to call.  I made sure that she had her number.  She said that she did. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-04 09:54:48', '2018-12-04 09:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027536023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177004', 'Aaron Barnwell', NULL, 'I received Sedera activation and I have no MPB App for this member.  I left VM at contact number advised that there was a problem with this application.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-04 09:43:19', '2018-12-04 09:43:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027557002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat with MPB Concierge', 'Visit ID : 415 
Question : I thought i filled out all fields and was enrolling but can''t find my enrollment to finish it', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-12-04 09:33:28', '2018-12-04 09:33:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027531018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819397', 'Lynette Prosser', NULL, 'Spoke to member booked her 15 minute welcome call for Friday, December 7, 2018 at 12:00 noon mountain time/ 2:00 p.m. eastern time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-12-04 09:16:52', '2018-12-04 09:16:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027536018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654006', 'Myra Levin', NULL, 'Received Activation notification frm Sedera, however I have no application from this member.  I contacted Kevin Michaels on 11/30.  He called in and told me he was unable to contact enrollee.  I will send email to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-04 09:11:44', '2018-12-04 09:11:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027536013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, 'Received Cancellation Survey from this member I will cancel Sedera &amp; ASi &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-12-04 08:53:50', '2018-12-04 08:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027523017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919210', 'Kerry Paolillo', NULL, 'Brian called in because his daughter Kerry needed to go to the ER at the beginning of November and now is going to need more treatment.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number as well as transferred him.  Sent submit need to Sedera email. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-04 08:48:17', '2018-12-04 08:48:38'),
