  ('zcrm_1579374000027508030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991230', 'Earl Gero', NULL, '12-3-18 Left vm for Melina to connect with Earl Gero to make sure he understands how and why the membership works. Sounds like he was not educated since Melina is the one who signed him up and now his wife is calling on his behalf. I need to speak with Earl himself.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-12-03 15:15:57', '2018-12-03 15:15:57'),
