  ('zcrm_1579374000027514003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962712', 'Wesley Hopper', NULL, 'adding to Selerix...The Essentials - Member only Kyle - Agent', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2018-12-03 14:57:59', '2018-12-11 12:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027473041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521396', 'Kevin Cahill', NULL, 'Denise called in for explanation of preventative care coverage, she did understand why there was much of Kevin''s bill that was not covered due to high blood pressure and being on a bit of medication.  I have reached out to ASI with Kevin copied to get some more clarity and see if the preventative blood work was covered. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-03 14:57:11', '2018-12-03 14:57:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027508011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '12.03.18:  Called Jessica to confirm payment debit from her credit card. She said she deposited money in the bank so all should be good.
We discussed several possible referral arrangements:  her church - Calvary Christian Center, (has a large congregation), Ron Sharpe, who runs the christian chamber of commerce and her realtor group, etc. Also, her husband Danny may need a health plan.  He is 60.  Explained all new HEP programs and sent her link to funnel.  Said she would look them over w/her husband this coming week and get back to me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-03 14:55:32', '2018-12-03 14:58:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027466039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962554', 'Natalia Guillot', NULL, 'Enrolled into Essentials: Employee Only Guy -Agent', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2018-12-03 14:13:28', '2018-12-11 12:17:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027473036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'Therese called to ask how the referral process worked, both Patti and I told her to contact Jane and to ask that she would be marked as the refering member.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-03 14:12:50', '2018-12-03 14:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027473031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014924037', 'Keith Glenn', NULL, 'I talked Keith through the preventative care process, nominated his doctor for the plan, sent preventative care provider email, found a labratory in his area that is in network, as well as told him to tell the office that he has a preventative care plan only, and bloodwork needs to be coded as such. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-03 13:43:54', '2018-12-03 13:43:54'),
