  ('zcrm_1579374000027455038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001171017', 'Thomas Williams', NULL, 'Thomas called in from a sleep study facility wanting his card information because he lost his wallet.  I told him that this wouldn''t be covered by his ASI card, but that he would need to speak with Sedera to see if they would share in it.   He asked "so it won''t be covered" and I said I didn''t know but that I could transfer him over to someone at Sedera. He said "no thankyou for your help." and hung up.  I will reach out to him via email to try to explain and follow up. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-12-03 10:59:17', '2018-12-03 10:59:17'),
