  ('zcrm_1579374000027410031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695463', 'Steven Pope', NULL, 'Emailed Roy to alert him to this member''s cancallation and suggest he contact Steven to find out situation.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-01 09:37:56', '2018-12-01 09:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027410026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005903147', 'Owen Chikazawa', NULL, '12.01.18:  Called Owen, couldn''t leave a message as voice mailbox was full.  Emailed him to ask about the cancellation.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-01 09:36:28', '2018-12-01 09:36:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027410021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243027', 'Lucia Leao', NULL, '12.01.18:  Emailed Ray to inform him of Lucia''s cancellation and to suggest he contact her and find out the situation.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-01 09:32:44', '2018-12-01 09:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027410013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, '12.01.18:  Called Christine, left her a message, letting her know I''m sorry we weren''t able to accommodate her financial needs.  Told her to call me with any concerns or if I can help her in any way.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-01 09:02:51', '2018-12-01 09:02:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027410008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379112', 'Paula Cole', NULL, '12.01.18:  Found out from Denise Matouk that Paula no longer works at that practice.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-01 08:51:18', '2018-12-01 08:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027410003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '12.01.18:  Called Denise to ask reason for cancellation.  Her new boss decided to go w/United Health Care - traditional plan and he needed another person to add to plan to get it so he''s paying for her.  She said she told him how well HEP has worked for her but he didn''t feel comfortable w/a non-traditional approach.  If it doesn''t work out with him, she will definitely call me to re-enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-12-01 08:48:50', '2018-12-01 08:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027394035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027386134', 'Ryan Ketterer', NULL, '11-30-18 Ryan is 28 and looking for something under $200. Paying about $220 now with small APTC of about $20. Just had sports injuries and also has lyme disease but not significant symptoms yet. Traditional insurance doesn''t cover it anyhow. He''s going to keep looking but keep this in mind for later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-30 16:21:04', '2018-11-30 16:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027394027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, 'Enrolled with me just now for PSDHC for her and husband Nathan. Both healthy. He just has very slightly elevated blood pressure that he may stop taking meds for. Had an HSA long ago. Cost for healthcare in PA is more than their mortgage! She loves this option and is very relieved. Chose $1500 / $486.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-30 15:57:12', '2018-11-30 15:57:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027349023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'sent Nancy goodRX coupon as requested. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-30 14:24:43', '2018-11-30 14:24:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027394019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654153', 'Michael Brenner', NULL, 'He listened to the audio and didn''t really have any questions. His boss, Paul Goin also explained it to him and he''s ready to go. He''s getting in front of a computer and will call be back as soon as he''s home.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-30 14:15:55', '2018-11-30 14:38:54'),
