  ('zcrm_1579374000027392008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416027', 'Judson Rogers', NULL, '*letter sent to ASI*Hello Monica and Veronica,

I just got a phone call from Judson Rogers, wanting to speak to me about what happened to his wife Lindsay''s mammogram bill- he said that he called you multiple times trying to get the bill settled.
According to him - the facility WAS in network, but the radiography equipment inside was NOT (unbeknownst to them).  He said that you all tried multiple times to call the provider and they wouldn''t budge.
It is Mountain Radiology that is saying that they still owe $150 
He says it isn''t about the money but the principle.
My question to you guys is- was there a coding issue here at play? *email* -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-30 11:36:13', '2018-11-30 11:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027394008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361869', 'Robin Tolan', NULL, '11-30-18 Robin is 62 and John 64 turning 65 in July. Live in Glenwood Springs 81601. Listened to audio and believes in whole concept! They are paying only $700 a month for Peter Lloyd''s of London with max coverage of $1M. Not sure how well it works since never used it. Will keep Dr. Gary and son Dr. Chad Knaus at Roaring Fork Family Practice. They are in PHCS network. She LIKES the Group concept and is happy to refer and complete health assessment. Choosing the $1000 / $485 a month. Referred via Lorrie Carlson. Tested for illegal substances every year because works with a youth group. So, clean and clear! Enrollment complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-30 11:32:01', '2018-11-30 11:43:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027395003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962404', 'Jahzmin French', NULL, 'Redirect - Employee + Child; Guy - Agent', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-30 10:52:21', '2018-12-11 10:10:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637109', 'Mary Hostetter', NULL, '11-30-18 Healthy 57 and husband 64 daughter in college. Husband is a lawyer. He hurt his ankle. Mary is healthy and prefers holistic approach. No tobacco, no meds. MPB GROUP via Joy Spring. Looking for Jan. 1st start date. Was on Medicaid with so many deductions. But, thinks income will be too high and seems to also think too high for APTC but will run the numbers this weekend. Follow up appt on Wed.  Dec. 5th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-30 10:52:17', '2018-11-30 10:52:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027349013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785064', 'Joshua Pentkowski', NULL, 'Spoke with Josh, his employer is going to cover all or part of the monthly share amount.  I sent them the third party payor form.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-30 10:32:41', '2018-11-30 10:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027371016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361581', 'Kathryn Johnson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-30 10:32:30', '2018-11-30 10:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027392003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, 'Danna called in wondering about what she needed to do to stay compliant on the plan she has, she said that she referred about 9 people, I told her it wasn''t showing, she said she gave them to Wendy. - ISSUE WAIVED PER ROD - she then asked if her plan through us would also include Nextera, because she heard that Sedera had merged with NEXTERA, I told her that I would have to do a bit of digging because it sounded unfamiliar to me.  She said that Nextera was a gymn/fitness center.  Rod took the call because he knew what was going on and spoke to her about moving over to a DPC plan with us and dropping the MEC, he answered all of her questions and told her that Wendy would be informed as to the conversation.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-30 10:30:26', '2018-11-30 10:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027371011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361480', 'Michelle Crissey', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-30 09:06:24', '2018-11-30 09:06:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027371003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447476', 'Mia Fanali-Skowronski', NULL, 'Member submitted new app for Access PSD $5000 IUA .  I will update pmt info and input into RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-30 08:32:21', '2018-11-30 08:59:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027356003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610129', 'Bethany Stoll', NULL, 'Bethany called in making sure that she is doing everything to remain compliant in her plan, I told her that she would be receiving an email with instructions on how to go about updating her HRA.  She wanted to know about the price hike in June, I gave her a rough estimate.  She wants to switch to copay plan, I told her that because she has select, she can switch to access with Sedera, but to check with Darius about whether or not she could do the copay/access plan.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-30 07:46:31', '2018-11-30 07:46:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027349008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Dec payment returned a 2nd time.  Will email the member.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-30 07:18:43', '2018-11-30 07:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027349003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497127', 'Carol Walker', NULL, 'Member sent in cancellation form stating that she is concerned about bills being paid.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-30 07:01:39', '2018-11-30 07:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027271273', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '11-29-18 Family of 5. 36, 36, 8, 5, 2. Healthy. Was paying $3000 with Cobra and then $200 with Medishare/Christian Share with $10K ded but frustrated by limited network for provider for ENT. Only has hip tendinitis to worry about. Also had an ER visit for one of the kids who was dehydrated. Had an HSA in the past. Ready to sign up but she was driving. I sent her enrollment instructions to do this weekend. Wants the $1500 / $629 PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-29 14:47:48', '2018-11-29 14:47:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027271268', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311418', 'Jonathan Archer', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-29 14:07:36', '2018-11-29 14:07:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027271263', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675058', 'Anthony Peck', NULL, '11-29-18 Called and asked about size of membership and what if large cancer incident happened how is that managed. He got nervous and was going to cancel bc the size of the membership wasn''t as big as he wished. After I spoke with him again and shared more of my knowledge, Sedera''s backup plan and my personal trust in Sedera as a member myself he has decided to stay put with the membership. He was super appreciative of my call back and feels good about his decision. Thought he wanted a Medishare since they have 400,000+ members but they have more holes in guidelines and religious exemption, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-29 13:54:31', '2018-11-29 13:54:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027271252', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311209', 'Jill Temkin', NULL, 'Per Wendy this members DPC is starting their own group w/Sedera.  Of course price is lower so member going with that option effective 1/1/19', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-29 13:49:04', '2018-11-29 13:49:15'),
