  ('zcrm_1579374000027271242', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '11-29-18 Came through Luke at Sedera via Tracy Maxwell who is showing as House Account. Jennifer teaches nutrition at school. She helps tons of entrepreneurs and healthy people looking for alternative solutions, naturopathic drs. etc. Folks she''s surrounded by are open minded and want better solutions and don''t want to be pushed down trad path. Show alt care from guidelines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-29 13:34:44', '2018-11-29 13:51:08'),
