  ('zcrm_1579374000027319066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025174061', 'Phillip Jackson', NULL, 'Phillip called in kinda confused about who to call for what.  He wanted to know what card to give a medical provider.  I told him that if he needed to speak with a provider than he needed to call Redirect.  I told him that he needed a welcome call, I also asked him if he wanted me to redirect him to redirect, he said no...but that he wanted their number.  I transferred the call to Liz for her to do the welcome call.  Also sent payment change form link - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-29 12:38:58', '2018-11-29 12:38:58'),
