  ('zcrm_1579374000027271221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, '11-29-18 43 and mostly healthy but had hypothyroid but taken off meds a year ago. Gets ultrasound on thyroid to keep an eye on it. Using Aliera and Sure Bridge right now but says it''s terrible. Paying about $328-$340 a month. Wants to see Dr. Gayle King and she''s not in the PHCS network. She''s been seeing her for 17 years and wants to keep her. So ReDirect is best option for that. Also sees chiro ongoing. Sees Endocrinologist, ENT and maybe ortho but Co-Pay Network won''t work bc network is too limited for her in Aspen. Just need to make sure she can do a 3D imaging mammo and see Dr. King as PCP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-29 11:36:36', '2018-11-29 11:36:36'),
