  ('zcrm_1579374000027319036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508059', 'Marla Ratcliff', NULL, 'Called in just needing hand holding  when searching for a mammogram facility, she was saying that she might want to do a 3D mammogram, I asked if this was the dr orders because he was suspicious of something, or just her preffrence, she answered that it would be her preffrence.  I told her that ASI only covers basic mammogram, and she was fine with that.  I helped find a basic mammogram facility in network.  Happy client, very sweet and wants to learn all about the plan so she can do things on her own. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-29 09:47:49', '2018-11-29 09:47:49'),
