  ('zcrm_1579374000027319021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Floyd called in because of an emergency bill pertaining to his eye back in January, he accidentaly gave the hospital his ASI card because he said he didn''t know any better and the $2,000 worth of bills, of course, bounced back to him.  He said he got these bills in August and just felt like there was nothing to do with them, so he called in for advice.   I sent him a how to submit email for the sedera app, gave him Sedera''s phone number and then transferred him to Marquis over at Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-29 08:54:14', '2018-11-29 08:54:14'),
