  ('zcrm_1579374000027319016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937151', 'Janae Sowards', NULL, 'Janae and her husband called in because they were told that her APEX card was cancelled.  I explained the situation and told them that I would request PDF as well as card copies of their ASI card be sent out to them.  I also assisted with a multiplan search, as well as sent out educational supporting e-mails with explanations.  They were happy for the help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-29 08:29:31', '2018-11-29 08:29:31'),
