Hi Jane, 

Per our conversation today, I request that you cancel my membership to My Academy of Health.  I never would have purchased this if it was not required to obtain health insurance through Liberty Healthshare.  When I cancelled Liberty Healthshare  in June 2017 this should have automatically cancelled at the same time.  I did not need it, nor use it either during my enrolled period with Liberty Healthshare or once I went on Medicare after my 65th birthday in June 2017.

Please explain this situation to MAH and try to get my fees reimbursed.  Let me know what you find out, but please confirm that I am in fact not paying any more fees to My Academy of Health.

Thank you,

