  ('zcrm_1579374000027282003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038161', 'Karee Watson', NULL, 'Karee called in yesterday upset, and I want to say a bit bewildered by the fact that she had given a king soopers pharmacy her APEX card for a flu shot and the response was that she was cancelled.  I have requested a PDF version of her ASI card as well as a hard copy.  I left a message on her machine to tell her what is going on, and am going to e-mail as well.  We spoke about how getting her flu shot from a doctor that is in network would be her best bet, and to tell her doctor to code it as preventative.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-28 09:55:19', '2018-11-28 09:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027280013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977072', 'Melissa Maxwell', NULL, 'Member Only; Essentials; Guy - Agent', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-28 09:49:15', '2018-12-11 12:58:50'),
