  ('zcrm_1579374000027214021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027977306', 'Tiffany Monroe', NULL, 'Tiffany Monroe completed paperwork to enroll her in RREMC Group Redirect Plan.  Need to add her name into Selerix program to enroll her in Group Plan.  Client wants Redirect - Employee Only &amp; Spirit Dental Plan - Employee Only. ***Cleared to enroll her to Selerix Platform*** Kyle - Agent', 'Kyle Sheehan', 'Kyle Sheehan', '2018-11-27 18:12:48', '2018-12-11 13:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354156', 'Amy Moore', NULL, '11-27-18 Randy is 60 and wife 54. His child is marrying Arn''s kid. He read all about Sedera already. He''s run 25 marathons in 5 years and some ultra marathons. Neither of them take meds. He''s fine with referring and taking health assessment. Likely want a Jan. 1st start date. Email audio and email #1 and provider search. Meeting Monday Dec. 3rd 1:15 MST.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-27 16:28:07', '2018-11-27 16:28:07');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165362', 'David Blair', NULL, '11-27-18 Chose Anthem HSA Bronze plan to lower monthly cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-27 15:33:31', '2018-11-27 15:33:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354186', 'Curtis Henderson', NULL, '11-27-18 I gave them the option of MPB Group and Assoc and they are likely choosing the Assoc option bc feels more comfortable to them. They are both 54 now and Curtis left his employer Oct. 12th and Cobra must decide by Dec. 15th to back date it. Cobra will cost $1300 and C4 is just as bad. Currently has HSA. Goes to Arvada Family Practice with Dr. Maybach and Dr. Stephanie Christie. Only health issue is Barb takes cholesterol meds. Might also want STM for month of Dec. to protect them for 15 days so they don''t have to back pay for Cobra for 2 months. Want a Jan. 1st start date and wants to read about it and also for me to send enrollment instructions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-27 15:08:30', '2018-11-27 15:08:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027213028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991230', 'Earl Gero', NULL, 'Wife called on behalf of husband, wanted to ask a few questions about preventative care , change billing...and husband has been told by Dr that he needs a neck MRI, and she wondered if it was covered.  I told her that I could help find the best priced facility in her area, but that it would be Sedera that will let her know if it was a sharable need or not.  Wife sounded a bit upset and repeated, "so as it stands right now, you and I don''t know if this need is sharable." I said yes, and said that Sedera would, and asked if she wanted to be transferred to speak with them, she said yes. Natalie took the call, no one was on the line...she asked for the number to call back. - Wife says that husband had neck surgery 11-13 years ago and that their primary doctor suggested an extensive preventative MRI as well as a lung function test. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-27 14:31:02', '2018-11-27 14:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027214016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689076', 'Tatum Oman Uhrick', NULL, 'Member called to update payment info via phone. Zoho updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-27 14:17:02', '2018-11-27 14:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027187046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, '11.27.18:  Emailed Karen with answers to some questions she had during our initial discussion.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-11-27 14:11:06', '2018-11-27 14:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027187041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, '11.19.18:  Karen texted me back and said she had time to speak today.  Called her and explained HEP.  Sent her link to funnel. Said she''d review it and get back to me.
Now paying $783 for AVMED and it''s goiong to $898 w/$7,000 deductble.
-Healthy, individual member
Asked if her co. can pay for it - she has a corp.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-11-27 14:09:54', '2018-12-04 12:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027187036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027786067', 'Karen Neice', NULL, '10.30.18:  Texted Karen that Bill asked me to contact her re: HEP. Asked to schedule time to talk.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-11-27 14:08:22', '2018-11-27 14:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361787', 'Cammy Dwyer-Abbey', NULL, '11-17-18 Email communication, " I do have one question about pre-diabetes.  My long term doctor, prior to this year wasn''t concerned about my blood sugar.  She tended to do more than one test to measure my glucose levels.  This year, Kaiser did one test - which shows my A1C is in the pre-diabetic range.  Since then, I am making an effort to eat fewer bad carbs, focusing on proteins, vegetables, and  high grain breads.  I know I need to lose weight.  Will this cause problems with getting to buy in to your insurance?

My husband and I have 2 dogs and we walk them daily for 2 to 6 miles.  Usually closer to the 6.  I generally get 12 to 15 thousand steps on my fitbit so I am not sedentary,  My blood pressure is good.  My Cholesterol numbers are high, but my good cholesterol is also high.  I have only gone to the doctor for my yearly physical and mamogram for the past several years."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-27 13:45:54', '2018-11-27 13:45:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361787', 'Cammy Dwyer-Abbey', NULL, '11-27-18 Cammy is 57,. husband on Medicare and daughter 24 so filing own taxes. Was with Kaiser paying $370 and APTC paying rest. Not tied to Kaiser, not thrilled with them.  Only went to Dr. 4 years ago for non-wellness visit bc of migraine that lasted 1 week. Otherwise healthy but pre-diabetic. Came referred via Patricia Mitchell and chose the $1000 / $249 MPB Group. Just enrolled now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-27 13:44:19', '2018-11-27 13:44:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027230036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220284', 'Michael Kennedy', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-27 13:40:15', '2018-11-27 13:40:15'),
