  ('zcrm_1579374000027197046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, '11-27-18 Just enrolled with MPB and DPC. Figured out application on own with instructions. Called to find out how to show proof of DPC. She''ll ask them to send her an email with the information requested and I''ll forward it along.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-27 11:54:17', '2018-11-27 11:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027189041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Payment returned by the bank.  Double checked and the ABA number was entered in the account field.  Fixed and recharged.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-27 11:32:48', '2018-11-27 11:32:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027233003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Called to see what IUA they are on. Spoke with Patti; they are on Sedera Select $1000 IUA. Ind. + Spouse. They want to add daughter and are wondering the cost.
