  ('zcrm_1579374000027213023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741134', 'Susan Nadeau', NULL, 'Susan called in to ask more in depth preventative care questions, she said that Justin has been doing a great job, but suggested that she give us a call which I did...also I am sending her preventative care e-mails to review.  She sounds very savvy with this, works in a dental office, and our conversation about preventative care made a lot of sense to her.   - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-27 11:26:17', '2018-11-27 11:26:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027213018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000243019', 'Rachel Streater', NULL, 'Rachel reached out to me to try to help find a monitoring device that will wake her up if her blood sugars get to low, she said she really needs it because she lives at home.  Liberty told her that they will not cover it, so I told her that I would do my best to find a good price for her. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-27 11:22:57', '2018-11-27 11:22:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027219028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-27 11:15:32', '2018-11-27 11:15:32'),
