  ('zcrm_1579374000027222024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'I resent email and asked ASi &amp; Sedera to put off the addition of dependents until 1/1 due to member mistake of effective date.  Also had Jennie process refund of $153 for month of December.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-27 10:18:28', '2018-11-27 10:18:28'),
