  ('zcrm_1579374000027222003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, 'Received Change form to remove MEC from this members coverage.  I have terminated member in RCI Portal.  Also changed Monthly Share amount in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-27 09:23:32', '2018-11-27 09:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391005', 'John Colver', NULL, 'Member called in booked his 15 minute welcome call for Monday, December 3, 2018 at 9:30 a.m. mountain time/ 11:30 a.m. eastern time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-27 08:57:52', '2018-11-27 08:57:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027213013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111466', 'Ruscelina Ceiba Winters', NULL, 'Ruscelina Winters Reached out to Vanessa yesterday and said that she wanted to use Teladoc because she had a sinus infection, but said they didn''t recognize her name. Vanessa asked what should be done, I told her that Ruscelina needed to call Teladoc to resolve her issue, Vanessa e-mailed her their contact info. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-27 08:28:29', '2018-11-27 08:28:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027214006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, 'Updated FTNI payment - balance billed for Dec. Member+spouse', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-27 08:20:49', '2018-11-27 08:20:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027213008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024108', 'Kathy Fuerst', NULL, 'Received cancellation request from this member.  Notified ASi &amp; Sedera and will cancel in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-27 07:54:35', '2018-11-27 07:54:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027213003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Issues with Christine''s kids'' pediatrician bills are all set and resolved per Leena. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-27 07:37:19', '2018-11-27 07:37:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027177026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361908', 'Paula Ward', NULL, '11-26-18 Paula is 60 and husband 64. Paula on Bright Health $700 and husband on Freedom Life $330. Paula had fatty tissue in ankle which was Not cancer and was removed this year. Also had prolapse uterus and partial hysterectomy this year. Not worried about any further complications and understand pre-x clause. Bruce has no pre-x and no meds for either of them. Listened to my audio a few times. Knew Patricia Mitchell''s cost with MPB Group. So gave them group pricing since referred in. They are going to Thailand Dec. 17-Jan. 2. Revisiting on Friday Nov. 30th to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-26 16:47:40', '2018-11-26 16:47:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027187031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'called to get prescription med quote form and the provider list sent to them again. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-26 14:16:48', '2018-11-26 14:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027177021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005236', 'Jason Reichert', NULL, '11-26-18 Called to find out if therapist and psychiatric care is a shareable expense. Told him not for his first year of membership. 2nd year costs are shared up to $3K for outpatient services. He gets his meds from GoodRx already as well and they are controlled substances. He has ADHD and depression.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-26 13:38:45', '2018-11-26 13:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027177016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '11-26-18 Family of 4, Shelly-46, husband 48 and daughter 12, son 9. Go to Dr. about 1x per yr per kid for cold or something. PSDHC best for them. No meds, no drugs, healthy, no pre-x. Earned too much last year as both are self-employed and now have to pay subsidy back. Don''t want to go that route anymore. Also considered dental and vision but probably don''t really need either. Almost done with ortho for kids braces, etc. Want Dentist Paul Allen or Ortho Casey Johnson. Go to All Kids Dental in Glenwood Springs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-26 13:22:27', '2018-11-26 13:22:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027207003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640011', 'Rich Piotrowski', NULL, 'Received actual bill on 11/7 after having explained in JULY what was needed.  Doctor coded bill as regular office visit with diagnostic codes indicating 2 conditions.  Doctor refused to re code bill as preventative.  Ellen was very upset.  Wanted every dollar they paid MPowering since they started.  I conducted a three way call to explain what the doctor said on the bill.  She disclosed the bill to me so I was able to discuss the conditions to which the doctor was referring.  This was NOT preventative.  She was a new patient and symptoms/history was discussed.  I agreed to make an exception to get the bill paid.  Ellen was satisfied at the end of the call.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-26 13:18:48', '2018-11-26 13:18:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027177011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654432', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, '11-26-18 Enrolling now is PSDHC $1000 / $340. She only wants eastern medicine chiro, acupuncture, etc., no meds. Complete!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-26 11:40:24', '2018-11-26 11:40:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809001', 'Nancy Compton', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 11:19:30', '2018-11-26 11:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023275014', 'Wesley Dibble', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 11:14:41', '2018-11-26 11:14:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740133', 'Soren Boller', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 11:10:05', '2018-11-26 11:10:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027187023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899120', 'Candi Broeffle', NULL, 'Candi called in to say that she had received a statement from ASI stating that much of her lab work was not covered as preventative and that she didn''t know what to do next because she had never received a bill.  Admittedly so, she said that she is anemic ("I am anemic")- and because of that the doctor usually has to run extra tests.  When asked she told me that the exam and a few tests were covered by ASI, and upon questioning is when she mentioned her Anemia.  She wanted to know if there was anything that "we" could do about the bill, I said that Sedera would not share in it the first year because it was pre existing to her membership, I went over the pre ex sharing guidelines with her.  she wasn''t too pleased, so I asked if she would like to be transferred to Sedera to ask them instead and she said no....I asked if she wanted their phone number, she declined. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-26 11:09:33', '2018-11-26 13:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740180', 'Oliva Basener', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 11:06:23', '2018-11-26 11:06:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027189016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, 'Member called to ask how to cancel.  Sent email with the link to cancellation survey.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-26 10:44:56', '2018-11-26 10:44:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819652', 'Laura Saracini', NULL, 'Spoke to member she is not sure if this medical cost sharing program is for her. Thinking if she will go to more traditional insurance. Asked her if she would like Robin Kemp to reach out to her to go over other plans that are available and she said no. Will get back to me if anything changes. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 10:14:03', '2018-11-26 10:14:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027197003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482076', 'Griffin Gradke', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 09:58:53', '2018-11-26 09:58:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027187018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521350', 'Shane Michael Sorensen', NULL, 'Shane called because Trudi needed to go to the ER yesterday.  They were out skiing and all of the sudden she didn''t realise where she was.  Shane said it was so scary. They put her through EVERY test there is. They showed nothing and then all of the sudden she was fine.  They diagnosed her with transient global amnesia, and the doctors there said she should be fine now.  I transferred Shane on over to Marquis at Sedera.   - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-26 09:58:23', '2018-11-26 09:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000027190018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022060028', 'Brianna Steed', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-26 09:41:24', '2018-11-26 09:41:24'),
