  ('zcrm_1579374000027187008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881479', 'Desiree Childs', NULL, 'Member wanted to be walked through the entire preventative care process , she had many questions but was grateful for me answering them all.   I tried to find a doctor for her but couldn''t- gave her the two options of either nominating the doctor or just paying out of pocket- asking to only pay medicare allowable. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-26 09:20:17', '2018-11-26 09:20:17'),
