  ('zcrm_1579374000026992059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', NULL, 'a doctors office called this morning seeking pre authorization for a nuclear stress test for Dana, I explained that it wasn''t mine to give, Stephanie said that she had already called ASI and they told her to call MPowering.  I tried calling Dana and it rang and rang to voicemail,  I then emailed her explaining the process. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-21 10:14:57', '2018-11-21 10:14:57'),
