  ('zcrm_1579374000026992054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756298', 'Kelly Niess', NULL, 'Kelly called in to find out if she needed to use a doctor that is in the PHCS network and I told her that she did.  She said that it wasn''t a big deal, but that it threw her for a loop because she thought there wasn''t a network, but figured that it was only Sedera that there wasn''t any network. - sending her nomination email.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-21 09:59:32', '2018-11-21 09:59:32'),
