  ('zcrm_1579374000026980008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '11-20-18 Just had few more questions and will enroll soon. I''ll send her new enrollment instructions to use instead of old. Her Dr. Glode is not in-network but she might have to nominate her to be. Practice is in Rifle, CO called Grand River Health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-20 11:36:24', '2018-11-20 11:36:24'),
