  ('zcrm_1579374000026967008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Faith called with coding from the place that did her first ultrasound. The doctor is ordering a mammogram and ultrasound.  After my research and speaking to Guy, we agreed that she was getting the best quote from the original facility that she went too, but that the ultrasound that they quoted was ridiculously high.  and she should book that at one of the two facilities that I found for her.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-20 11:01:49', '2018-11-20 11:08:24'),
