  ('zcrm_1579374000026908023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331067', 'Tessa Manton', NULL, '11-19-18 She never submitted her wellness visit to ASi and didn''t show her card so she paid the whole bill. She also paid $1100 for a biopsy after her mammogram wellness visit. All is fine with it but John instructed her via 3-way call to upload that bill in system as well. Include medical bill including CPT code, not just receipt. She goes to chiro 1x per week or every other week and monthly will be $305 instead of her current MPB Group at $249. Co-Pay $338 which is also significantly more. She will have her mom look at the options and she''ll let me know if she wants to keep this or change to trad. Her income as self-employed will be about $36K so not in the realm of a big subsidy. Cost was going to cost close to the same per month but she seems to think more will be covered with trad for mental health and her back visits. Told her to look more closely since likely will have to reach ded first before ins. kicks in.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-19 15:37:37', '2018-11-19 15:37:37'),
