  ('zcrm_1579374000026908003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447231', 'Susan O''Bryan Kinney', NULL, '11-19-18 Called her back to confirm her enrollment is processing just fine. I told her if she doesn''t receive the Welcome email by the 30th to call me back then. But, she should receive it much sooner. She just needs to cancel her Anthem payment by the 5th of Dec. for her Dec. coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-19 09:58:55', '2018-11-19 09:58:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026900008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'Laura called in to ask if doing the health risk assessment would be enough for her plan not to drop,  I told her what website to go to, she logged in while on the phone. - all set- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-19 09:56:08', '2018-11-19 09:56:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026907003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027962969', 'Patricia Lester', NULL, 'Wants Redirect health plan + Spirit Dental &amp; Vision; Ready to enroll', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-19 09:52:13', '2018-11-23 14:13:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026900003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Kristine called to thank me for the e-mail I sent checking in on her, and was pleased to report that the person she spoke with at the head to heart counseling is having her fill out a form and that they are going to do sessions every other week.  The most amazing news for Kristine was that the counselor is going to write a letter to the judge stating that Kristine is receiving counseling, which is going to save her tons of money in mandated counseling services.  She also stated that she went to church on sunday... again Kristine was very emotional and thankful for all of the help she has gotten through us, Sedera and Head to heart. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-19 09:15:15', '2018-11-19 09:15:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026897003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, 'This member will need to be updated after HES Commissions are run today.  Will update tomorrow 11/20.  FTNI has been set up. Also HES Subscription has been cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-19 08:51:24', '2018-11-20 06:43:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026822003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508151', 'Shelby Hoffmann', NULL, 'Recieved email from P Cholak then an after hours VM from this member requesting cancellation.  Sent out cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-17 07:34:57', '2018-11-17 07:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026775057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340009', 'James Marciano', NULL, 'James called right after his preventative care visit to see a GI doctor and set up a time for a colonoscopy, the doctor told him that it might not be covered because he had one done 3 years ago and polyps were removed.  She gave him two CPT codes to ask his insurance if they would cover them.  I sent Leena and claims dept the question, tagged James, just in case we get an answer in over the weekend. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 14:44:18', '2018-11-16 14:44:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026810027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283041', 'Kelly Noblit', NULL, '11-16-18 Completed enrollment just now for the PSDHC $1500 / $486 member and spouse. They were paying $705 and going up to $810 or so in 2019! She and Grant are healthy, no meds, she hurt arm or shoulder last year. She''s a dental hygienist and does something with Flexis? Chose Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-16 14:36:49', '2018-11-16 14:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026810016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026910079', 'Miranda Czyzyk', NULL, '11-16-18 Listened to my audio 3 times. She had good questions and wants to read more. Needs to decide by next Wed. She''s on Medishare now I think for very low price. So, got connected via Steady MD DPC. Cost for both is significantly more than what she''s paying. Doesn''t like the exclusions for the religious part and now needs to sign off that she goes to church every week. Has some mental health stuff she''s dealing with currently. She''s turning 30 in 4-5 months.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-16 14:32:42', '2018-11-16 14:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026775049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, 'Melissa called in to let us know that she had just gotten pregnant and wanted to know the next steps.  I told her that I would call her back to make sure that the information I would give her is the most up to date.  I called Sedera and spoke to Natalie, she told me that because Melissa found out that she was expecting after Sept change in the guidelines that she would be responsible for the 2 IUA''s not just the 1, so $1,000.  I called Melissa back to tell her the news, she asked if she should just give her obgyn the mpowering benefits or ASI card, I told her that she would be presenting herself as a self-pay patient, and saving the detailed medical bills and uploading them to Sedera on their app.  I am sending the how to video, and I transferred the line back to Natalie at Sedera for an explanation of how things work. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 14:30:12', '2018-11-16 14:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026810011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096791017', 'Peter Lehmann', NULL, '11-16-18 Enrolled and we just changed his IUA to $1500 per his request and he went back in and signed it again. PSDHC for Family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-16 13:48:53', '2018-11-16 13:48:53'),
