  ('zcrm_1579374000026775044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508020', 'Dana Olsen', NULL, 'Dana called in to Sedera and then over to us to cancel her membership that she would like to take effect Jan 1. sent her the form and let Patti know. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 13:34:12', '2018-11-16 13:34:12'),
