  ('zcrm_1579374000026768094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028461003', 'Suzanne Dugger', NULL, 'Redirect Spirit Dental &amp; Vision; Employee OnlyLiz left a VM on 11/13. Contact for payment info: Ron - Agent', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-16 12:57:10', '2018-12-11 09:55:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026775039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033102', 'Scott Byrne', NULL, 'Scott called in wanting help on finding a primary care doctor that could refill his blood pressure medication.  He said he didn''t want to go through his MEC card because the main reason for the visit would be surrounding the medication and a blood test.  He wanted to be sure, so I asked Leena from ASI directly and I forwarded that to him.  I gave him lists of doctors to choose from sent all of the supportive e-mails to go with the subject.  Very thoughtful client. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 12:47:08', '2018-11-16 12:47:08'),
