  ('zcrm_1579374000026775029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'Julie wanted to know that she was doing things correctly with Sedera,  she said that she spoke with someone saying that she would need to pay "half" up front and then would need to submit that detailed medical bill through the Sedera App- I told her that if she was unsure about anything else in the process to give Sedera a call.  She thanked me for the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 10:07:15', '2018-11-16 10:07:15'),
