  ('zcrm_1579374000026775024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, 'Kymberlee is going to bite the bullet and get a primary dr and obgyn for her preventative services. I am going to help get some lists together for her.  She is in Tuscon AZ right now and wants me to start there at 85741 - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 09:50:32', '2018-11-16 09:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026770008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086236', 'Reginald Garrett', NULL, 'Member called in spoke to April.  Daughter hurt her knee, gave instructions on accessing services.  might be making change because daughter is always sick.....', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-16 09:34:02', '2018-11-16 09:34:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026775016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389081', 'Kelly Mills', NULL, 'I spoke with Kelly last night, letting her know that her co-pay card does not cover chiropractic care.  I also told her that she would need pr-approval from Sedera before that chiropractic need would be shared in beyond her IUA.  I went over pre ex simply because she is a Nov 1 start and when she first called she said she needed to make an appointment with a chiropractor because her back really hurt. This morning I sent along the guidelines as promised. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 09:22:44', '2018-11-16 09:26:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026775008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420311', 'Lori Stuart', NULL, 'Lori called in because she couldn''t find any urgent care facilities off of the libertyhealtshare page, I told her that Liberty has no network and gave her loads of choices for urgent care in her area as well as an invitation to use Teladoc with instructions. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 08:57:29', '2018-11-16 08:57:29'),
