  ('zcrm_1579374000026775003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919141', 'Damien Petta', NULL, 'Damien called in because he was having trouble enrolling, it wouldn''t take his phone number.  Patti gave me the news that she got Damien reinstated, and that he doesn''t need to fill out a new form. Client seemed very grateful for the news. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-16 08:01:58', '2018-11-16 08:01:58'),
