  ('zcrm_1579374000026735019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, '11-15-18 She is extremely thorough and asking many, many questions. Called Sedera also and spoke with Brad Holt. She''s going to study it more. She would enroll in the Association. Brad told her they have 12,000-15,000 members! She knows deadline. She wants a Jan. 1st start date. She will contact me when she decides. She even read through 58 page MEC+ documentation and had good questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-15 13:46:39', '2018-11-15 13:49:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026730013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, 'Natalie says that her doctor wants a fatty tumor that is growing near her liver removed.  She had already been doing the correct thing and has been in touch with Sedera, she is going to upload the rest of her bills.  I sent 2nd MD information, and an explanation.  I tried to hot transfer her to them but it went to voicemail.  I e-mailed Dania to ask that someone call her back. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-15 13:37:03', '2018-11-15 13:37:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026735011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283004', 'Phyllis McCarthy', NULL, '11-15-18 Barry is completing app for his wife who is member of DPC. She had a shoulder injury about a year ago, otherwise totally healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-15 12:44:02', '2018-11-15 12:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026730008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389081', 'Kelly Mills', NULL, 'Kelly called with many questions- the biggest one, and what I am waiting on right now is if her co-pay card covered chiropractic care.  I told her that it was something I could not give her a definite answer on, and now, I am waiting on an e-mail from David Shoal.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-15 12:34:33', '2018-11-16 09:19:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026738003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662001', 'Suzanne Delaney', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-15 10:28:45', '2018-11-15 10:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026735003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220284', 'Michael Kennedy', NULL, '11-15-18 Came via Sedera but through Tanya Dueri, my client. They listened to the audio and went through the click funnel and had a good understanding already. Just wanted to verify understanding of # of IUA''s. Tanya was their wedding photographer 10 years ago. He has been independent contractor his entire life but wife was getting coverage through employer and now Cobra for $1300 month for family of 3, including soon to be 9 year old daughter. Enrolling now and deciding which IUA level.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-15 10:25:01', '2018-11-15 10:30:20'),
