  ('zcrm_1579374000026644026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283143', 'Kristianna Simmons', NULL, '11-14-18 Works with Andy and Tommy at Fleur Salon. She has hypothyroid issue and meds affordable. Husband no pre-x and kids good. No tobacco. C4 showed $1400 for them. Paying $357 2018 for just her and going up to $442 for just her 2019. Kids paying $228 in additional on own plan. She is looking at $655/$1500 for Family of 4. Dr. Bryan Kono is in network. Wants to share with husband and enroll on Friday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-14 12:58:24', '2018-11-16 13:21:53'),
