  ('zcrm_1579374000026653036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'Julie needed help with a coupon right away after speaking with Teladoc- Walgreens wanted to charge her $350, I found a coupon that she could use there but it was for $80 and I found a $21 dollar deal for her down the road at Safeway.  She was very grateful for all of the help. I also sent the MPowering Benefits Prescription form.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-14 10:27:17', '2018-11-14 10:27:17'),
