  ('zcrm_1579374000026653031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939079', 'Patricia Mitchell', NULL, 'Patricia was just calling in to make sure that her mammography center was in network, and it was, I then tried to find some obgyn''s for her she said just in case they spot something.  I could not find the doctors in my searches, but she said that it was ok, that she would just call their doctors office to ask. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-14 09:37:58', '2018-11-14 09:37:58'),
