  ('zcrm_1579374000026647008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330090', 'Michelle Preuss', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-14 08:55:29', '2018-11-14 08:55:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026653003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Megan called in about her son Finn''s finger, he has been having a pain in it for about 3 months, and it just isn''t going away.  It is also important to mention that Finn rock climbs.  I sent Megan my searches for best cost for diagnostics that the dr may order as well as a list of hand specialists in her area that they could go to.  She said though that because they are tight on money she wanted to know what to do first.  Because she was having a hard time trying to figure out the best thing to do, I came up with an idea for her to simply have a consultation with someone over at 2nd MD, or even Teladoc- she was grateful for the that info.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-14 08:52:32', '2018-11-14 08:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026647003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023837032', 'Walker Logan', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-14 08:49:13', '2018-11-14 08:49:13'),
