  ('zcrm_1579374000026635003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, 'Pending cancellation. Member owes payments for August, September and October. November payment went through today 11/14/18.
Sent an email to member payments need to be brought back up to speed by 11/15 and payment info updated or membership will be terminated immediately.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-14 08:22:12', '2018-11-14 08:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026625008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033534', 'Nicole Carter McGill', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Survey I email Sedera &amp; ASi and will adjust pmts in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-14 08:18:38', '2018-11-14 08:18:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026625003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662082', 'Samantha Tucker', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation.  I have cancelled RCI and will email Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-14 07:29:51', '2018-11-14 07:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026590013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283098', 'Cecily Runge', NULL, '11-13-18 Cecily is 34 and husband Zach is 35. Just two of them looking at the $500/$521 option with PSDHC option. Cheaper than Group since younger. Moved back to CO from ME. Living in Boulder. Ready to enroll tomorrow. Also enroll in dental discount plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 16:21:53', '2018-11-13 16:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026590008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361747', 'Monika Flurer', NULL, '11-12-18 Heinz was part of Inovashare''s Group with Todd Cloward and they just cancelled their MEC+ with ASi suddenly with no explanation. He had his flu shots and mammogram for his wife scheduled already and had to then pay out of pocket for that. Mammogram cost $298 and cancellation cost would have been $200. Wife is healthy, no tobacco. Moving them to the MPB Group for just wife. He will stay put since he''ll turn 65 in Jan. So not worth moving him for the month of Dec. Wife is 62 turning 63 in April. Appreciative that I''m helping him and cost will be way less than with Todd Cloward who was quoting $649 for just wife which included extra stuff he doesn''t want like an accident policy. Crazy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 15:51:35', '2018-11-13 15:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026590003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, '11-9-18 Ken''s 52, Boulder, self-employed, healthy, no issues, no tobacco, paying $700 with Anthem. Came via Jennika Wildau. He wants to keep Dr. Berger who is now working with Nextera. Now thinking of joining their DPC to keep Dr.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 14:14:25', '2018-11-13 14:14:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026584003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026552012', 'Karen W. Isaac', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 60-64 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-13 13:04:12', '2018-11-13 13:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026562003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, 'Constance called in because she will be needing chemo medications, and was wondering the diffrence between savnet program and us.  I told her that they are pretty different, but that I wouldn''t mind looking on my end to give her my results, and told her that Reid may be able to get a good price for her. Sent prescription quote form. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-13 11:56:42', '2018-11-13 11:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026511016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068058', 'Alden Hagardorn', NULL, 'called in upset about his MEC card not working.  I told him not to worry that his annual physical will be covered by his new card. Patti then explained exactly what was happening.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-13 11:37:38', '2018-11-13 11:37:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026510018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869239', 'Lon Woods', NULL, 'Member''s wife called in and told me that she spoke to someone to cancel last month, however there is no record of a Cancellation request.  Turns out John sent online form to her but it was not opened.  I will cancel going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-13 11:14:22', '2018-11-13 11:16:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026539029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165330', 'David Fenerty', NULL, '11-12-18 Renewed David''s current enrollment for 2019 with Kaiser. Error message showed but enrollment shows up fine.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 10:25:25', '2018-11-13 10:25:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026539024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '11-12-18 Renewed Carleen''s enrollment via C4. Error showed up but then so did enrollment. Looks ok.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 10:24:04', '2018-11-13 10:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026539019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002095005', 'Dustin Spencer', NULL, '11-13-18 Renewed his current policy for 2019. $82.02 and APTC $352.85.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 10:22:34', '2019-02-13 15:06:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026539014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311209', 'Jill Temkin', NULL, '11-13-18 Completed Jill''s app on new enrollment platform. Now reminded John again to grab her info manually to send over to Sedera for completion. He said he''ll work on it. She anxiously awaiting confirmation. I told her it would be done last week at the latest. It''s not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 10:01:07', '2018-11-13 10:01:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026511008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355002', 'Linda Reely', NULL, 'Linda called in with lots of questions...preventative care, help finding a rheumatologist, and what she needed to do if she changed her address one day.  she seemed very anxious and bewildered.  I answered all questions, sent appropriate e-mails and am doing a dr search for her.  I mentioned at least twice that she really needed to have a welcome call and sent the link - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-13 09:49:20', '2018-11-13 09:49:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026539003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810797', 'Chris Massey', NULL, '11-12-18 Healthy, no pre-x. Part of Chris Walzer''s Interior Construction group. Chris Walzer may revisit this next year after more time. Nervous bc of pre-x clause. Chris Massey is not concerned and his child is healthy as well. Ready to roll. He will work on enrollment app tonight since forgot computer on job site. He''ll email when done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-13 09:37:43', '2018-11-13 09:43:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026510013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, 'Since both this member and his wife are applying separately, I will only charge 1 set up.  Still waiting on Proof of DPC Membership', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-13 09:22:02', '2018-11-13 09:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026510008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502023', 'Rhonda Wildman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 60-64 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-13 08:52:53', '2018-11-13 08:52:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026534003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910125', 'Thomas Smith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Will get back to us to make sure he received his ASI card and QR life code card. Member asked how long he has to a file claim I said 6 months. Also sent email on how to submit claim to Sedera. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-13 08:42:47', '2018-11-13 08:44:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026516003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033386', 'Ruth Charles', NULL, 'Leena
Thank you for your response and offer to pay my Dr in full for the annual exam. I had to reschedule my appointment because I hadn’t received a response from ASI and I’m not able to see my doctor until February 21, 2019. My doctors office  is unable to provide an itemized bill in advance.

The fourth charge for the routine colonoscopy in June was from St Paul Radiology for $2750, I believe. I have called them twice to request they bill ASI but I don’t know if this had actually happened yet.

Last Friday I received a bill from Park Nicollet for a mammogram that I had in October. It was for a routine annual test. I called them to verify that ASI had been billed and as of yesterday this had not happened even though I provided my ASI card at the appointment. The Park Nicollet billing rep, Antonio, who I spoke with yesterday had never heard of ASI but accepted all the billing information I provided again from the card. He seemed very confused about this kind of insurance. He also apologized that the intake person had not scanned my card.

Do you have any updated information on any of my charges?

I apologize for the delayed response but I was called out of town to help my brother who was just diagnosed with prostate and bone cancer. His situation underscores the need to have excellent medical insurance and raises my concern that I do not currently have insurance I can rely on.  I received a report from ASI that as of 6/2017 Mpowering Benefits had only 55 participants in the ASI plan. That is very frightening to me! I feel like a pioneer and a test case. This insurance arrangement is unproven.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-13 07:52:47', '2018-11-13 07:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026511003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, 'called to cancel, and asked if she should submit $300 out of pocket expenses to Sedera, I told her that she shouldn''t, and reminded her on the IUA she chose.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-13 07:36:57', '2018-11-13 07:36:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026510003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Evan called in and asked that we remove his daughter from plan today.  Advised him that it would be effective 12/1.  I will send out Member change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-13 07:36:55', '2018-11-13 07:36:55'),
