  ('zcrm_1579374000026492038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, 'Sent email and left message on Sept 27th but no response. Called today and she had not seen my email or message. She has the HRA instructions and said she would complete it tonight.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-11-12 16:44:12', '2018-11-12 16:44:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026454094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294174', 'Mark Schwinge', NULL, '11-12-18 Mark''s 62 and turning 63 in Feb, 2019. He''s w/Medishare now at only $339 a month and $5500 AUA. With us at $1500 IUA it''s $525 mo.  He also can choose former employer option from Delta Airlines which is around $500 month for good coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-12 15:59:49', '2018-11-12 15:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026454089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '11-12-18 Both adults 44 and Laura has 2 bio kids and 2 step kids. Husband uses TOBACCO, but is willing to quit if possible with our AI in the future. Know of the $75 surcharge. They are using Aliera right now and paying $900+ a month. The only thing they have been to the dr. in years is she sliced her finger. Never need to see doctor for any of them. No pre-x. She will email me when they decide which IUA level they want and I will send her email #1 and #2 to attempt on her own.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-12 15:53:53', '2018-11-12 15:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026454084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, '11-12-18 She''s running the numbers one final time. I gave her DPC + MEC price by accident last week. Her cost will be $410/$1500 for parent/child and will need to pay for child in GJ for DPC membership.  She has high blood pressure, high cholesterol AND sleep apnea, all of which is are exempt if well managed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-12 15:48:51', '2018-11-12 15:48:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026454079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447231', 'Susan O''Bryan Kinney', NULL, '11-12-18 Confirmed with Luke she has a 1/1/19 start date. Still need to make sure to eliminate Liberty RX. Emailing Patti now...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-12 15:30:33', '2018-11-12 15:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026457036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979122', 'Kyle Townsend', NULL, 'Kyle called in wanting a quote on life insurance but only if it was included, he wanted to know the cost right away.  I told him twice that I would be more than happy to put him in contact with Jane, and that she could help answer his question. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-12 14:36:08', '2018-11-12 14:36:08'),
