  ('zcrm_1579374000026457031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779589', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Jennifer called into Patti''s office, and I ran to pick it up because Patti was away from her desk.  She initially wanted to know how to go to a Dr''s office  and it not be such a mess as this time has been for her,  she said that she is waiting on the doctors office to answer a call she put in to have a thyroid tesk taken out from the rest of her bloodwork so that the majority could be covered as preventative.  She admitted to using her Cigna card at the visit.. That could be the reason for all of this. She also wanted to know if she needed to do anything at the first of the year.  I told her the protocol and she
 sounded confused stating that she never heard about having to enroll anyone, I told her that it was ok, not to worry, and that she would just need to update her HRA with us corporate, she just kept stating how confused she was, and that there were too many things to remember with her plan. She said that she had understood my clarification of things but that still there was too much for her to take in.  wrapped up. all set.  she called from 720+656-4692 it looks like it may be from the law firm she works. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-12 13:05:48', '2018-11-12 13:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026455036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447231', 'Susan O''Bryan Kinney', NULL, 'Enrollee requested a 1/1 start.  I advised that she contact Sedera and make sure it is right there.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-12 12:43:33', '2018-11-12 12:43:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026455031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, 'Enrollee requested cancellation of Lib Rx', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-12 11:59:43', '2018-11-12 11:59:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026454074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '11-12-18 Single mom, 2 daughters, one about to graduate from college and the other is 17 and only one who will be included. Paying $1600+ now for Anthem and accident policy and $6K ded. Wants HSA for tax benefits even though pays for chiro already 1x every 2-3 weeks. She also wants to learn and possibly get health insurance license to share this with her community!! She needs another source of income and would love to help people. Her husband passed away and she sold their biz and has been doing season PT jobs since. She likes the fact that perhaps time would be maybe 40 hours, not like going back to school which is what she thought. She will get back to me about that. Also can get $100 referral fee for now. I told her cost will increase once reaches 60 but got sidetracked and didn''t tell her how much. Mention in email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-12 11:47:02', '2018-11-12 11:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026457026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006164239', 'Imelda Davis', NULL, 'Imelda called in because she wanted a year to date report for her and her family.  I gave her Jennie''s phone number - before I saw that she is cancelled here. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-12 11:39:34', '2018-11-12 11:39:34'),
