  ('zcrm_1579374000026457003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Lucy called in because all of the sudden there was a cost for the birth control.  We figured out that she hadn''t given them the new RCI card.  I told her that we would get her a PDF copy as well as a hard copy sent to her home.  Patti is working on seeing if she has the PDF copy on her computer. Also she wanted to know if speech therapy was covered at all.  I sent an e-mail to ASI and it bounced back showing that they were closed for the holiday.  I will let Lucy know and follow up tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-12 08:03:34', '2018-11-12 08:06:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026455003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370084', 'Linda Barnwell', NULL, 'Cancellation submitted to Sedera and cancelled in RCI portal.  Will cancel FTNI as well', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-12 07:49:38', '2018-11-12 07:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026454003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006886088', 'Jean Burrola', NULL, 'Member disputed Sept, Oct, and Nov charges with her CC.  Cancelled.  House account no commissions to chargeback from the affiliate.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-12 07:48:22', '2018-11-12 07:48:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026413033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '11-9-18 Kicked off Medicaid for final 2 months. Getting subsidy of around $408-$460. 50 yrs and has pre-x from car accident in knee, neck and back. Needs plan for 2018 and 2019.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-09 16:52:10', '2018-11-09 16:52:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026413028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, '11-9-18 She is very thorough and asked good questions. She had listened to audio and went through funnel. She wanted Guidelines for Sedera and MEC which I supplied. She wants HSA option. She doesn''t want the MPB Group responsibility so choosing Assoc $1500 / $278, $125/$25. We will revisit next week on Thurs to enroll if she chooses to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-09 16:34:07', '2018-11-09 16:34:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026413023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675058', 'Anthony Peck', NULL, '11-9-18 Anthony (50''s) and Paula (60''s) are ready to go. I didn''t even finish explaining utilization of membership and he wants to sign up as part of MPB Group. He and Paula are healthy. He does have well managed high cholesterol and takes celebrex for his knees. Paula takes HRT. Go to Dr. 2x in last 3-4 years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-09 15:08:19', '2018-11-09 15:08:19'),
