  ('zcrm_1579374000026413018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220214', 'Min Kaess', NULL, '11-9-18 Min and family are healthy. Both adults 33, kids 4 and 7 months. Paying $1250 Cigna 2018 and going up to $1500 2019. Looking to piece together kids on trad, adults on STM plus indemnity and accident plans to be around $700 with high ded and mop. Not ideal! Likes this option and deciding between PSDHC and Co-Pay bc 4 yr old had Urgent Care, ER, strep visits this year. Met ded bc of pregnancy. Also had minor car accident last year. Looking to travel intl this year. Dr. Virginia Taylor and Dr. Cynthia Frederick are both in PHCS network. Meeting again next Wed for possible enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-09 14:08:08', '2018-11-09 14:08:08'),
