  ('zcrm_1579374000026394028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870023', 'Zulma Fuller', NULL, 'I verified that Dr Charles Goldstein is in network for Zulma to go see for preventative care. I spoke to Jennifer at MultiPlan for the info.  I called Zulma to tell her the news. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-09 11:35:30', '2018-11-09 11:35:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026413008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, '11-9-18 Healthy, father is Minister so there''s a tax law that allows no taxes on home so his family has never paid taxes for their home and saved tons of money. So, understands there are unique laws and loopholes such as what we are doing for the group. More comfortable with doing health assessment than referring. He''s on Silver Kaiser plan now that the full cost is $400 Silver HMO with significant subsidy but sometimes has to pay it all back. Super interested in tax benefits of doing HSA for 2018 and 2019, so wants Dec. 1st start date. Had IBS 10-15 years ago but no treatment, no meds, had endoscopy and nothing to report from long ago. The annual wellness visit they typically do some blood work. Told him to ask dr to code it as wellness if possible. He also takes meds for anxiety when flies on airplanes. Super interested in this and we will reconvene next Wed. to enroll in likely the $1000/$249 MPB GROUP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-09 11:01:14', '2018-11-09 11:01:14'),
