  ('zcrm_1579374000026394018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798119', 'Rashke Catlin', NULL, 'heard back with the latest on Rashke''s bill and e-mailed her an update.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-09 10:14:54', '2018-11-09 10:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026394013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', NULL, 'Peyton called saying that she did not receive her MEC cards yet, and that she had called 3 times preivious on the matter, I gave this task to Vanessa and she reports that the PDF copies were sent out on Oct 30th at that time, the request for hard copies to be sent was also made.  She was told that it would take 10-14 days for them to arrive, and we are not at that point yet in the calendar.  Also, Vanessa tried calling but the line sounded like a fax machine, she e-mailed Peyton instead. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-09 10:08:46', '2018-11-09 10:08:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026406013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book the 15 minute welcome call online. Resent email to her as requested. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-09 10:04:33', '2018-11-09 10:04:33'),
