  ('zcrm_1579374000026394008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798119', 'Rashke Catlin', NULL, 'I put in a request with ASI to have someone that works in billing to let me know the status on Rashke''s lab work bill. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-09 09:03:59', '2018-11-09 09:03:59'),
