  ('zcrm_1579374000026394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508120', 'Christopher Newpower', NULL, 'Chris called requesting the link where his wife can search for a facility for mammogram. Sent the list- explained how it works.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-09 08:01:26', '2018-11-09 08:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294236', 'RuthAnne Schedler', NULL, '11-8-18 Leaving job Jan. 31st. Has high ded UHC plan which will cost $1025.19 for Cobra. She''s 56 and son 19. Son has mental health depression and anxiety but paying out of pocket for those visits. Takes anti-depressants and anti-anxiety meds which cost about $100 a month. Goes to Coal Creek Family Medicine and docs in network. Also Dr. Lisa Talamantes is in network. She wants to compare this to trad ins. as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 18:19:43', '2018-11-08 18:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '11-8-18 Re-enrolled for 2019 into Bright Health Bronze Perks (I think). She gets a $43 APTC and cost is about $253 a month now. Enrollment complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 18:10:14', '2018-11-08 18:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, '11-8-18 Hi Wendy!  I got your name from Rob &amp; Cindy Glowczewsky.  I am interested in getting this Health Sharing plan in lieu of the health insurance I currently have with Cigna.
Can you let me know how to apply?
It would be for me and my husband, Jim.
Thanks!
Pam', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 16:38:14', '2018-11-08 16:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, '11-8-18 Debbie came via her DPC in FC Dr. Jennifer McCabe Lentz. Dr. Lentz uses Sedera herself and referred her to Sedera and Luke referred her back to me. Debbie''s daughter is in school in GJ and will need her own DPC. Nextera is there and Appleton Clincs as well. Both charge $100 month for membership for adults. Debbie and I will talk again on Monday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 15:56:44', '2018-11-08 15:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '11-8-18 Dave wants to enroll now for MPB Group for Family. Arn Rasker got in a terrible motorcycle accident this year and everything was paid for above is IUA. Had a great experience in the process. Dave has a 3 1/2 year old  and wife is 52. He''s leaving for N. Carolina next week to watch his daughter while wife works. I sent him app instructions to complete tomorrow on his own.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 15:16:30', '2018-11-08 15:16:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, '11-8-18 Cathy is looking at this for her 2 employees. Cathy is on husbands ins. Roxanna, 34 or so, can''t afford half of $525 but should be able to afford half of ours at $269 a month with the $1500 IUA. Marissa 41 had a bad car accident and medical is getting covered by other ins and is in litigation right now for it. She has back and neck injuries. The Re-Direct or Co-Pay Network may be a good option for her. Cathy wants to decide how she will pay for a portion of the monthly cost. She wants to put money into an HSA but Marissa may choose non-HSA option and she''ll have to figure out how to handle the payments and taxes associated. Wants a Dec. 1st start date. Neither of them have ACA compliant health ins now and will be penalized. But, this one month of Dec will lessen the penalty. Looking at the $1500 IUA level.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 14:53:26', '2018-11-08 14:53:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026341008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005322038', 'Kelley Winovich', NULL, 'Member filled out change of payment form. Payment info updated on Zoho Subscriptions and payment processed on 11/8/18.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-08 14:21:01', '2018-11-08 14:21:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Leena informed me that because the doctors office is being difficult (like they have in the past) she is going to give Marc a check with what is for him as well as for the clinic.  Leena e-mailed Marc instructions as well as gave him a call about this.  Also, the reason for this is that he told them that he was a cash paying patient and said he had no insurance.  Leena confirmed that he said that twice, but saw it as just a rookie mistake. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 14:20:50', '2018-11-08 14:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, 'Denise wanted to know when she should cancel, also she said that she still was waiting to hear back from John.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 13:38:22', '2018-11-08 13:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447231', 'Susan O''Bryan Kinney', NULL, '11-7-18 Lives in Aspen and paying $1700-$1800 month for Anthem with $6500 Ded! Just had hip replacement and other hip is in great condition. Not anticipating needing another. In great health otherwise. Her sister in an infectious disease Dr. in Boulder so gets help from her if ever needed. Has an HSA already and fully funds it. Attorney for career. She was sort of diagnosed with hemacromatosis long time ago at Mayo Clinic but many drs. since have said she doesn''t have it and no symptoms ever. Enrolling in MPB Group as Alicia''s 1st referral. Going to apply on own since had to run off to court now and leaving for Moab at noon on Friday. Tent meeting on Mon in case she has trouble completing app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 13:11:09', '2018-11-08 13:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026365003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899588', 'Lisa Maxwell', NULL, 'Sent member provider info for a colonoscopy per her request.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-11-08 13:03:31', '2018-11-08 13:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026337048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335359', 'Benjamin Roth', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-08 12:22:03', '2018-11-08 12:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026337043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335310', 'Taylor Smallwood', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-08 12:00:31', '2018-11-08 12:00:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677458', 'Susanne Kortals', NULL, 'Sabine (daughter) sent a $100 for an orthopedic specialist bill to us asking if it could be submitted for reimbursement- I explained why it  wouldn''t be just yet.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 11:16:03', '2018-11-08 11:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', NULL, 'YES!  Team John, Kelly, and Leena!  ASI paved the way to finally get a facility that can do both bone density and mammogram tests...all done, all set   I also broke the news that the calcium coronary test would not be covered as preventative.  -I ended call by transferring her to Sedera to check the status of a migraine claim need. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 10:37:15', '2018-11-08 10:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335359', 'Benjamin Roth', NULL, '11-8-18 Ben listened to my audio and his mom Katie Roth is a member already. He''s applying now. He''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco. He did have hernia surgery recently but otherwise hadn''t been to dr. for at least 5 years. No problems. He''s choosing the $1500/$269 Assoc option. Had Anthem for about $270 in 2018 but that plan is ending and he can''t renew.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 10:16:56', '2018-11-08 10:16:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078004', 'Jason Scheier', NULL, 'Jason just calling in with questions concerning Sedera''s coverage because his blood work came back with too many red blood cells.  lots of pretty generic questions. I gave him Sedera''s number, I told him that he should call them after he see''s the specialist. Also sent him the NEEDS e-mail.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 10:06:34', '2018-11-08 10:06:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026343003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354096', 'Toni Slagle', NULL, '11-8-18 Toni is looking at 3 other health sharing options and they are all about $100 cheaper a month. They don''t have HSA compatibility but I suspect she''ll use one of those instead. :-( She did not want to tell me what ones she was looking at.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-08 09:58:15', '2018-11-08 09:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508120', 'Christopher Newpower', NULL, 'Chris called in to ask if he can cancel at any time, I told him that it would need to be before the 20th of the month. He said he just wanted to know and that he is just shopping around. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 09:50:43', '2018-11-08 09:50:43'),
