  ('zcrm_1579374000026299083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870023', 'Zulma Fuller', NULL, 'Zulma called in because she was trying to find a doctor off of the Multiplan list and everyone she was calling said that they didn''t accept MPowering Benefits as an insurance.  I explained to her what happened and sent the script along to her, I asked her to call back if she had further questions. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-08 07:24:08', '2018-11-08 07:24:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026324044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '11-7-18 "After giving this a lot of thought, I have decided to stick with my current plan. With that in mind do I have to do anything or does it just re-new automatically? 

