Carolyn"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-07 19:14:27', '2018-11-07 19:14:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862186', 'Suzanne Nadeau', NULL, 'Suzanne called in because she wanted to get Sedera''s address so she could send her bills- upon further conversation it sounded like she had some other thing she needed to speak with them about- I transferred her to Natalie @ Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-07 15:04:36', '2018-11-07 15:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026324039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993065', 'Johanna Lindau', NULL, '11-7-18 She has a baby on the way due in Dec. She''s 37 and Joel 42 and Amaya 2 1/2. All healthy but Joel did have a neck injury recently with x-rays. She wants to see comparison to reg ins. as well. Paying only $510 for insurance now bc claimed about $60K  or so, she''s not sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-07 14:58:29', '2018-11-07 14:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026299073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006781019', 'Debra Spry', NULL, 'Patti asked me to do a Liberty search for a urologist in Debra''s area- I did not find anything off of Liberty''s site, but - I did however send Debra an e-mail of instructions of what to ask when calling. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-07 13:31:55', '2018-11-07 13:31:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026324018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165362', 'David Blair', NULL, '11-7-18 Considering dropping to the Anthem HSA Bronze for $449 a month or stay with Silver at $632 a month with current plan. I''m thinking HSA option will be best if he has a better year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-07 12:46:12', '2018-11-07 12:46:12'),
