  ('zcrm_1579374000026324008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, '11-7-18 Rod has a hernia and needs to see the doctor right away. He wanted to understand what to do. I told him the process and to ask friend''s for recommended doctors. I also gave him Concierge line to call for assistance. He''s good to go for the moment. Understands to go in as self-pay patient.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-07 11:28:41', '2018-11-07 11:28:41'),
