  ('zcrm_1579374000026299003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Samantha and I spoke at length this morning about her Daughter''s condition.  She hadn''t yet heard back from Sedera,  and she was worried.  Also, pretty confused about preventative care/Apex- and when the lines blur into preventative care.  I answered all of her questions- and told her that she should call over there at 10:00 because they are located in Texas.  She was really grateful for all of the help. I sent Sedera''s phone number as well as who I had spoken to over there as reference.   I told her that I would be crossing my fingers and asked to know how it goes. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-07 07:30:57', '2018-11-07 07:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026276003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899588', 'Lisa Maxwell', NULL, 'Member doesnt have a computer at home and was unable to access the checklist during the welcome call.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-06 16:33:50', '2018-11-06 16:33:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026274021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025001057', 'Dawn Champion', NULL, 'Dawn was just anxious to get started, I sent her a welcome call scheduler, as well as a copy of the Sedera welcome packet because she didn''t like the fact that it was texted to her and she couldn''t actually read it. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-06 14:43:27', '2018-11-06 14:43:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026274013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033212', 'John Brausen', NULL, 'John wanted to know how to go about preventative care visits- I gave him the run down, and sent 2 supporting e-mails. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-06 14:22:54', '2018-11-06 14:22:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026274008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416052', 'Emily Mellinger', NULL, 'Emily called to submit an x-ray as a claim.  I asked why he had an x-ray done, she said because his back was hurting badly and the chiropractor ordered it.  I went over their IUA- that this would go towards it, but that if the chiropractor wanted to do a treatment plan, he would have to write it down for Emily to submit to Sedera for approval first. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-06 14:16:38', '2018-11-06 14:25:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026241033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Alexander has had back issues they''ve been treating with chiropractic, massage, and PT.  Nothing has provided relief.  Explained about the potential issue of pre-existing condition.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-06 14:10:22', '2018-11-06 14:10:22'),
