  ('zcrm_1579374000026241028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003189041', 'Terry Ede', NULL, 'member called in to cancel.  Said he called in August.  Sent link with instructions.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-06 12:58:29', '2018-11-06 12:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026274003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve called in with his APEX card showing as cancelled, I told him that was because he was switched to ASI Oct 1- I requested cards from ASI, went over where to submit his wife''s mammogram bill, and sent a provider link as well.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-06 12:48:18', '2018-11-06 12:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026207041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, 'Member submitted an address Change form.  Address has been changed w/ASi, Sedera, Zoho &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-06 12:13:24', '2018-11-06 12:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026241023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'member called in regarding coverage for a flu shot.  told her it is and to have the pharmacy call for verification.  If she has to pay, get a copy of the bill and i''ll help her submit it.  Also had questions regarding new pricing.  Told them it goes into effect June 1st and we would be sending information out well before the change date.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-06 11:47:51', '2018-11-06 11:47:51'),
