  ('zcrm_1579374000026260011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785064', 'Joshua Pentkowski', NULL, 'jennie@myahe.orgTue, 06 Nov 2018 11:27:59 -0500
"Josh Pentkowski" <joshpentkowski@gmail.com>
"Patti Baron" <pbaron@mympb.com>
Dear Mr. Pentkowski,

I called you and left a voice mail this morning.  The billing date for December is on 11/22/2018.  We have delayed the October and November payments for you.  It is our policy to cancel any member who has not paid by the 5th of each month.  Delaying your payment to 11/15/18 is not possible.  I will not trigger the overdue November payment for today as previously arranged.  If you would like to make a payment via credit card please call the office to make the payment.  1-855-816-4650 ext 504.  


Kind regards,

Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-11-06 09:29:20', '2018-11-06 09:29:20'),
