  ('zcrm_1579374000026207008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151133', 'Tara Washburn', NULL, '11/5 this member called in and wanted to know why she was charged after cancelling w/Liberty.  I advised LHS does not share with us cancellations.  I advised htat I would refund her pmt and cancel her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-06 08:51:40', '2018-11-06 08:51:40'),
