  ('zcrm_1579374000026231003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781175', 'Christian Mueller', NULL, '11-5-18 Looking into this for employees to pay for by themselves. They are looking to pay for the cost of Appleton Clinics DPC and possibly work into paying for MCS component in a year from now. All of their employees seem to have different wants and needs. So, they are hoping/trying to offer some base level of benefits.  He thinks they have 3 possible employees who will be interested in this, one in 20''s, 50''s and 60''s. One person is above 50 and uses tobacco and has no intention or interest in quitting. Chris listened to my audio already but will also continue to learn more via the site. I sent him the DPC specific email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-05 15:37:43', '2018-11-05 15:37:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026224018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', NULL, 'I gave Dana an update about what is happening behind the scenes for her preventative tests.  She seemed happy that I had asked ASI about her Mammogram and  bone density tests.  - sent her the e-mail that Leena sent over the weekend. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-05 14:40:55', '2018-11-05 14:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026224013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'Katherine called in because the doctor was seeing something pop up on her L breast, he would like her to do another diagnostic mammagram on the left breat with an ultrasound to follow.  She wanted to know if it would be considered as preventative.  I told her that it would not, then she gave me different examples of how it COULD be, so I told her that I would call her back to make sure that it was diagnostic rather than preventative.  I spoke with John and then called her back, that it would be considered diagnostic rather than preventative, and went over her IUA and gave her an option to either speak with Sedera right away so that they could go over the process with her or to just give her their number.  She took their number.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-05 13:51:35', '2018-11-05 13:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026220013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209150', 'Lisa Humphreys', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 IUA Age 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-05 13:43:59', '2018-11-05 13:43:59'),
