  ('zcrm_1579374000026224003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605467', 'Sandra Walker', NULL, 'I called Sandra to let her know about the Lyrica coupon and prescription assistance plan that John had found for her. She was very grateful for all of the help.  I told her that if she needed some help with the application to give me a call and I would help her.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-05 12:44:35', '2018-11-05 12:44:35'),
