  ('zcrm_1579374000026162021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, '11-2-18 Just called Heather to help with prescriptions and she said she''s all set. She spoke with Concierge and they helped her. She said she just had a freak out for a moment and all is well now. Super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-02 14:53:15', '2018-11-02 14:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026155018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006970007', 'Janina Freund', NULL, 'Janina called in because she wanted to make sure that her doctor was in network so that she could have an annual exam. PLUS she wanted a new card issued to her.  I transferred her over to "Shayla" at Liberty Healthshare. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-02 13:48:36', '2018-11-02 13:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026168003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'Sent member Good Rx coupons per request. Member stated during the Welcome call that she felt the plan was overwhelming, and she also started crying. John and I reassured her. ASI called for new cards and new Mpowering Benefits card sent.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-11-02 13:47:20', '2018-11-02 13:56:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026162008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '11-2-18 Holly and Greg are nervous about Greg''s past cancer but he had his thyroid removed (I think) which means the same cancer can never come back so they aren''t concerned about that. She will also send a list of medications for me to price out inlcuding for Ryan''s Krohn''s disease. They love the MPB Group prices since they were referred by Tanya Dueri.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-02 13:42:41', '2018-11-02 13:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026167003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001936053', 'Christina Patton', NULL, 'Member sent an email about problems with 24alife. Resend her a 24alife invitation and sent her an email to let her know.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-02 13:29:06', '2018-11-02 13:29:06'),
