  ('zcrm_1579374000026162003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361828', 'Andrew Papantoniou', NULL, '11-2-18 He''s super healthy, never sees a doctor. Only thing he''s had was a ski accident at 17 yrs old.  Got the highest rating for life insurance recently. Currently has ins through BCBS but he''s getting divorced and paperwork should be done in about a month. He likely will need a 1/1/19 start date. I sent him enrollment ins. but he knows they might be different by the time he''s ready to enroll.  He just wants to decide which IUA level to choose.  He had a HSA in the past but it''s now controlled by his wife. He''d need his own new HSA. Looking at dental discount plan too for $11.75 a month in zip code 22204 or 20036. Open to seeing a new dentist.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-02 10:45:02', '2018-11-02 10:45:02'),
