  ('zcrm_1579374000026155013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610303', 'Lauren Rathbun', NULL, 'Lauren called in to update her address, I guided her to the online form.  She asked when she would be contacted about renewing her membership, I told her that it would be in December if not sooner than that, she asked if there would be any changes to the plan, and I told her that there would just be some changes in the guidelines, I sent her the latest Select Guidelines. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-02 09:44:50', '2018-11-02 09:44:50'),
