  ('zcrm_1579374000026155003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Kristine called because she is going through a very difficult time and wants to go ahead and use the counseling service through Sedera.  I also told her to expect Teladoc''s mental health service at the first of the year.  She thanked me for listening to her and helping her with everything. I am going to check on her next week.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-02 09:15:50', '2018-11-02 09:15:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026143023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299275', 'Shing Kwo Cheung', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-02 09:12:28', '2018-11-02 09:12:28'),
