  ('zcrm_1579374000026093011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959004', 'Marilyn Davis', NULL, '11-1-18 From: Mike <michael1davis@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, Nov 1, 2018 at 2:54 PM
Subject: Re: confirmation
To: Analisa Cleland <analisa.cleland@gmail.com>


"Yes, it will work and save me money. My only consulting contract may end in Dec. so I need to reduce the mo. cost of coverage. I will let it ride and tell BH I will cancel starting 12/1. Good idea and thanks for sharing!

Mike"</analisa.cleland@gmail.com></michael1davis@yahoo.com>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-01 16:04:52', '2018-11-01 16:04:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026093003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165390', 'Viki Lawrence', NULL, 'Total cost - $1.97. Turning 65 in Nov. next year. I''ll connect her with Andrea later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-11-01 15:47:52', '2018-11-01 15:49:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026090003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207073', 'Sara Nolan', NULL, 'Called in looking for an obgyn.  did search, sent results along with a copy of her card.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-11-01 13:17:38', '2018-11-01 13:17:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026084013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Called &amp; left VM for Mr Flynn asking for wife &amp; son''s SS# advised that I will pend the application until I receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-01 12:51:20', '2018-11-01 12:51:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-01 12:50:30', '2018-11-01 12:50:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'John asked me to call Elena to see if her Lotemax prescription was chronic or short term.  She said that she and her dr are hoping that this round will work, and that she won''t have to be on it for more than the bottles worth.  Her $60 coupon did work, and she is feeling much better.  She was thankful that John had searched for a better price but did not want the information at this point,because she doesn''t see herself needing anymore than she already has. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-01 11:30:04', '2018-11-01 11:30:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017981058', 'Maria Quinones', NULL, 'Maria called in because she had to go to the emergency room due to vomiting and diarrhea. She called in to submit a claim, I transferred her to Elizabeth at Sedera, because I felt she would need the needs processing explained to her in spanish.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-01 11:22:44', '2018-11-01 11:22:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026084003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439212', 'James Backes', NULL, 'Spoke to member and he asked me if all was straightened out with his enrollment per Sedera whole family is on now.  Also had them remove Lib Rx. per Scott.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-11-01 10:34:49', '2018-11-01 10:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, 'Dave called in stating that he had a lengthy conversation with Liberty healthshare and that it didn''t make sense to continue with us.   I guided him to the cancellation form, but.  I am going to reach out to Wendy to see if this might be a flip situation. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-01 09:23:10', '2018-11-01 09:23:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026058008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-01 09:16:48', '2018-11-01 09:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033417', 'Lauren Magin', NULL, 'I searched healthgrades.com to get a few lists of Endocrinologists in Lauren''s area.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-01 08:37:34', '2018-11-01 08:37:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026058003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830370', 'Michele "Shelly" Valinttine', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-11-01 08:32:01', '2018-11-01 08:32:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, 'sent an e-mail to check in with Isabelle to ask about Mark. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-01 08:05:07', '2018-11-01 08:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752112', 'Dana Marangi', NULL, 'Dana said that she had talked to John yesterday about how to find a doctor off of the Multi-plan site for preventative care.   She did remember how last time I spoke with her in June, I told her how to nominate a naturopathic Dr.  she admitted that she was disuaded by the doctor office that it would be a "long process"  now fast forward, the doctor still isn''t on the list.  I went over how the doctor would need to code everything as preventive  and that she may have to pay out of pocket- going over ALL of the protocol that goes along with it.   She thanked me for the help and said that she will call me back if she needs any help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-11-01 07:20:20', '2018-11-01 07:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026026003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, 'Member submitted a new change of payment form. Info updated on FTNI.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-11-01 07:19:56', '2018-11-01 07:19:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026000032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026023246', 'Kristy Barber', NULL, 'She called to give me her routing # and I just left her a vm now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-31 17:08:38', '2018-10-31 17:08:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026000024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354115', 'Cheryl Roether', NULL, '10-31-18 Cheryl had breast cancer and lumpectomy in 2011 and takes estrogen blockers now. I told her the pre-x clause and cancer clause. She''s well aware of risks. Darrel has high cholesterol meds. Darrel 62 and Cheryl 59. Cheryl is a CPA and wants to understand MEC+ component and see max out of pocket attached to make it compliant. She wants the HSA version for tax purposes most likely even though could benefit from Co-Pay network and cost isn''t much different. She see''s a dermatologist, oncologist, eye dr, dentist, etc. They have 2 sons, one 20 and dependent in school and the other independent on own and 24. He might also need coverage. She and husband both take sleep meds. Paying $1700 now. Association plan PSDHC or Co-Pay best bc of age and health status and dr. visits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-31 16:05:19', '2018-10-31 16:05:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Sent link for registering with Teladoc', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-31 14:58:34', '2018-10-31 14:58:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025986028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025055122', 'Mark Wallman', NULL, 'Jacqueline called in with her husband wanting to know where everything she has been promised was, and that she needed to do her welcome call while her husband was home.  I told her that she didn''t have everything yet because she won''t until the mid-end of month.  She stated that her plan starts tomorrow. I told her that she could have her welcome call with Liz if she''d like. I transferred the line over to Liz.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-31 14:47:43', '2018-10-31 14:47:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'Spoke to HMA.  First Lauren in claims processing then Gloria in the concierge dept.  explained the issue, she said notes indicated provider was out of network.  We checked and provider is in network.  She said she''d call me back.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-31 14:06:07', '2018-10-31 14:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-31 13:44:11', '2018-10-31 13:44:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, 'Melissa submitted Change request to add her husband Jay.  Will bill her an extra $199 also let Sedera &amp; RCI know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-31 13:31:49', '2018-10-31 13:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025986023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called in so that we could find her the best price on a neuclear stress test with thallium contrast- her hospital gave her a quote of $618 and an extra $120 for the thallium contrast.  John reminded me that she should see if Sedera could help out in finding the facility themselves. I called her back and then hot transferred her to Marquis over at Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-31 13:25:35', '2018-10-31 13:25:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023491049', 'Lok Hang Au', NULL, 'Submitted Change Form to Redirect.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-31 13:15:27', '2018-10-31 13:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000026000008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354096', 'Toni Slagle', NULL, '10-31-18 Toni is 29, healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no alcohol, no alternative docs. Open to using HSA, self-employed, cost on marketplace will be $320. She doesn''t need membership until Jan. 1st. Knows of deadlines and my accessibility.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-31 12:57:46', '2018-10-31 12:57:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025986018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594050', 'Stephen Yost', NULL, 'Stephen called to ask about preventative care.  I helped him find his Dr. Nunnelley in network.- I went over preventative coding- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-31 11:33:52', '2018-10-31 11:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025986013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Samantha called to ask a few easy questions, and then to ask if her daughter, Sydney could get a breast reduction, because it is harming her health.  I spoke with Natalie at Sedera, and she needed to to ask one of her Surprivisors about the case.  She came back and sent that Samantha would need to open up a need for Sydney, and that Sydney''s doctor would need to write a letter to Sedera explaining why the surgery is necessary.  I explained all of this to Samantha and told her the Sedera app that she needed to use to open up the need.  She was pretty happy after we spoke.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-31 11:15:02', '2018-10-31 11:15:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025986008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Mary called to confirm that everything she was doing as far as getting her preventative wellness services.  I made sure to show her how to make sure she was looking for doctors and services under the PHCS network. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-31 10:29:22', '2018-10-31 10:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025975018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819507', 'Brian Teske', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-31 10:19:30', '2018-10-31 10:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025975013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, 'Spoke to member Sean will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-31 10:15:58', '2018-10-31 10:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025975008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402045', 'Aida Bukovica', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-31 09:43:22', '2018-10-31 09:43:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023491049', 'Lok Hang Au', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation survey next called and asked when he could expect his refund.  I advised him that I would get that out to him today as he just submitted yesterday.  Also asked how he could rejoin at a later date, I advised that he would have to reapply.   I have cancelled further billing will notify Redirect &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-31 09:21:22', '2018-10-31 09:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025986003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024247', 'Barbara Hull', NULL, 'Member requested info on coverage through 24alife. Sent her an email attaching Jane and Concierge.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-31 09:19:00', '2018-10-31 09:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025975003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, 'Sent out today 2nd QRLife code that member requested for husband. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-31 09:02:02', '2018-10-31 09:02:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959066', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-31 08:29:30', '2018-10-31 08:29:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025959004', 'Marilyn Davis', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA 60-64 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-31 07:54:18', '2018-10-31 07:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033417', 'Lauren Magin', NULL, 'member called in regarding a recommendation by her doctor that she see an endocrinologist.  I explained the process to her.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-31 07:37:12', '2018-10-31 07:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025902028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038052', 'Paul Squier', NULL, 'Member filled out a change of payment form. Payment info updated on FTNI. CC processing fee removed since he switched to a bank institution.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-30 14:05:02', '2018-10-30 14:05:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025902023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment info form. Payment info updated on FTNI', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-30 13:56:53', '2018-10-30 13:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025911029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026023246', 'Kristy Barber', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-30 13:56:45', '2018-10-30 13:56:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025911021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005832003', 'Renee Shott', NULL, 'Received &amp; attached Cancellation Survey will cancel Subscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-30 13:31:53', '2018-10-30 13:31:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025908028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038052', 'Paul Squier', NULL, 'called to update banking info. told him where to find forms. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 13:08:31', '2018-10-30 13:08:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025908023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, 'She called in to make sure that we fix how we misspelled her first name it is JENIFER , also wanted to change her banking info- she wanted to see where to find it online, so I guided her there.  Wanted to know how much her out of pocket with normally be- so I reitterated the amount from Wendy''s notes.  I also spoke to her about how important the welcome calls are, BUT it may be a bit confusing doing it all now, and is better when more of everything is sent to her  and she can lay it all out and make sense of everything that is being presented on the call. she appreciated that. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 13:05:07', '2018-10-30 13:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025908018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, 'Isabelle, called in because her Husband twisted or broke his ankle so badly that he hasn''t been able to move since.   Isabelle wanted to wait on going to the er right away because they wanted to know exactly what to expect fnancially before being seen.  They have a Dr apt for 2:30, and see if he recommends any sort of imaging.  I gave her Sedera''s number, but I told her to hold off calling them until the doctor says something first.- Isabelle said that she loves our program and that it warms her heart that she can call and get so much support.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 12:52:04', '2018-10-30 12:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025921023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007057004', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, 'conducted sharebox review, instructed Erin on how to resolve unpaid bills.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-30 12:14:19', '2018-10-30 12:14:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025921018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', NULL, 'Bills submitted to Sedera.  Bridget told me Dana opened case and bills are being processed.  Member services will be reaching out to Dana.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-30 12:12:55', '2018-10-30 12:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025908013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474303', 'William DeForge', NULL, 'e-mail I sent to ASI- What can you tell me about William DeForge''s bill.  I just received a call from the doctors office- she said that their office DID code their bill as preventive, but it was kicked back by you all and that there was a note stating that they should contact Sedera.  It was for a basic exam- but that he was diagnosed with acid reflux.   I asked if that was pre-existing.  The woman stated she didn''t know, she didn''t go through his history.  Then she wanted Sedera''s info to submit the claim there.  I explained how illness or injury - IUA''s - so on and so forth work.  

Can anyone shed some light on this one???', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 11:55:45', '2018-10-30 11:55:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025908008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191003', 'Isela Gonzalez', NULL, 'Wow- she calmed down after I told her what we DO offer, but said that she doesn''t have the $50 to keep going with our services.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 11:46:47', '2018-10-30 11:46:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025921013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447129', 'Bruce Mayer', NULL, 'Received information from Leena at ASI that the Quest bill has been sent to be repriced.  This should be the end of it.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-30 11:40:12', '2018-10-30 11:40:12'),
