  ('zcrm_1579374000025908003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called in for a refresher on his plan, I went through pretty much everything, sent e-mails that went with the topic  to help him understand.  Thankful for all of the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 10:10:55', '2018-10-30 10:10:55'),
