  ('zcrm_1579374000025807016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809003', 'Tommy Turner', NULL, 'Tommy called in because blood work came back from his annual physical and his liver count was high.  His doctor is now asking him to go to a nephrologist.I asked him if he had any signs or symptoms of this and he said no, that he was just in for his annual.  I told him that the bloodwork would go towards his IUA of the $500 and then tried to hot transfer him over to Sedera so that he could get his needs processing started.  No one answered the phone and I left a message for someone to call him back.  I am going to send sedera sharing needs e-mail and prescription medication link as well. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-30 09:09:34', '2018-10-30 09:09:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025872008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603129', 'Amber Kingsley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-30 08:53:04', '2018-10-30 08:57:02'),
