  ('zcrm_1579374000025872003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent out today additional QR Life codes for wife Tammi and Daughter Sydney as member requested. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-30 07:52:09', '2018-10-30 09:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025850018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, '10-29-18  Looking at C4 vs HEP it''s a wash depending on their income for 2019. At $40K (APTC$253) the cheapest Silver Kaiser is $139 and Cigna $161. Adding Jay is $199 to HEP at $1500 IUA. If income goes up like they are hoping then numbers will be pretty equal and won''t have to worry about income level. Both kids are on CHP+ now and confirmed with Tania at C4 that is true and in good standing. Melissa also has membership with Team National that gives her some discounts on things like Teledoc, vision, dental etc. She will discuss with Jay tonight and call me early tomorrow. Jay needs to start Nov. 1st since lost coverage Sept. 1st. I may need to get him STM for Nov.  Also for 2019 it still looks like a wash with their potentially higher income.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-29 15:41:17', '2018-10-30 11:25:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025860008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025370020', 'Patricia Druckman', NULL, 'Sent Sedera welcome packet per member''s request', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-29 14:59:56', '2018-10-29 14:59:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025808044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010492001', 'Anabella Aguilar', NULL, 'Anabella had a slip and fall over the weekend and wanted to know the process.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-29 14:05:55', '2018-10-29 14:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025808036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340009', 'James Marciano', NULL, 'James called in asking to take his wife and kids off current plan and switch them to Self directed access plan - $5000 IUA - member and children.  Quoted 259.  Want''s Jan 1st as date to make the change.  Left James a message with pricing.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-10-29 14:04:27', '2018-10-29 14:04:53'),
