  ('zcrm_1579374000025808031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822390', 'Lillian Chatham', NULL, 'Lillian said that she spoke with a Teladoc Dr- and they recomended that she see a hand specialist for one of her hands- something about 2 of her fingers.  I went over her IUA, 2nd MD, and all of her options.  I sent a list of hand specialists, as well as pricing in her area for an MRI- I also had an idea of maybe speaking to someone at 2nd MD to guide her as to tell her what to do first- the MRI or seeing a specialist.  I also told her that if she knew she was going to go over her IUA to give Sedera a call to let them know what was going on.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-29 11:04:38', '2018-10-29 11:04:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025849018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716025', 'Richard O''Krepki', NULL, 'Sent email and left message regarding HRA.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-29 10:48:18', '2018-10-29 10:48:18'),
