  ('zcrm_1579374000025850003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654371', 'Valerie Igler', NULL, '10-29-18 Val 46 and husband 50. Husband has insulin diabetes but only sees dr. 1x per year. They have paid for insulin in the past on their own and got it for $100 or so a month. Pay only about $10 with Kaiser but paying $1660 a month for entire family. Husband is self-employed. They used to have an HSA but no longer. She didn''t understand that it''s great for self-employed people. Husband also has high blood pressure meds. Priced out PSDHC for family. Wonder if ReDirect could be good for husband?', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-29 10:38:11', '2018-10-29 10:38:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025849003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659941', 'Keith Kravec', NULL, 'sent follow up email and left a message regarding HRA', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-29 10:31:42', '2018-10-29 10:31:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025827008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'Member called because he is very confused by his plan.  He is having a hard time getting set up.  Could not get Teladoc setup. Mentioned that he got the wrong letter from RCI.  Talked to John and was waiting for a return call.  Was never called back. 
Kelly tried to calm him down. He is setting up a new call with Vanessa.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-10-29 10:11:44', '2018-10-29 10:39:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025808026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'Chris called to see if he and his wife can get a flu shot at their daughters pediatrician. I said that as long as it is coded as preventative and the doctor is in network. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-29 09:30:22', '2018-10-29 09:30:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025807011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025825017', 'Christopher Bradley', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 18-29 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-29 09:25:34', '2018-10-29 09:25:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025808021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'Julie called in asking about psychological testing for her daughter so that she could get treatment for behavior issues.  I told Julie that her ASI would not be covering something like that. BUT that Sedera is now sharing in mental health and new diagnosis up to $1500.  I hot transferred her over to LaShanda at Sedera.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-29 08:54:51', '2018-10-29 08:54:51'),
