  ('zcrm_1579374000025791008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, '10-26-18 They want the cheapest option for Jay. Only need to add Jay by end of month since lost coverage Sept 1st. 2 kids are on CHP+ already and Melissa on HEP Assoc. Make sure APTC is correct for just 1 family member needing plan. Cheapest Cigna ia $161.45 at $38K income but thinks it could be $42-$43K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-26 15:53:50', '2018-10-26 15:55:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025743018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979001', 'Janice Wilson', NULL, 'Janice called in to see if we offered any discount on gym memberships.  I told her that we don''t as of yet.  I will reach out to Fadi about her.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-26 14:44:55', '2018-10-26 14:44:55'),
