  ('zcrm_1579374000025791003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '10-26-18 Brooks - 652 56 3557, Beck 652 40 2041.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-26 12:49:03', '2018-10-26 12:49:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025743013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659288', 'John Kovach', NULL, 'John called for help with a labcorp bill he received in the mail- I am going to ask Leena if she has already received the bill there and to add more insight on what to do next.  I got a wonderful compliment from John today- he said that it is open enrollment, and sure there are other programs that are foolproof to use, but they just love being able to speak to someone when then dial a number.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-26 12:45:37', '2018-10-26 12:45:37'),
