  ('zcrm_1579374000025726003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870078', 'Suzanne Donner', NULL, 'Suzanne called in wanting to know about how to go about submitting bills and how to go about the whole process.  I sent over the needs submitting how-to e-mail as well as transferred her to LaShonda at Sedera for further instruction. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-26 07:35:28', '2018-10-26 07:35:28'),
