  ('zcrm_1579374000025710023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '10-25-18 Completing her application now for PSDHC Assoc plan at $1500 / $472 member / children.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-25 16:03:36', '2018-10-25 16:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025710018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '10-25-18 Kim will likely keep same Bronze Anthem HMO plan which the cost will go down slight if keeps income the same. She''s going to calculate her income and get back to me if it''s more than 10% different. Has same drs. so best to leave it all alone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-25 14:40:41', '2018-10-25 14:40:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025717003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Maureen called because she wanted to go to the doctor because of a UTI and wanted to make sure that she was presenting herself correctly. Firstly I offered her Teladoc to utilize depending on the severity.  She wanted to see a doctor and have a UA done. So self-paying- ask for case discount, ask to pay 130% medicare allowable.  all set. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-25 14:09:23', '2018-10-25 14:09:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025704035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'I explained what Sedera handles and what MEC handles.  She now has a better idea of how plan works and was happy at the end of the call', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-25 13:26:36', '2018-10-25 13:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025695008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937151', 'Janae Sowards', NULL, 'Tried to mail a 25$ risk assessment check to member, it came back with a note ''no such street''; emailed member and she responded they moved so address updated on all portals', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-25 12:45:17', '2019-05-01 08:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025710013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026023246', 'Kristy Barber', NULL, 'Kristy is 38 and frustrated bc on Bright Health PPO HSA $6K ded and most of her drs. are not in network so she pays cash anyhow. Self-Employed. Was paying $331 a month. $1500 IUA / $269 mo. Only goes to Dr. for annual wellness checks every year. Just had some sinus problems and did muscle testing to include some supplements in diet to support her system. Came to me via Doreen Fitzgerald. Follow up meeting on Tuesday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-25 12:26:05', '2018-10-25 12:26:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025704030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'Received voicemail from Natalie @Sedera letting me know that member called in and needed help with a bill fro ASi.  Member was very rude when Natalie told her that she needed to call ASi.  Asked me to reach out to her.  Left VM for her to find out what exactly issue was and will get her to right person.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-25 12:18:10', '2018-10-25 12:18:10'),
