  ('zcrm_1579374000025414034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014765004', 'Samuel Berryman', NULL, 'Misty called in with all kinds of questions, but mainly how her husbands food is getting worse than it had been, they thought that it was planter facitus, and were using all sorts of wraps and he was doing all sorts of stretches, but they havn''t been working, and now they would like to see the same doctor that did Samuel''s surgery about his foot now. They wanted to know the process. First I asked when all of this started.  Misty told me about 6 months ago.  I went over the 36 month look back with Sedera- I told her that if there is just a hair bit of more time that Samuel has been dealing with this that it will effect whether or not Sedera shares in this need or not.  she understood.  I went over the 2nd MD process as well as gave her the app that she will use to upload the medical bills if need be and if they get to the point of surgery, even if they hadn''t yet gone over their IUA they should call Sedera right away.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-22 08:38:52', '2018-10-22 08:38:52'),
