  ('zcrm_1579374000025414011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, 'I will refund $274 (difference between $607 &amp; $333 redirect price) for month of October.  I finally received form on 10/20 from Christine.  I will cancel her as well,.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-22 06:49:42', '2018-10-22 06:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025421008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389187', 'Kenna Crampton', NULL, '10-20-18 Kenna is enrolling now in the $1500 / $269 as 30 year old. She is healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, only 1 wellness visit a year which she typically goes to Planned Parenthood.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-20 13:09:21', '2018-10-20 13:09:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025421003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389187', 'Kenna Crampton', NULL, '10-20-18 Playing phone tag. She possibly wanted a Nov. 1st start date but just had some questions and confusion with website. I left her another vm today to try to help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-20 12:28:03', '2018-10-20 12:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025418003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, '10/17 spoke with Christine and after Sedera agreed to raise her IUA she did not think the price difference was enough.  She will most likely cancel.  She wanted to remove her children however we did not receive that form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-20 08:17:10', '2018-10-22 06:47:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025414003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, 'Kelly received a call from Paul today.   I called him back and he explained he was having trouble enrolling on our website.  I tried a couple times with him and no issues but he continued to have the sames issues.  I ask him try a couple different browsers and clear his cookies.  I will call him back and if he still has problems would help him get enrolled.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-10-19 20:07:38', '2021-03-24 09:56:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025400013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006164031', 'Nugent Moses', NULL, 'called because he received a notice that a payment did not go through.  also- wanted to know everything about our services. I will speak to Jennie on monday about this. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-19 15:05:13', '2018-10-19 15:05:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025400008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, 'Ron gave him a call back, he had a lot more questions - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-19 13:43:57', '2021-03-24 09:56:26'),
