  ('zcrm_1579374000025397013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756054', 'Ricky Simmons', NULL, '10-19-18 Ricky has high blood presssure and is working on improving. He''s 63 and pays $40 to a DPC practice locally already. So he''d be best served with the DPC option. He does not have any health ins. right now. Just recently hired by Dale Cranney. They would join the Assoc. membership since only group of 2.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-19 11:43:43', '2018-10-19 11:43:43'),
