  ('zcrm_1579374000025400003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, 'Paul called in and didn''t want to give his name, nor the name of the sales person he had been speaking to previously.  I got all the info I needed off of the caller ID, he wanted to know if he waited til December to enroll, would the price be lower and would the tax pentalty go away.  I told him previous times that I could have someone in sales call him, or if I had the name of his salesman I would have them contact him to help answer his question. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-19 10:26:55', '2021-03-24 09:56:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025379018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', NULL, 'Called member for her scheduled 15 minute welcome call. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-19 10:24:30', '2018-10-19 10:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025397003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026964001', 'Madalane Donnellan', NULL, '10-19-18 Matt had bladder cancer and has been clear for 3 years but still too risky to put him on this. His wife Madalane is healthy and no pre-x, only sees dr. 1x per year for wellness. They had an HSA at one point and he likes it. Wife is 57 and only drinks half glass of wine at night, no smoking. Matt makes the decisions and controls the situation, so just spoke with Matt. He''ll look it over and likes what he hears. Knows the deadlines and was thinking Jan. 1st start until I told him to fund his HSA in 2018 and he likes that idea to sign up earlier.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-19 10:03:38', '2018-10-19 10:03:38'),
