  ('zcrm_1579374000025321021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480033', 'Christopher Walzer', NULL, '10-18-18 Chris Walzer and Keith (Elizabeth Daly''s husband) is looking to offer this to their employees. They currently have a trad plan and only 7 emp on the group out of 14. They also have 10 sub contractors that they''d like to share this with to join the Assoc. They have Great retention with their employees because they offer health ins and IRA, etc. Their avg. age is 45. Getting on the older end bc emp stay for 10-20 years. NO tobacco in group! Mostly healthy and active due to their job. Chris does have asthma that he pays for the meds already. They want to pay up to $450 per employee and then employee pays rest. Therefore, he would really pay the entire employee cost and famliy members would only be the difference of greater cost. Chris currently has a Bronze plan. 1 emp will be on Medicare soon. ReDirect option will be best since many of them go to chiro and they want their wellness visits of course. Emailing census and ReDirect email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-18 16:57:19', '2018-10-18 16:57:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025321016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, '10-18-18 Her current address is the Lexington, KY address showing above. Her permanent address is Sarasota, FL which I told her to update with us when she moves back. But, she''s at school in KY for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-18 16:16:16', '2018-10-18 16:16:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025334021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568113', 'Andrea Stein', NULL, 'a pharmacy called in because Andrea handed her the mpowering benefits card as well as her Liberty card.  I explained to the pharmacist how we assist with prescription drugs here at MPowering Benefits and told her to let Andrea know that I would be sending her via e-mail a prescription medication quote form.  Andrea did receive the e-mail. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-18 14:35:27', '2018-10-18 14:35:27'),
