  ('zcrm_1579374000025321008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '10-18-18 Nelson and ex husband of Julie but she still helps him with these things. He''s basically healthy, just has restless legs syndrome and takes med every day, also takes cialis for ED. He pays out of pocket for Cialis. He goes to Roaring Fork Family Physicians and Dr. Kimball Spence IS in network. He is super tired of the disgusting prices and challenges with trad insurance in the Valley and willing to take the risk with this. He''s enrolling right now with the Association PSDHC at $1000 IUA / $340 just like what Julie chose.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-18 11:40:09', '2018-10-18 11:40:47'),
