  ('zcrm_1579374000025335018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', NULL, 'Tried the phone number several times and it goes straight to fax machine. Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-18 11:31:43', '2018-10-18 11:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025334008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010634229', 'Denise Spencer', NULL, 'Denise wanted to know how to submit over $800 in dermatology bills to ASI,  she had 2 pre-cancerous legions removed. I tried to tell her that ASI would not cover it because it wasn''t considered preventative.  I then added that Sedera would have covered some of it, but that admittedly this was pre-existing,  and that they would not share in it because the time of service was withing the first year.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-18 11:25:21', '2018-10-18 11:37:23'),
