  ('zcrm_1579374000025335003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740001', 'Margaret Johnson', NULL, 'Member''s mailbox is full. Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-18 09:09:58', '2018-10-18 09:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025334003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535046', 'Leland Traylor', NULL, 'Leland called in because he has elective surgery next week involving a hernia repair, he wanted to know if he could get a negotiated quote from ASI concerning this.  I then tried to explain how ASI and Sedera are different and used for preventative care and the other for injury/illness , this frustrated him.  I asked if I could transfer him to Sedera, so that they could help and he said that he already went through the whole process (2nd MD and Sedera) and that they gave him a negotiated rate, but that maybe he could get a better price through ASI.  He was amendment about the fact that ASI offers more then preventative care and that we should utilize it.  I offered to e-mail Leena and tag him in the loop, this seemed to make him happy.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-18 09:08:15', '2018-10-18 09:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025332008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member needs the MEC for a period of time to be compliant will charge her for MEC until she cancels', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-18 08:59:24', '2018-10-18 08:59:24'),
