  ('zcrm_1579374000025294065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474088', 'Terry Lopez', NULL, 'I called Kerry at Swedish Health and gave her the the fax number so that she can send in the claim for the doctor visit, she said that it will take about 1-2 days to be faxed.  I called to let Terry''s husband know.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-17 14:48:39', '2018-10-17 14:48:39'),
